window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3801,"title":"Chapter 3801 Blatant Favouring (1)","paragraphs":["3801 Blatant Favouring (1)","“Everyone, elders, don’t get excited, listen to me...Elder Wei, he is also doing it for the sake of the family! Although this proposal is indeed against the family tradition, it is indeed inappropriate, but after all, it is a good intention. But , please rest assured, Moying’s fiancée will definitely be selected from the noble daughters of the Ancient God Clan!”","For Li Shihong, the patriarch, balancing the relationship between the various branches of the family is his most important duty.","So, he immediately spoke to appease the excited elders.","At the same time, he did not forget to say a few good words for Li Zhengwei, and comforted everyone in every possible way.","!!","After the elders took this reassurance, their attitude softened significantly. When facing Li Zhengwei, they were not so harsh.","But there are still some people who are not at ease.","Li Yuntao said: “Patriarch, let’s just decide directly. The young master’s wife is selected from the family’s heavenly geniuses, and there is no need to consider other women from the Ancient God Clan. The younger generation in our family can be said to be Yin flourishes and Yang declines, before the young master came to Amethyst Paramount Palace, most of the heavenly geniuses in the clan were women, and there were quite a few beauties among them, enough for the young master to choose.”","“That’s right, that’s exactly what it should be!”","“In the past, the patriarch of the family married other protoss women because there was no suitable candidate in the family. This time, there are so many women of the right age in the family, so there is no need to ask for help everywhere!”","As soon as Li Yuntao’s words came out of his mouth, everyone immediately responded with unanimous voices.","Because, what he said was exactly what other people wanted to say the most.","If all the girls from other ancient god races could be excluded from the candidates, then the girls from their own branch would have a much higher chance of winning.","Everyone looked at Li Shihong eagerly.","But this time, Li Shihong didn’t respond right away, but thought for a while, then frowned and said: “I also hope that Moying’s wife comes from the daughter of the family, but you also know Moying’s character, what he doesn’t want to do , No one can force him to do it. If he doesn’t like these women in the family, then he will definitely have to go to other protoss to find suitable candidates, and I can’t guarantee you this.”","Elder Yu immediately said: “So, as long as whose daughter can get the young master to agree to marry her, the family will agree?”","Li Shihong nodded slowly.","When everyone heard this, they became a little excited.","If it is said that Li Moying’s fiancée is only chosen based on her cultivation and talent, then except for Li Zijun who can compete with Li Leyun, everyone else is basically useless.","However, from Li Shihong’s point of view, the most important condition is that “the young master likes it”, so there is a lot of room to play in it.","Although the female talent in their branch is not good enough, maybe it just caught the eyes of the young master?","Li Shihong is a shrewd person. Seeing everyone’s expressions, he guessed their thoughts completely.","He immediately said: “Everyone, no matter what you are going to do, you must remember Moying’s character. He has always been stern with women. Even if my family, Le Yun, provokes him, he will be mercilessly treated by him.” Get rid of it. You better be careful.”","The elders didn’t like to hear these words, and the smile froze on their faces for a moment.","However, they all had to admit that what Li Shihong said was absolutely right!"]},{"number":3802,"title":"Chapter 3802 Blatant Favouring (2)","paragraphs":["3802 Blatant Favouring (2)","“Female... Female Devil, they are gone! Those guys at the door are finally gone!”","As soon as Little Wang Cai landed on the ground, he turned into a cute little boy and started shouting loudly.","Li Moying immediately said: “Well, you did a good job! I’ll get someone to cook you some delicious chicken legs later! Liu Buyan, did you hear that? There’s no one outside, you can go now!”","For the first time, he felt that this bird boy who twittered all day long and spoiled his good deeds actually looked so pleasing to the eye!","As expected of being raised by his clan’s Little Li’er, she was quite capable.","Liu Buyan didn’t respond yet, Huang Yueli’s face darkened, and she couldn’t help but turn her head and stare at her husband.","She turned to Little Wang Cai and asked, “You were outside just now, did you hear what Patriarch Li and the others were saying? Why didn’t you leave after staying at the door for so long?”","Little Wang Cai glanced at Li Moying subconsciously, but didn’t speak immediately.","But his performance like this made people even more suspicious.","Li Moying immediately had a bad premonition, and just wanted to stop him from continuing, but Huang Yueli couldn’t wait to urge him, “What’s going on? Were they talking about Moying? Come, tell me what they all talked about. Say it and you’ll be rewarded with chicken wings!”","When Little Wang Cai heard it, his mind was filled with food. What a windfall! Today, not only were there chicken legs, but also chicken wings! What a pleasant surprise!","For the sake of food, he didn’t care about anything else, so he immediately said what he just heard in detail.","“Well... just now an old man said that he thought it would be good for the Great Demon King to find a female doctor as his wife...”","“What? Someone actually said that?”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan were both surprised.","Li Moying was very calm, and nodded, “This person really has eyes, did you see who it is?”","Little Phoenix widened his eyes and thought about it for a while, then said hesitatingly: “This, this... was just an old man with a long beard and grey hair...”","The three of them were speechless for a while.","The Elders of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, except for Li Yuntao and Li Yunhai who were younger, were all grandfathers with long beards and grey hair.","Little Wang Cai’s words are the same as if he didn’t say them. They still don’t know who was speaking for them!","Huang Yueli pursed her lips in dissatisfaction, “I’m just saying, eating too many chicken legs will make you stupid! According to the <<Guide to raising a Phoenix>> , if you want your phoenix to grow up smart and cute, you must feed it clear spring water and fresh leaves! He’s been spoiled rotten by you!”","As she spoke, she glared at Li Moying.","In the past, every time Li Moying bribed Little Phoenix to do something, he would give it chicken legs.","So much so that every time Little Phoenix got hungry, he would use Huang Yueli’s news to go to Li Moying’s side to cheat for food and drink.","However, Li Moying doesn’t have any knowledge of taking care of kids. Whatever the child wants to eat, he can eat it!","Li Moying was stared at again inexplicably, feeling that she was too innocent.","“Little Li’er, why are you staring at me? Just now, it was you yourself who said that you want to give this brat a chicken wing!”","“I...”","Huang Yueli suddenly remembered what she said just now, and was at a loss for words.","She glared at Li Moying in dissatisfaction.","This man actually dares to accuse her now, and even exposes her! Hmph, when he recovers, let’s see how she treats him!","Liu Buyan was overwhelmed by the ambiguous atmosphere between them, and wanted to leave immediately.","“Alright, it’s time for me to head back, I’m still refining some pills in my pill furnace!”"]},{"number":3803,"title":"Chapter 3803 Blatant Favouring (3)","paragraphs":["3803 Blatant Favouring (3)","He raised his leg and was about to leave.","But at this moment, Little Wang Cai called out again.","“Wait, I haven’t finished my words yet! Those old men just said a lot, didn’t you listen?”","Liu Buyan had already stretched out one foot outside the door, but immediately retracted it.","!!","Listening to Little Wang Cai’s tone, it seems like there was still some important gossip!","He had to listen to this!","So, even though Li Moying signalled him to leave quickly with his eyes and stared at him several times, Liu Buyan was still unmoved, and even found a seat and sat down, pretending to be listening attentively.","“Little Wang Cai, don’t tarry any further, tell me quickly!”","Little Wang Cai raised his chin, and said rather frightenedly: “Since you have asked the question sincerely, I will reluctantly tell you...”","Next, he truthfully narrated the argument that took place outside the door.","Although Little Wang Cai still can’t recognize who those Elders were, one thing was still very clear, that is, most of the senior officials in the Cloudy Qilin Clan hoped that Li Moying’s wife was selected from the clan.","After listening to Little Wang Cai’s words, Liu Buyan immediately smiled gloatingly, “Tsk tsk, let me just say, how could the Cloudy Qilin Clan change so casually, and they even agreed to let a female doctor be your wife? Sure enough, I guessed correctly, these ancient gods are superior, and they all speak high-soundingly, but they are all for the benefit of their own clan, Young Master Li, it will not be easy for you to subdue them!”","When Li Moying heard this, his eyes were dim and he gave a cold snort of disdain.","Liu Buyan saw it very accurately. He grasped the crux of the problem from Little Wang Cai’s totally disorganised narration.","Of course Li Moying himself understood this better.","However, he was confident that he had enough strength to pound some wisdom into these so-called Elders who want to turn the world upside down under his nose. It’s a dream that would never come true!","Liu Buyan added without fear of death, “Speaking of which, this marriage is really the best solution. No matter which branch it is, you have to support your son-in-law! Anyway, the Patriarch of the Ancient God Clan, which one doesn’t have a wife and a few concubines? Tsk, your talent is so high, it is not difficult to marry them all in so now all the problems are solved and there will be no bloodshed! As for you, you will also enjoy the blessing of being equal...”","After Liu Buyan finished his deliberately provocative words, he suddenly felt his body soaring into the air!","“Ouch!”","He let out a cry of surprise, his eyes blurred, and when he came back to his senses, he had already fallen on the flower bed in the courtyard.","Although Li Moying was obviously merciful when he made the move, he didn’t get hurt very much, but the flower bed had just been watered and the mud underneath was wet. When Liu Buyan fell, he was still on his face. This time he really had a mouthful of mud!","“Hahahahaha... It’s so funny! It’s the first time I’ve seen someone fall like this! Hmm... Uncle, is mud delicious?”","From behind Liu Buyan, there was a loud laugh from a brat.","He got up from the ground with a dark face, turned his head and glared at Little Wang Cai.","It’s a pity that in Little Wang Cai’s heart, he doesn’t have the intimidating power of Li Moying. The brat was not afraid of him at all, and he was still laughing so hard that he couldn’t straighten his waist.","Liu Buyan spat out the mud in his mouth, and said coolly, “Look behind you.”"]},{"number":3804,"title":"Chapter 3804 Blatant Favouring (4)","paragraphs":["3804 Blatant Favouring (4)","Little Wang Cai puffed his cheeks, “Don’t look, don’t try to lie to me, aren’t you afraid that I will laugh at you?”","Liu Buyan snorted and laughed. He wanted to tease the little guy, but with this smile, the mud on his face fell down.","When he thought of his own dignity, he didn’t want to show off.","“Yeah, I’m afraid you’ll laugh at me, but at least I know that I’ve been kicked out, unlike some people who have been kicked out and don’t even know it!”","Little Wang Cai frowned, still at a loss, “What... what do you mean?”","Seeing Liu Buyan kept looking behind him, he finally couldn’t hold back his curiosity and turned his head away.","Upon seeing it, he immediately jumped up angrily, “Ahhhhhhh, I’m locked out of the door!! It’s you who are talking nonsense, why was I kicked out too, no, I’m going back to find the Female Devil!”","Behind, the door of Li Moying’s room was locked tightly.","It was only then that Little Wang Cai realized that he was also locked out, so he rushed over and wanted to knock on the door.","But he just took a step forward when Liu Buyan grabbed his clothes by the nape of his neck.","“Alright, don’t make trouble for the two of them, otherwise, if you are also thrown out by Li Moying, I will definitely laugh at you!”","Little Wang Cai’s face froze, and he was like an eggplant beaten by frost, and was dragged away by Liu Buyan.","In the room, Huang Yueli heaved a sigh of relief when she heard the noise outside subsided.","She turned her head and went in to stare at Li Moying, “Aren’t you too cruel to Senior Brother? He just has a bit of a bad mouth, but he’s still on my side!”","Li Moying snorted coldly, “He can say anything else but if he said that we are not compatible, that would be seeking his own death!”","How dare he ask him to have a wife and a few concubines and even told him to take all those women in and create his own harem!","If his clan’s Little Li’er believed his nonsense, then he wouldn’t be able to clean himself up by jumping into the Yellow River! Liu Buyan clearly has no good intentions!","Huang Yueli shook her head helplessly.","Ever since the two fell out in the lower realm in this life, they have always been at odds, and they quarrel when they meet. She was used to it.","“Alright, now that everyone has left, can you take a good rest? Stop looking around, lie down quickly and close your eyes.”","Huang Yueli helped him lay the pillow flat, and pulled the corner of the quilt for him. Seeing that he was still looking at her with those charming peach blossom eyes, she couldn’t help but blushed slightly, and urged him.","Li Moying pursed her lips, “I can’t sleep, come up and accompany me.”","The corner of Huang Yueli’s mouth twitched, “I’m going to check on my Senior Brother’s alchemy! Go to bed first.”","When Li Moying heard this, his Little Fox was going to wait for Liu Buyan until he fell asleep! This was not bad!","Now he was even more unwilling to sleep alone, so he asked Huang Yueli to come up to accompany him.","In desperation, Huang Yueli could only take off her boots and coat, climbed onto the bed, and lay side by side with Li Moying on the bed.","Due to Li Moying’s current condition, even if they were on the same bed, they couldn’t do anything.","However, when the familiar scent of his beloved was so close, Li Moying’s impetuous mood suddenly became calm.","At the same time, he was hit by a wave of tiredness.","The sound of even breathing came from beside her, and Huang Yueli turned her head to look in surprise.","She thought it would take a long time to coax this man to sleep!"]},{"number":3805,"title":"Chapter 3805 Unexpected Advancement (1)","paragraphs":["3805 Unexpected Advancement (1)","But who knows, Li Moying fell asleep just after she lay down...","Huang Yueli’s eyes fell on Li Moying’s face, and she was reluctant to look away.","The curtains were drawn in the room, and the light was a bit dim, but Li Moying’s perfect facial features were still extremely dazzling.","He closed his eyes tightly, and leaned his head in Huang Yueli’s direction, with a rare relaxed expression on his face.","!!","Compared to when he had a more sombre expression usually, he looked young and innocent ..","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but raise her hand, pinched his face, and secretly sighed that her husband’s skin was so good, it feels so good!","Originally, she just wanted to lie down with Li Moying for a while, and when he fell asleep, she would get up and do things.","But who knows, seeing Li Moying’s sleeping face, she also began to feel sleepy, and unconsciously, she also fell asleep.","...","From that day on, the news of Li Moying’s awakening quickly spread throughout the Amethyst Paramount Palace.","And as the saviours of Young Master Li, the status of Liu Buyan and Huang Yueli had also risen, and they have become objects of reverence for all members of the entire Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Some disciples of the Cloudy Qilin Clan would even salute them from a distance when they saw the two of them.","This also made Huang Yueli re-acquainted with the status of a god-level genius in the clan.","After Li Moying started cultivating the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual”, he made rapid progress. It only took three days to have some success and he could already move freely.","However, Li Moying did not announce the news. Only Li Shihong knew the news of his recovery so soon.","He still lives in seclusion every day, does not see any outsiders, and has been cultivating in the courtyard.","Huang Yueli knew well that her husband was cultivating so hard because he wanted to recover to his peak strength as soon as possible, or even go one step further, so that he could become a blockbuster in the God Realm’s Grand Meet, and he also planned to vent his anger for her on that day.","However, Huang Yueli already had a revenge plan in her heart, and she didn’t intend to let her husband stand out.","Her own plan was also related to the God Realm’s Grand Meet.","So, during this time, she has been working hard to cultivate.","Liu Buyan was the only one left. Seeing these two people working so hard, he was really at a loss.","He thought that after Li Moying recovered, the young couple who hadn’t seen each other for a long time would stick together every day, and worried that they could not follow what he said and avoid excessive intimacy.","But who knows, the reality was completely different from what he imagined.","Li Moying and Huang Yueli cultivated, cultivated, cultivated from morning till night.","They only meet each other when they have two meals in the day, once in the morning and the other in the evening. They even cultivated all night.","“Could it be that this is the gap between a real genius and a mortal? These two people cultivated too hard, right?” Liu Buyan frowned.","For someone like him who was a little lazy by nature, this kind of cultivation intensity was simply unimaginable. Except for alchemy, he will have such enthusiasm, and he can’t sit still for several hours for normal cultivation.","Li Moying originally planned to cultivate like this until the day before the God Realm’s Grand Meet.","However, plans can never keep up with changes.","Within a few days, news of his awakening spread throughout the Amethyst Paramount Palace.","Because...he successfully broke through to the late stage of the Heart Profound Realm!","The fluctuations in the profound energy of the heavens and the earth that were caused at that time were too intense, and soon everyone in the Amethyst Paramount Palace felt that it was unusual."]},{"number":3806,"title":"Chapter 3806 Unexpected Advancement (2)","paragraphs":["3806 Unexpected Advancement (2)","That day, when Li Moying broke through, Huang Yueli was also cultivating.","However, the profound energy of the surrounding world continued to fluctuate, which quickly woke her up from the meditation process.","Just as she was wondering what happened, there was a knock on the door.","“Junior Sister, Junior Sister! Are you there? Come out quickly, Li Moying is about to advance!”","“What?? Advance?” Huang Yueli’s eyes widened, and she was also very surprised.","Although Li Moying had already told her last night that he was on the verge of breaking through, both of them felt that it wasn’t long before Li Moying broke through the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm, so it might not be that easy to enter the late stage so soon. Moreover, this will easily lead to a weak foundation, which may not be a good thing.","So, they discussed it, and Li Moying finally decided to suppress it, and wait until a few days before the God Realm’s Grand Meet before considering a breakthrough.","The words were still echoing in her ears, Li Moying broke through in just half a day?","Huang Yueli was a little suspicious in her heart, she quickly jumped up from the bed, opened the door and ran out.","Although she believed in Li Moying’s strength, as Li Moying’s wife, she was still very worried about what would happen and had to watch her personally to be at ease.","Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan stood in the courtyard, watching Li Moying’s room worriedly.","Amethyst Paramount Palace was originally a treasure land carefully selected by the Cloudy Qilin Clan, surrounded by rich profound energy of heaven and earth.","But now, with the progress of Li Moying’s advancement, these profound qi are further gathered, and for a while, the entire sky was enveloped by an increasingly powerful pressure.","Over Li Moying’s hut, a huge Qilin apparition gradually condensed.","This apparition was full of thunder attribute energy, and the whole body emitted a blueish purple lightning.","Even though Huang Yueli was quite a distance away, she could still clearly feel the sense of oppression and suffocation that was forced into every pore.","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but take a deep breath, and tried her best to mobilise the profound energy in her body to resolve this discomfort.","She was at least at the Heart Profound Realm and could withstand such pressure, but Liu Buyan beside her was different.","Until now, he was only at the early stage of the Dream Profound Realm.","As a cultivator who had ascended from the lower realms, it’s not bad to have such a cultivation level when they first came here, but compared with such peerless geniuses as Li Moying and Huang Yueli, he was still too far behind.","At this time, his face was already pale, his lips also turned blue and his vision became blurred.","Liu Buyan suddenly raised his hand to his chest, “Ughh...”","“Senior Brother, how are you?!”","Huang Yueli exclaimed and saw Liu Buyan slowly fall backwards.","Huang Yueli knew that he was affected by Li Moying’s coercion and it was a very dangerous situation, he might have a Qi Deviation and go crazy.","She quickly carried Liu Buyan and ran out of the courtyard.","At the same time, she felt annoyed at herself and self-blamed for her carelessness. She forgot that this was no longer in Soaring Heavens Continent! The current Liu Buyan was too far behind Li Moying in strength, it was not suitable to watch him advance here at all!","Huang Yueli moved very quickly, even if she was carrying a grown man, it didn’t affect her speed at all.","She had run a fair bit of distance and stopped when she felt that the profound energy of the surroundings had faded a lot.","“Divine Doctor Li, why are you here?”","As soon as she turned her head, she saw Li Shihong leading a group of people and hurriedly running towards them."]},{"number":3807,"title":"Chapter 3807 Unexpected Advancement (3)","paragraphs":["3807 Unexpected Advancement (3)","Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows, knowing that Li Shihong must have sensed that Li Moying had advanced, and rushed here immediately.","Li Moying was really a national treasure in the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Following Li Shihong, most of the Elders arrived.","Moreover, this time was different from the last visit. There were not only Elders, but also many young clansmen who came. There was a huge group, and Huang Yueli didn’t know any of them.","“Divine Doctor Li, I saw you running out from a long distance just now. What happened?”","Li Shihong’s eyes subconsciously fell on Huang Yueli’s body. After a closer look, he couldn’t help being surprised and said, “Divine Doctor Liu? He is...”","Huang Yueli’s face was calm, and she smiled slightly, and said: “Patriarch Li, don’t worry, my Senior Brother was injured by the profound energy fluctuations of Young Master Li when he advanced, so he passed out for a while. However, we walked fairly well. In time, there shouldn’t be too much of a problem.”","Only then did Li Shihong understand, and said with some concern: “This... Divine Doctor Liu won’t be seriously injured, right? Now that Moying is about to advance, the profound energy around here will only become more and more intense, and the profound force is overwhelming. The scope will become wider and wider, and it is really not suitable for you to stay here for a long time. How about this, before Moying moved over to the back mountain to recuperate, he lived in the East Hall, so you can go there to rest for a while.”","Huang Yueli frowned when she heard this, and said immediately: “Thank you, Patriarch Li, for your kindness. However, I won’t go there, please send a few guards to send my Senior Brother there, and just find a few maids to take care of him. .I have an elixir that is specially used to treat this, so I don’t need to bother other doctors, as long as my Senior Brother takes the elixir and rests for a while, it should get better.”","Li Shihong was startled, apparently he did not expect that Huang Yueli would reject him.","After all, Li Moying’s advancement was actually very dangerous for “weak” doctors like them.","For her own safety, Huang Yueli should hurry over there.","“Divine Doctor Li, if you let Divine Doctor Liu go there alone, then... what about you?”","Huang Yueli said: “I’ll stay to see how Young Master Li is progressing!”","Li Shihong was very surprised, and after looking at her a few more times, he said, “Divine Doctor Li, you don’t have to worry, it will take Moying a lot of time to advance, and it’s hard for you to get close to him, and you can’t actually help him. Both Divine Doctor Liu and yourself have worked hard for a while, and you need to take care of Moying day and night, so it’s rare that you can walk away now, why don’t you take this opportunity to rest.”","As he said that, he turned his head and said to the guards behind him, “What are you all doing standing there? You have no eyesight! Divine Doctor Li is a girl and she is still carrying a man, don’t you know how to go over to help?”","The guards were very innocent.","For warriors like them, they can easily lift tens of thousands of catties. It’s just a living person, how heavy could it be! They weren’t like ordinary mortals where men were stronger than women!","However, Li Shihong had already spoken, and they didn’t dare to refute, so they hurried over and took him over from Huang Yueli’s hand.","“Take the two divine doctors to the East Hall and serve them carefully! These two are distinguished guests of our Cloudy Qilin Clan. If there is any negligence, the Patriarch will never let it go lightly!”","“Oh, wait!” Huang Yueli hurriedly said."]},{"number":3808,"title":"Chapter 3808 Unexpected Advancement (4)","paragraphs":["3808 Unexpected Advancement (4)","“Patriarch Li, I really can’t leave!”","Huang Yueli’s mind turned, and she quickly came up with a reason: “Patriarch Li, Young Master Li’s body has not fully recovered and normally speaking, he really shouldn’t have advanced at this time. But he suddenly advanced... I am worried that the poisonous gas in his body will still affect his body. Now that my Senior Brother is injured, only I can stay here and watch closely. In case there is any accident before and after the advancement, there is time for diagnosis and treatment, otherwise we will really arrive at the East Hall, the distance is far away, and if there is an accident, we will not be able to make it in time!”","Li Shihong was shocked when he heard this!","To him, nothing is more important than Li Moying’s body, and he immediately wavered.","!!","Huang Yueli also took advantage of his weakness and deliberately exaggerated the problem several times.","In fact, although Li Moying shouldn’t be advancing at this time, this is mainly the result of his own choice. If he wants to advance, there is not much danger.","However, Li Shihong didn’t know anything about it, and after being frightened by her like this, he immediately changed his mind and hurriedly said: “Then... then please trouble Divine Doctor Li to stay here! However, you can’t get close to Moying to advance.” place, but we must go to protect Moying nearby...”","Li Shihong had a troubled expression.","Huang Yueli had no intention of revealing her true cultivation. Although she knew that Li Shihong had misunderstood, she didn’t say anything.","Li Zhengwei said: “Master Patriarch, there is no need to be in a difficult situation. Aren’t there many younger generations who came here today to observe the Young Master’s advancement? These people have different levels of cultivation, and most of them can’t get too close to the Young Master. The place where they live, let Divine Doctor Li stay with them.”","Li Shihong’s eyes lit up, “That’s right, this is a solution!”","As he said that, he recruited a young disciple and said, “Divine Doctor Li is with you, you have to take good care of her.”","The young disciple hurriedly nodded in agreement.","After Li Shihong made arrangements, he hurried to the hut with the Elders.","Huang Yueli couldn’t find an excuse to approach, so she could only stand on the side of the road, looking up at the direction of the hut from a distance, the apparition of the Qilin in the sky had completely manifested at this moment, it looked lifelike, with an air of destruction and had amazing momentum.","Behind her, the young disciples who came to observe, let out exclamations of wonder.","“The Qilin Manifested! Such a clear Qilin apparition!”","“The Young Master is at the advanced stage of the Heart Profound Realm this time, right? How do I remember that it hasn’t been long since he entered the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm?”","“It’s not just long! The last time the Young Master left the family to go out to cultivate, he was only at the early stage of the Heart Profound Realm! Later, when he killed the Sky Devil, the news came back that he suddenly became a middle-stage Heart Profound Realm. That was not long ago?”","“This is really against the heavens. The speed at which god-level geniuses advance is simply unimaginable...”","Hearing everyone’s praise for Li Moying, the corners of Huang Yueli’s mouth raised indiscernibly, with pride.","Just when she was happy, a young girl walked up to her and whispered, “Divine Doctor Li?”","Huang Yueli looked back, and found that she was a pretty girl, who looked like she was seventeen or eighteen years old in the lower realm, and she was very talented.","She immediately became vigilant, “Who are you? What do you want from me?”"]},{"number":3809,"title":"Chapter 3809 Eyeing (1)","paragraphs":["3809 Eyeing (1)","The other party did not expect Huang Yueli to be so rude, and felt a little embarrassed.","She stammered, “Well... I’m from the branch of Elder Wei, and my name is Li Sijing. I don’t mean anything else, just... I just want to ask you about the Young Master.”","Huang Yueli narrowed her eyes, but her face remained calm and she asked, “What do you want to know?”","Li Sijing looked around and saw that no one was paying attention to their side, she suddenly became agitated, “Divine Doctor Li, you are the only woman I know who can get close to the Young Master and has not been beaten by him, I really admire you so much!”","After hearing this, the corner of her mouth couldn’t help but twitch.","She thought just now that this Li Sijing came suddenly with the same purpose as Li Leyun, to find her to create a ruckus.","But listening to her words, she somehow felt that there was something weird?","She laughed wryly, “Don’t get me wrong, I’m by Young Master Li’s side to treat his illness. No matter how much your Young Master hates women, you can’t even give up your life, right? Even if you’re unhappy, you have to bear it!”","Li Sijing looked at her with eyes full of reverence, “No matter what, you are amazing! How can ordinary people have such good medical skills as you! Besides, you are young and beautiful, even if the Young Master really likes you, I won’t be surprised.”","Everyone loves to hear good words. This girl’s flattery was so straightforward and Huang Yueli couldn’t be too rude to her.","The expression on her face softened a little, and she said, “If you continue talking, I’m going to blush. Just tell me, what do you want to know about Young Master Li?”","Seeing her nodding, Li Sijing hurriedly started asking questions.","“I want to know a lot! Divine Doctor Li, do you know what colour the Young Master Likes, what he likes to eat, and where he likes to cultivate? What time does he usually get up and rest? How many hours a day does he cultivate? And ...”","Huang Yueli didn’t take it seriously at first, but the more she heard about it, the more unhappy she became.","These were all weird questions!","Even Li Moying’s work and rest time has to be asked. Do you still have to ask him if he was doing well in other aspects? How many times a night?","Someone who would ask these questions must have something wrong with her husband!","Her face immediately turned cold, and she said: “This is not what you should know, don’t ask! Even if you know, I’m afraid it’s useless. Hasn’t your Patriarch already found a candidate for Young Master Li’s fiancée? I heard that she’s a top-notch genius.”","Huang Yueli’s spiritual consciousness was strong, moreover, she was assisted by Sky Phoenix Ring, so Li Sijing’s talent and cultivation level was not a secret at all in front of her eyes.","A top-notch talent at the earth level, thirty years old in the God Realm, and only in the middle stage of the Dream Profound Realm, probably not as talented as Liu Buyan.","After all, Liu Buyan was delayed because he didn’t have good skills in the lower realm, and his talent was not bad.","Huang Yueli’s words were not polite, but Li Sijing did not fly into a rage like she imagined, on the contrary, she even laughed.","“Divine Doctor Li, you really misunderstood me! I didn’t want to have anything to do with the Young Master when I asked this. I know how much I have. I just want...uh...”","When she said this, she suddenly paused.","Huang Yueli was completely confused by her words. Seeing that she had stopped halfway through her words, she was even more curious, and immediately asked: “What exactly do you want to do? Tell me quickly!”"]},{"number":3810,"title":"Chapter 3810 Eyeing(2)","paragraphs":["3810 Eyeing(2)","Li Sijing smiled awkwardly, looked around for a while, and then lowered her voice and said: “I just want... to disclose the matter about the Young Master to certain...certain young ladies at an appropriate time. In exchange for some resources...”","Huang Yueli’s eyes suddenly widened.","Li Sijing was even more embarrassed, and lowered her head, “Ahem, you don’t know about Divine Doctor Li. The cultivation resources in the family are limited. A cultivator with ordinary talent like me doesn’t have many resources. Those that are richer are able to allocate additional resources to the clansmen below, but my branch is just...”","Li Sijing’s voice became softer and her head lowered.","!!","After hearing this, Huang Yueli finally understood.","It turns out that this is a little girl who wants to collect information about Li Moying and sell it for money!","It was rare for a young woman from such a big family to make money with such brains.","If what she wants to sell is not her husband’s information, she will definitely appreciate this girl very much.","However, now Li Sijing wants to use Li Moying to make money, this was something she can’t bear.","Huang Yueli just wanted to refuse again, but after thinking about it, she changed the topic, “If you want to know about Young Master Li from me, it’s not impossible...”","Li Sijing’s eyes lit up.","Huang Yueli continued to say: “However, since you are selling money to others, shouldn’t you share half of it with me?”","Li Sijing nodded repeatedly when she heard this, “Of course, of course! Without the help of Divine Doctor Li, how would I have the opportunity to make this deal? Of course the money will be given to you, and you should be allowed to take the lead! Seventy for you and thirty for me, how about it?”","Huang Yueli raised the corners of her mouth with a half-smile, and under Li Sijing’s extremely expectant gaze, she slowly said, “This split is not bad, but I want to know how much I can sell in total? If there is not much money in total, there is no need to betray Young Master Li...”","Fearing that she would repent, Li Sijing quickly patted her chest and assured her: “Don’t worry, Doctor Li, this time Miss Li Leyun was severely punished by the Patriarch and sent to the quarry. She will definitely not be able to compete for the position of the young lady. The Patriarch has already sent a message to let The women of the right age in the family can rely on their own abilities, as long as they can make the Young Master look at them differently, they can become his wife! Therefore, all the daughters in the family are eager to try! This deal will definitely make money!”","Li Sijing spoke with enthusiasm, and consciously described the bright future of this business to Huang Yueli.","But what she didn’t notice was that although Huang Yueli still had a smile on her face, a tree branch by the side of the road had been trampled into two pieces under her feet!","Hmph! There were so many women coveting her husband!","One Li Leyun fell and thousands of girls from the Cloudy Qilin Clan stood up again!","If she had known that Li Shihong was so good at making troubles, she should have secretly poisoned the Patriarch so that he would not have time to pay attention to Li Moying’s marriage!","“Uh... Divine Doctor Li, you... What’s wrong with you?”","“What’s wrong?” Huang Yueli regained her senses and turned to look at Li Sijing.","Li Sijing stared at her delicate and pretty face. It was obvious that Divine Doctor Li’s smile was very sweet, but for some reason, it made her feel chills running down her back.","“No...it’s nothing. Divine Doctor Li, what do you think?” Li Sijing suppressed her uneasiness and asked again."]},{"number":3811,"title":"Chapter 3811 Eyeing (3)","paragraphs":["3811 Eyeing (3)","Huang Yueli glanced at her, and said: “From what you said, this matter is indeed has potential. However, even if your Patriarch asks everyone to rely on their own abilities, women with low status in the clan would not dare fighting for the limelight with the heavenly geniuses in the clan? I don’t know who are the most likely to be selected, and how many young ladies are there?”","When Li Sijing heard her asking such a question, she thought that Huang Yueli was gossiping like other young women, and that she had found the same kin.","She immediately became excited, and said incessantly: “Divine Doctor Li, you have asked the right person! There is nothing I don’t know about these things in the family! Among the daughters who are chasing after the Young Master, Young Miss Leyun is the most active. Yes, you’ve seen her before, but she’s gone now. The next most promising is Young Miss Li Zijun, she is the granddaughter of another Elder of ours, and their branch also has a Supreme Elder from the Life Profound Realm and has a special status in the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Young Miss Li Zijun is also a top-level genius, but she is a few years younger than Young Miss Leyun, so her cultivation level is a little lower.”","“Li Zijun?”","Huang Yueli frowned, and immediately remembered this new number one rival in her heart.","Li Sijing nodded and said: “Yes, let me tell you another gossip. In the past, the two young ladies, Li Leyun and Li Zijun, often fought openly and covertly for the Young Master’s attention. Unfortunately, the Young Master treated them both the same without any pretense. Later, relying on the authority of the Patriarch, Young Miss Leyun finally overwhelmed Young Miss Zijun. During this time, Young Miss Zijun has been practicing hard to participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet, but she seldom shows up in front of others.”","“So that’s how it is...” Huang Yueli nodded secretly.","However, before she was happy for a while, she heard Li Sijing continue to say: “However, Young Miss Zijun will be out of seclusion these few days. Maybe the moment she hears the news that Young Miss Leyun was severely punished and feels that her chance has come! To be honest, if Young Miss Zijun can successfully marry the Young Master, as the saying goes, barking dogs don’t bite!”","The corner of Huang Yueli’s mouth twitched, and she looked at Li Sijing with even more displeasure.","What was with this saying that barking dogs don’t bite?!","This girl seems to be very optimistic about Li Zijun!","Huang Yueli stared at Li Sijing and looked at her with horror, then said slowly: “Well, I understand what you said. This Young Miss Zijun comes from a good background. It seems that she is really a rich person. We should be able to start from She’s making a fortune on her! Any other clients?”","Huang Yueli originally asked casually, but who knows, Li Sijing immediately slapped her thigh.","“Yes, yes, of course! There are several more!”","“Like Elder Yuntao’s cousin...”","“The Patriarch also has a niece whose cultivation level is a little lower than that of Young Miss Leyun...”","“That’s right, and...”","Li Sijing likes gossip the most, and it’s rare to find a bosom friend who talks eloquently.","She didn’t notice that Huang Yueli’s face became more and more gloomy as she reported one name after another.","Well, I didn’t expect that she had only been separated from Li Moying for two years, and that this man had provoked so many rotten peach blossoms!","Hmph! This was really getting on her nerves!","Huang Yueli was already planning how to “educate” her attractive husband when she returned home at night.","However, the priority now was to deal with these toads who want to eat swan meat."]},{"number":3812,"title":"Chapter 3812 Eyeing (4)","paragraphs":["3812 Eyeing (4)","Huang Yueli interrupted Li Sijing, “Alright, that’s enough, I probably already understand the scale of our business and we’ll really be very rich!”","Li Sijing was very happy to hear that, “Isn’t that so? You think so too? Then can you tell me the Young Master’s information now?”","Huang Yueli nodded, and said: “Yes, but I have already forgotten the questions you’ve asked me just now...”","“It’s alright, it’s alright, I’ll repeat it again.” Li Sijing was very cooperative.","!!","She took out a small sheepskin scroll from the interspatial ring, and spread it out, “I have already written it down... Let me see. Oh, by the way, what colour does the Young Master like? What does he like to eat? What style of clothes does he like? When does he get up? When...”","Li Sijing chanted endlessly.","Even though Huang Yueli had seen a lot, she was in a daze at this moment.","This girl actually made a special scroll and wrote it down!","Was her husband really so popular?","“...Alright, that’s all! Divine Doctor Li, think about it quickly and answer as many questions as possible!” Li Sijing looked at her eagerly.","Huang Yueli coughed, “Well, this...Young Master Li’s favourite colour is...green, and his favourite food is...well, spicy flavour! Favourite style of clothes...wide-sleeved robes! What is his schedule? ...He generally likes to cultivate at night, and he can play chess and so on during the day, to cultivate his body and mind... What’s the problem?”","Hearing Huang Yueli’s answer, Li Sijing was full of amazement, “Wow, I didn’t expect the Young Master to be such an elegant person! If the ladies knew, they would definitely admire him even more! However, the Young Master actually likes green. I seldom see him wearing it! Also, I didn’t expect him to have such a heavy taste...”","While talking, Li Sijing conjured a writing brush out of nowhere, and wrote vigorously on the scroll, recording what Huang Yueli said just now.","At the end, she raised her head with a grateful expression on her face, “Divine Doctor Li, today I really have to thank you! The information you provided is very valuable. If you hadn’t told me, others would never know that the Young Master likes green and spicy food. This information will definitely sell for a high price, just wait to get rich!”","Li Sijing was full of confidence.","Huang Yueli curled her lips lukewarmly.","How could she tell those toads who were eyeing her husband?","She said everything in reverse!","Li Moying’s favourite colour was obviously black, and he also likes light dishes, and was most annoyed by spicy food. Moreover, his work and rest have always been regular, and he always wakes up early to start cultivating. If there was no urgent matter, he will spare time to accompany her at night.","If those daughters really bought these materials at exorbitant prices and believed them, they would definitely die an ugly death!","However, this was what they asked for.","Huang Yueli had no psychological burden at all, and watched Li Sijing leave happily.","After that, many young cultivators came to greet her.","Now everyone knows that she was a genius doctor with superb medical skills, and they all want to establish a good relationship with her. After all, there are too many opportunities for cultivators to be injured, and no one knows when they will need Huang Yueli’s help to save their lives.","Huang Yueli was still thinking about the toads, so she impatiently replied to them a few words in a perfunctory manner."]},{"number":3813,"title":"Chapter 3813 Really Wronged (1)","paragraphs":["3813 Really Wronged (1)","After another two hours, the concentration of profound energy in the surroundings finally reached its peak.","For a moment, the back and forth impact of profound energy fluctuated, and suddenly stopped.","The entire area was shrouded in energy as vast as the ocean, and the young cultivators who were still chattering suddenly fell silent.","This huge sense of oppression seemed to have an invisible pressure, which made the hairs on their backs stand on ends.","No one dared to make a sound.","The energy in the air has reached its limit, and any fluctuation may cause energy imbalance.","Huang Yueli also held her breath, and looked up in the direction of the small courtyard.","She knew very well in her heart that this was the final stage of Li Moying’s advancement, and it was also the most critical stage.","Such a state of silence only lasted for a short quarter of an hour.","Then, the thick clouds in the sky parted suddenly, and a blinding lightning bolt fell from the crack and struck straight towards the top of the hut!","“Boom——!”","With the sound of thunder, the ground shook violently.","A few young cultivators were caught off guard. They didn’t stand firm all of a sudden, and just sat down on the ground.","Huang Yueli was well prepared and stabilized her body in time.","The silence just now was broken in an instant, and everyone started to make noise again.","However, the noisy scene didn’t last long before the second and third bolts of lightning struck again.","Next, the frequency of lightning strikes became higher and higher, and the speed became faster and faster.","The glaring lightning bolts fell one after another from the beginning, and gradually increased in magnitude. The lightning was like flowing water, bolting down from mid-air.","The young cultivators present, who had never seen such a scene before, were all pale in shock.","They did not know how long it took before the thunder and lightning gradually subsided, and the lightning in the clouds became sparse, with only one or two strikes falling every long period of time.","This was a sign that the advancement had come to an end.","It wasn’t until this time that the young cultivators gradually came back to their senses, recalling the scenes they saw just now, they all felt lingering fear.","“That was just now... Was that the vision of heaven and earth triggered by the Young Master when he advanced?”","“It should be, but... But, the Young Master advanced to the late stage of the Heart Profound Realm, right? Why does it seem as though he was advancing to the Dao Profound Realm!”","“What’s the difference? I’ve seen my old man advance to the Dao Profound Realm, and he doesn’t have half the power of the Young Master’s!”","“It’s terrible, it’s terrible! The Young Master is simply inhuman!”","Just like before, when the younger generation of the Cloudy Qilin Clan talked about Li Moying, they all spoke in awe and respected him.","The only difference may be that, in their tone now, there was more awe than respect!","Facing such astonishing strength, people will instinctively feel fear.","So, until the thunder stopped completely and the clouds in the sky gradually dissipated, these young cultivators still stayed where they were, not daring to approach the hut at will.","However, Huang Yueli didn’t have so many scruples like them.","Seeing that there was no danger, she walked directly to the hut.","Li Shihong and the others were all standing in the courtyard, looking quite embarrassed. Two Elders even had their beards burnt.","And the flowers and plants that had been planted in the courtyard were all turned into piles of ashes under the bombardment of the lightning just now."]},{"number":3814,"title":"Chapter 3814 Really Wronged (2)","paragraphs":["3814 Really Wronged (2)","Huang Yueli felt a pain in her heart when she saw it.","These flowers were usually taken care of by her. Although they were not expensive varieties, she had painstakingly taken care of them all by herself.","She wondered if Liu Buyan, a wood-attribute cultivator, could use some of his wood attribute energy to nourish them tomorrow? Would they be able to recover a bit then?","Li Shihong was the first to see Huang Yueli, and hurriedly greeted him: “Divine Doctor Li, you are here!”","!!","Huang Yueli asked: “Young Master Li has successfully advanced, right? Can I go in and see how he is doing?”","Li Shihong said: “There should be no danger now. We haven’t gone in to see it yet, let’s go together!”","Huang Yueli nodded, and walked forward a few steps side by side with Li Shihong, when she suddenly found that there were several Elders behind her who hadn’t followed.","When she was surprised, she felt Li Shihong stop, turned her head and said: “Elders, if you want to go in with me to see Moying, please follow up quickly. Elder Yu and others, if you are not feeling well, you should go back early to rest, don’t force yourself.”","Elder Yu was one of the two Elders whose beards were scorched.","After hearing Li Shihong’s words, he recovered from his sluggish state, but his face was still a little pale.","He hurriedly said: “No need, there is nothing serious about this subordinate. It is a big deal for the Young Master to enter the ranks, so this subordinate will also go in to greet.”","Li Shihong glanced at him again, but didn’t say much. He turned his head and gestured “please” to Huang Yueli, and walked into the room first.","Huang Yueli followed Li Shihong and walked in, but she still took a peek at the people behind her.","Looking at the distressed appearance of these people, it is estimated that when Li Moying advanced, they had quite a bit of shock.","Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows in disdain. How dare such a few useless old fellows have her husband’s idea? What a fool’s dream!","Walking into the room, the furnishings inside were quite complete.","Although Li Moying’s hut looks very simple, the outer part is cast and reinforced with special materials, and many defensive formations have been added. Therefore, even though it has withstood the impact of the profound energy of heaven and earth when Li Moying advanced At least it hasn’t collapsed yet.","Li Moying was sitting in the middle of the room, meditating with his eyes closed.","Hearing footsteps coming from the door, he suddenly opened his eyes.","Facing Shang Li Moying’s gaze, for a moment, even Huang Yueli felt her heart tremble!","Because, that is not the sight of her husband Li Moying, but... the sight of a real king – Li Moying!","That cold and majestic aura, noble and aloof, carries an incomparable sense of alienation and oppression...","It was completely different from the man who cheated her shamelessly last night!","Li Moying’s eyes swept across the crowd, and when he saw Huang Yueli, his gaze softened.","Huang Yueli couldn’t say much at this time, so she could only wink at him.","Li Moying looked at his little fox’s cute appearance, and the corners of his mouth couldn’t help twitching upwards.","All the Elders didn’t know what was going on, but felt that the trembling oppression on Li Moying’s body disappeared in an instant, and they all heaved a sigh of relief.","Their Young Master was simply too terrifying!","This was only the late stage of the Heart Profound Realm!","After he advances to the Dao Profound Realm, he still doesn’t know what it will be like!","Li Shihong looked Li Moying up and down, with a look of surprise on his face, “Moying, it seems that your advancement is very smooth, is there any discomfort now?”"]},{"number":3815,"title":"Chapter 3815 Really Wronged (3)","paragraphs":["3815 Really Wronged (3)","Li Moying shook his head, “No, I feel very good now.”","After receiving his affirmative answer, Li Shihong was relieved, “That’s good, that’s good! I’m still a little worried about your sudden advancement, for fear that something is wrong with your body, in case your meridians haven’t fully recovered. If you can’t bear the impact of so much profound energy, then you will be in big trouble! Fortunately, everything is normal.”","The Elders also followed suit.","Li Moying had a calm expression on his face, “Elders, you were too worried. I just had a sudden epiphany during my cultivation. I felt that this opportunity was very good and couldn’t be delayed, so I made progress along the way...”","After hearing his understatement, everyone was speechless for a while.","From what Li Moying said, it seems that advancing to the next level is as simple as eating and drinking!","God knows, for a young cultivator of his age, being able to break through the early stages of the Heart Profound Realm was already a genius among geniuses.","From then on, if one wants to advance a small realm, one needs to spend several to ten years of hard work, and have to go through various arduous experiences.","But these, to Li Moying, did not exist at all.","Li Shihong suddenly thought of something, and asked with concern: “Moying, are you sure that your body is really alright? To be honest, your advancement this time is really beyond everyone’s expectations. After all, you have just been seriously injured earlier. You just woke up not long ago, according to common sense, after only a few days of recuperation, it is considered very good to be able to recover 30% to 50% of the previous strength, but, you not only recovered, but also... advanced?”","What was this?!","Could it be that their experiences in the past two months were all hallucinations?","In fact, Li Moying wasn’t injured at all. Instead, he absorbed some powerful energy, and took some complete and nourishing elixir!","“That’s right, Young Master, are you really...really not feeling any discomfort? If there’s something wrong, even if it’s just a little uncomfortable, you have to say it!”","“The old man dares to say, Young Master, you are really a little impulsive this time. It is too dangerous to advance to the next level before your body has fully recuperated!”","“While Divine Doctor Li is here, don’t shy away from medical treatment. Tell her if you feel uncomfortable.”","The Elders also reacted.","Judging from their own experience, Li Moying’s behavior was really abnormal, too abnormal!","Worried, everyone couldn’t help persuading them.","Li Shihong even turned to Huang Yueli directly, and said, “Divine Doctor Li, how is Moying’s current situation? Can I trouble you to give him a diagnosis now?”","Huang Yueli nodded upon hearing this, and walked towards Li Moying.","“Young Master Li...”","Huang Yueli stood still in front of him, and a sweet voice sounded in the room.","Li Moying sat cross-legged, a little shorter than Huang Yueli.","He raised his head and focused on the little fox slowly approaching, his eyes becoming more and more gentle.","Huang Yueli bit her lips, and secretly gave him a look, warning him to pay attention to his eyes.","Fortunately, her body just blocked the eyes of Li Shihong and the others, otherwise, she would be exposed!","Li Moying didn’t take it seriously at all. When he saw his wife, who was in the way?","However, after being glared at by his little fox again, he could only touch his nose and said, “Divine Doctor Li, I’ll have to trouble you again.”"]},{"number":3816,"title":"Chapter 3816 Really Wronged (4)","paragraphs":["3816 Really Wronged (4)","“Young Master Li, you are too polite, this is my duty.” Huang Yueli said.","Li Moying looked at her raising her small chin and replying solemnly, and felt even more itchy.","What should I do if my wife is too cute? I really want to throw her down right here, right now!","However, in order not to be kicked out, he did not dare to confront Huang Yueli.","!!","The little fox wants to act, so he can only cooperate well.","“Young Master Li, stretch out your hand, let me check your pulse first.” Huang Yueli said again.","Li Moying cooperatively raised his right hand, and stretched it out in front of Huang Yueli. Another white and tender hand immediately covered him as her slender fingers lightly pressed on the vein on his wrist.","Everyone’s eyes widened, staring at their hands, not even daring to breathe, waiting for Huang Yueli’s diagnosis.","Huang Yueli was not actually checking his pulse, but secretly channelled her own evil qi into Li Moying’s meridians to investigate the situation in his body.","Feeling the peace and warmth in Li Moying’s body, without any signs of chaos, the stone in her heart fell to the ground.","“Young Master Li, you have been very successful in advancing this time, and the poisonous gas you got last time did not explode, but the foundation is a little unstable. If you want to make a big move in the God Realm’s Grand Meet, you’d better stabilise your cultivation by going into seclusion for this period.”","Huang Yueli withdrew her evil qi, and under the expectant eyes of everyone, she spoke.","Li Moying nodded, “I understand, please don’t worry about Divine Doctor Li.”","Behind Huang Yueli, Li Shihong and the others also breathed a sigh of relief.","“Great, as long as there is no problem! I’m really worried that something will happen to Moying...” Li Shihong stared at Li Moying and sighed.","It was indeed a blessing for the entire family to have a god-level genius in the family, but for the Patriarch, it was a major trial.","In the past two years, Li Shihong can be said to have broken his heart for Li Moying.","He turned to Huang Yueli again, and thanked him from the bottom of his heart: “Divine Doctor Li, this time is really thanks to you and Divine Doctor Liu. Next, I will trouble you to continue to help. I thank you here now.”","Huang Yueli turned her head to look at him, and suddenly remembered what Li Sijing said to her just now.","Originally, she had a good impression of Li Shihong. She thought he was a fair and generous Patriarch and treated her husband very well.","However, seeing him after knowing that he was constantly seizing women for Li Moying, Huang Yueli couldn’t help but get angry!","“Patriarch Li, you really don’t need to be so polite. Anyway, we took money to do things, and we still have this bit of medical ethics.”","Huang Yueli’s tone was lukewarm, and she didn’t intend to be courteous to Li Shihong at all.","Hearing this, the Elders present were startled.","Usually, Huang Yueli was very polite to the members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. No matter whether they were high-level people or ordinary people, they all praised the pair of Senior Brother and Junior Sister.","Why was she speaking so aggressively today?","Li Moying was also a little surprised.","He knows his little fox best, so others only think that Huang Yueli’s mood was a bit wrong, but he could clearly feel that his wife was angry! Moreover, it seems that she was still very angry!","What happened? Could it be that Li Shihong had a conflict with her outside?","But it doesn’t look like much, does it?","Li Moying couldn’t figure it out for a while, but he quickly said, “Patriarch, I’m a little tired...”"]},{"number":3817,"title":"Chapter 3817 Really Wronged (5)","paragraphs":["3817 Really Wronged (5)","Li Shihong immediately remembered that Li Moying had just gone through a massive advancement, which was quite exhausting.","For cultivators in good condition, it was also a huge consumption.","What’s more, Li Moying was still recovering from a long illness.","Immediately, he completely forgot what was wrong with Huang Yueli, and quickly said: “Yes, it’s time for you to rest. We just came here to check on your condition. Since you’re fine, you should take a good rest. If you need something, send someone to tell me.”","Li Moying nodded.","Li Shihong left with a group of Elders.","As soon as they left the door, Huang Yueli rolled her eyes at her husband, snorted coldly, sat on the chair farthest from him, and turned her head away from him.","Li Moying was at a loss.","He thought it was Li Shihong who offended his little fox, but now it looks like this was not the case?","But, he doesn’t remember what he did to make the little fox angry?","Li Moying stood up, walked over, and said with a low laugh, “Little Li’er, have you been waiting outside? Thank you for your hard work.”","Huang Yueli looked out the window and completely ignored him.","Li Moying said again: “This step-up can really be said to be a blessing in disguise. If it wasn’t because of being harmed by Huang Sanbai and inhaling so much evil qi, I would like to absorb so much profound energy from the world through cultivation. How much time. Little Li’er, you are really my lucky star!”","Huang Yueli didn’t even lift her eyelids, completely ignoring him.","Li Moying raised her eyebrows secretly, and decided to change her strategy.","He took another step forward, and while Huang Yueli was distracted, he reached out and wrapped his arms around her slender waist.","Huang Yueli was still sullen, thinking of teaching her husband a lesson, this lesson should neither be too light nor too severe.","If it’s too light, she won’t be able to vent her anger, and if it’s too heavy, she won’t be able to bear it.","When she was struggling here, suddenly, she felt a heat on her back, and the man who attracted bees and butterflies clung to her at some point, and his whole body stuck to her back.","The chair that Huang Yueli was sitting on was not that big. Li Moying squeezed in again. Huang Yueli was immediately pushed aside and almost fell off.","It doesn’t matter if this man provokes flowers and plants outside, he still has to compete with her for a seat when he gets home!","Not to be outdone, Huang Yueli squeezed back with her butt.","The man’s chuckle sounded next to her ear, “Very flexible.”","Huang Yueli didn’t understand what he meant at first, so she squeezed him several times.","Li Moying let out a muffled groan, the arms clasped around her waist suddenly tightened, and her warm breath whispered in her ears, “Little Li’er, are you implying that I have neglected you all this time? ”","Huang Yueli suddenly understood, her body stiffened, her cheeks flushed red.","Li Moying took this opportunity to lift her up at once, let her sit on his lap, and locked her waist tightly with his arms.","“Alright, Little Li’er, what are you messing with?”","Huang Yueli wanted to dodge, flung left and right in his arms, but didn’t want to talk to him, but Li Moying’s strength was much stronger than hers, and she had a thick skin, no matter how hard she pushed, he wouldn’t budge.","Huang Yueli was so angry that she couldn’t help turning her head and bit his neck.","This mouthful was neither painful nor itchy to Li Moying, but it caused a familiar burning sensation in his body."]},{"number":3818,"title":"Chapter 3818 Really Wronged (6)","paragraphs":["3818 Really Wronged (6)","He didn’t have much resistance to his own little fox, but since the two of them cultivated the Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual together, Huang Yueli’s influence on him has been even greater.","Sometimes just by getting a little closer, he couldn’t help but want to kiss her.","What’s more, the two of them have been clinging to each other on the chair for so long now.","They haven’t been intimate since Li Moying woke up. For a moment, Li Moying’s blood surged as he looked at the fair and slender neck of his beloved in his arms, they gradually moved closer...","He didn’t believe Liu Buyan’s words of restraint.","Even if there was something wrong with his health, there was no need for them to be separated for a month, it was clearly to punish him on purpose!","However, just when Li Moying was less than an inch away from Huang Yueli, she suddenly turned around, and glared at him as she said fiercely: “Since you did such a good thing, why do you still ask me?”","She turned her head abruptly when she realised that Li Moying had moved so close, her eyes widened in surprise.","Li Moying took advantage of the opportunity to lower his head, kissed her tender lips, and said, “What did I do? Could it be that I didn’t tell you before I advanced? But, it happened suddenly at that time, and I cultivated “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual”. When I was on the second chapter, I felt something in my heart, and all the profound strength and evil qi in the meridians poured into the dantian for a while. Although it’s not impossible to suppress it by force, but I was worried that it would cause backlash to the body, so I still decided to take advantage of the situation to advance.”","Li Moying frowned and thought for a while, but still felt aggrieved and baffled at the same time.","After much deliberation, the most likely thing is that his little fox felt that he didn’t pay attention to his body, so she was upset.","Therefore, he immediately described the situation at that time.","After finishing speaking, he didn’t take it seriously, a smile appeared on the corner of his mouth, and his voice became deeper and deeper, “Little Li’er, it is said that after practicing the secret method of dual cultivation, the evil qi in our bodies will interact with each other. When I advanced, How do you feel? Can you control your evil qi? Otherwise, let me help you...”","His seductive voice lingered in Huang Yueli’s ears.","Huang Yueli’s face was flushed, and she raised her hand to cover her ears.","Damn, this man’s voice can also make people pregnant!","However, Li Moying held her hand so that she couldn’t pretend to be an ostrich.","Huang Yueli’s heart was pounding, she had forgotten that she was questioning him, she could only feel his voice, his breath, his touch...","“Bang bang bang!”","Just then, someone knocked on the door.","“Junior Sister, Moying, are you in there? How is it? Is this advancement considered a success? Is there any discomfort in Moying’s body? Let me take a look!” Liu Buyan’s voice came from outside the door .","Huang Yueli suddenly woke up!","Gosh, she even forgot what she was doing!","She pushed Li Moying away abruptly, and at the same time glared at him once again.","This man ... his head was full of that kind of trash! Dare to interrupt her questioning.","This was definitely a beauty trick!","She almost fell for it again.","Hearing Liu Buyan’s voice, Li Moying frowned, but followed Huang Yueli’s strength in pushing him, and moved back a little.","Immediately afterwards, he saw his little fox jump up from the chair, straightened his clothes, and ran to open the door for Liu Buyan."]},{"number":3819,"title":"Chapter 3819 Really Wronged (7)","paragraphs":["3819 Really Wronged (7)","Li Moying looked like an old man, still sitting on the chair, motionless.","He propped his head on one hand, and watched Huang Yueli running around in a relaxed manner.","Huang Yueli looked at her face in the mirror, and found that the rouge on her lips had been eaten away by him, so she couldn’t help turning her head and glowered at Li Moying.","Seeing that he was not nervous at all, she couldn’t help complaining: “You...can you stand up for a while? Look at you, your clothes are wrinkled. Hurry up and tidy them up, otherwise Senior Brother would think that we had been messing around!”","Li Moying looked at his nervous little fox amusedly.","She thought...after putting on her clothes and touching up her makeup, Liu Buyan would not know what they were doing?","He wasn’t a fool!","Seeing that they haven’t come out for so long, he must have guessed it all.","However, it really makes him feel happy to see his shrewd and capable little fox occasionally showing such a cute look.","Li Moying didn’t explain, but raised his eyebrows lightly, “Are you sure you want me to stand up now?”","As he spoke, he looked down meaningfully.","Huang Yueli’s eyes followed his movements subconsciously, all the way down from his strong and powerful chest...","Then, she saw...","“You, you, you... sure enough, your mind is full of rubbish!” Huang Yueli almost jumped.","Li Moying had an innocent expression on his face, “Can you blame me? You were the one who wanted to learn the dual cultivation method from me. Unfortunately, I was in a coma at the time, and I couldn’t refuse. I can only be forced by you...”","“F...forced you?!” Huang Yueli couldn’t listen anymore.","“Junior Sister? Junior Sister? Are you there?” Liu Buyan urged again.","Huang Yueli looked in the direction of the door.","Although it is not impossible to send Liu Buyan away, Li Moying advanced too hastily today, and she is still a little worried deep in her heart.","It is still necessary to let Liu Buyan, a serious doctor, come to diagnose the pulse.","She simply stepped forward and grabbed Li Moying by the collar.","Li Moying looked like a frightened little white flower, “You you you... What do you want to do? You want to be tough...”","Before he could continue, Huang Yueli snorted coldly, “Don’t say it!”","She quickly pulled Li Moying’s collar loose in the entanglement just now, fastened his belt that had fallen down, and straightened his wrinkled sleeves.","After doing all this, she looked up and found that on Li Moying’s forehead, a few strands of hair were scattered and fell on his forehead, adding a bit of lazy beauty to him for no reason.","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but look a few more times, and heard Li Moying’s chuckle again.","She roughly combed those disobedient hairs back.","Dare to laugh!","What a disaster!","Li Moying was hurt by her, but he didn’t dare to say anything, because he still doesn’t know how he offended his wife.","Originally, he planned to have some intimacy with Little Li’er, get away with it, and wait for Huang Yueli to fall asleep before going outside to inquire.","But now, the good plan was disrupted by Liu Buyan’s sudden return...","Huang Yueli cleaned him up roughly, turned around and went to open the door.","Outside the door, Liu Buyan was leaning against a pillar on the corridor, with his arms crossed, staring impatiently at the door.","Seeing Huang Yueli coming out, he immediately looked him up and down, and then shook his head, “Tsk tsk, tsk tsk! Are you taking the words of this genius doctor as nothing?”"]},{"number":3820,"title":"Chapter 3820 Really Wronged (8)","paragraphs":["3820 Really Wronged (8)","Huang Yueli bit her lips, and quickly clarified: “We didn’t do anything! We were just talking inside!”","“You didn’t do anything, and it took you so long to come out? Isn’t that too disrespectful to Senior Brother?”","Liu Buyan raised his eyebrows, with a playful smile on the corner of his mouth, as if he understood clearly.","Huang Yueli was speechless immediately. She blamed Li Moying for being bad. Now, in her Senior Brother’s heart, her image was completely ruined!","She hastily laughed dryly, tried to pull brush it off foolishly and moved a few steps to let Liu Buyan come in.","“Senior Brother, come and take a look for Moying. His advancement this time was an accident, so I don’t know if his meridians can bear it?”","Liu Buyan turned his head to look at Li Moying, and as expected, he received several vicious dagger stares from the other party. He laughed and said, “What’s wrong with him? I’ve already said that you can’t cultivate any dual cultivation yet, so he still doesn’t listen to me?”","Having said that, he still walked up to Li Moying, “Where’s your hand? Quickly stretch it out! Asking for medical treatment, you must have a begging attitude! I’m a very busy doctor, alright? Don’t waste my time!”","Li Moying snorted coldly, if it wasn’t for reassuring his Little Li’er’s, he wouldn’t have let him take his pulse at all!","He felt that he was very good from head to toe, and the only bad thing was the part that was provoked by the little fox just now.","“Senior Brother, he is like this. He doesn’t like seeing a doctor, so don’t argue with him.” Seeing Li Moying’s cold face, Huang Yueli walked over by herself, grabbed his wrist, and handed his arm to Liu Buyan.","Liu Buyan said in a dramatic manner: “Well, the veins of Young Master Li...”","He prolonged his tone on purpose, which really made Huang Yueli nervous, “How is it? What’s wrong with Moying’s pulse?”","Liu Buyan said: “It’s not right, it’s so wrong! Young people, you still need to be more restrained. If you are always so excited, you will easily have various problems when you get old, such as kidney deficiency, back pain, and...”","Liu Buyan hadn’t finished speaking when he felt an explosive profound force coming from his hand!","Even though he had been prepared for a long time and immediately let go of his hands and stepped back, he was still hit by the impact, and he took a dozen steps back before stopping.","“Don’t bother!” Li Moying said in a cold voice with displeasure.","Huang Yueli was teased by Liu Buyan, and she was speechless when her husband suddenly shot and shook her away.","“Moying, what are you doing? Senior Brother is kind enough to diagnose your pulse, so can’t you be nice to him?”","When Li Moying heard that her little fox was not on his side, he immediately became even more unhappy, “What about you? Can’t you treat me better? I’m your husband. Which side are you on?”","Liu Buyan moved his stiff wrists, with a smile on his lips, “What? Young Master Li still remembers that he is my Junior Sister’s husband? Why didn’t I hear that when I went out this time?”","Li Moying was taken aback when he heard the words, frowned slightly, and asked in puzzlement, “What do you mean?”","“What do you mean? It means...Young Master Li, you have a lot of good luck! One Li Leyun left, and a lot of other noble daughters came. I heard that the Patriarch Li has already let the news that all the girls of the right age in the family , as long as they can gain the favor of the Young Master, they can marry you, if there are too many people, even three wives and four concubines are not a problem!”","“What nonsense are you talking about? Liu Buyan, don’t try to provoke us!” Li Moying defended himself immediately."]},{"number":3821,"title":"Chapter 3821 All Are Simply Routines (1)","paragraphs":["3821 All Are Simply Routines (1)","Li Moying’s first reaction was that it was impossible.","Although the clan had always wanted to find him a fiancée, but not just anyone can fall into the eyes of the Elders, at least she must be a heavenly gifted girl who can match him in identity .","Therefore, what Liu Buyan said sounded very unreliable.","Liu Buyan gloated and laughed, “Tsk tsk, you still don’t believe me? Why should I lie to you? To tell you the truth, this incident has spread throughout Amethyst Paramount Palace! We rarely leave the back mountain , that’s why we didn’t know. When I went to the East Hall this time, and I don’t know how many girls in spring are secretly thinking about their Young Master!”","!!","Hearing this, the expression on Li Moying’s face froze immediately.","Although he really didn’t want to believe that such a thing would happen, but the manner in which Liu Buyan was speaking, it really didn’t seem like he was lying...","With a thump in his heart, he immediately turned to Huang Yueli, eagerly expressing his loyalty. “Little Li’er, don’t listen to his nonsense! How could such a thing happen! This is definitely just a rumour, only someone as unreliable as Liu Buyan would believe it...”","“So, do you think I’m an unreliable person?” Huang Yueli pursed her lips and glared at him.","Li Moying was startled, “Little Li’er, you...you don’t really believe his nonsense, do you?”","Huang Yueli snorted, and said angrily: “I’m not sure if what Senior Brother said is true or not, but I’ve only been out of the hut for a while, and I’ve already heard the news. Not only that, but someone came to ask me for your information and that’s going to be sold to these noble daughters who are going to curry favour with you!”","“What?!” Li Moying gasped!","He never expected that what Liu Buyan said was actually true!","Not only is it true, but even his little fox already knows about it...","This was simply a bolt out of the blue!","Li Moying hurried over, raised his hand to the sky, and swore, “Little Li’er, I really don’t know anything. We’ve been married for so long, how can I have any fiancée? Besides, those women look so ugly, not as good-looking as your little finger, I have such a beautiful wife in my family, how could I look at other women...”","“Then if Patriarch Li really finds you a woman who is more beautiful than my Junior Sister, will you take a closer look?” Liu Buyan interrupted him.","Li Moying froze, and shot his dagger glare immediately at him.","Liu Buyan was not afraid of him at all, and there was a smirk on the corner of his mouth, “Junior Sister, let me tell you, men usually only think with their lower bodies, look at our Young Master Li, this has revealed the truth in his heart, you better think about it...”","Li Moying was so angry that he was about to vomit blood!","He knew that as long as there was Liu Buyan, nothing good would happen!","If he had known, he should have shut him out just now, why did he let him in for? It was akin to attracting wolves into the house!","However, at this critical moment, he couldn’t care less about Liu Buyan, and immediately turned to Huang Yueli, and said pitifully, “Little Li’er, was it also because of this that you lost your temper with me just now? I swear to God, I don’t know anything, this is all the Patriarch’s wishful thinking, if I knew, I would have rejected it on the spot! You must believe me!”"]},{"number":3822,"title":"Chapter 3822 All Are Simply Routines (2)","paragraphs":["3822 All Are Simply Routines (2)","Looking at the anxious face of the man, Huang Yueli finally felt a little better.","Of course, it is impossible for her not to trust her husband. The two of them have experienced many kinds of ups and downs over the past few years. Naturally, it was impossible for her to have any misunderstandings because of Li Moying’s rotten peach blossoms.","However, she was still very upset that her husband was always coveted by the butterflies outside, and she will vent it when she finds an opportunity.","Seeing that Huang Yueli’s expression softened, Liu Buyan also guessed what was going on in her heart.","He quickly coughed again, “Young Master Li, do you think it’s useful for you to refuse? Patriarch Li has announced this to the outside world, but he didn’t tell you, isn’t it because he was afraid of your rejection? You can go to him now and he’ll just pretend that he doesn’t know anything!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Li Moying shot him a death stare yet again.","Li Moying was so depressed, Liu Buyan was intending on fighting with him to the end!","Liu Buyan smiled smugly, who told him to show off their affection every day, without any sense of public morality!","If he doesn’t punish him, he would really think that he did not have any temper because he was single!","Afraid that Huang Yueli would get angry, Li Moying immediately said: “In this case, I will make it clear to the Patriarch directly that I have already been married, and I can’t get entangled with other women, and I don’t plan to marry another woman!”","He said, turned around and walked towards the door.","Huang Yueli originally planned to drag it on a little longer, so that Li Moying would be more nervous and coax her, but who knows, in the blink of an eye, Li Moying walked out of the room directly.","Recalling what he said just now, Huang Yueli jumped up in shock and ran out to chase him.","“Moying, Moying! What are you going to do? Come back quickly!”","However, Li Moying’s attitude was very firm. Even when he heard his little fox calling from behind, he didn’t show any signs of stopping.","Huang Yueli chased after a few steps, and found that she couldn’t keep up with Li Moying’s speed!","“Damn it, after he advanced, his speed is twice as fast as before!”","However, she still has a way to stop him!","Huang Yueli rolled her eyes, stopped altogether, raised her foot and kicked a small tree by the side of the road, breaking a branch, and at the same time, said “Ouch”.","The man who was still walking quickly in front of him suddenly froze when he heard this sound, and stopped immediately.","He turned around quickly, looking very nervous, “Little Li’er, how are you doing? Did you fall somewhere?”","As soon as Li Moying turned around, she saw a slender figure suddenly rushing out from the corner and flew into his arms.","Caught off guard, he was almost thrown down.","Huang Yueli hugged him tightly, “What are you doing? You ran outside without listening to me! What? We’ve been married for a long time, and you don’t even have the patience to listen to me?”","Li Moying held her shoulders, and said in a deep voice: “I know what you mean. However, the Patriarch and the others have always hoped that I can get married soon, so even if they don’t succeed this time, they will definitely keep coming up with ideas. A new idea. In order to prevent future troubles, the best way is to make our relationship public...”","“Stop, stop!”","Huang Yueli hastily yelled to stop, “This can’t be done! You know very well that my identity is very sensitive. When I was in Medial Arch City, Li Yuntao and the others firmly opposed our affairs, and it is even more impossible for Patriarch Li to accept it.”"]},{"number":3823,"title":"Chapter 3823 All Are Simply Routines (3)","paragraphs":["3823 All Are Simply Routines (3)","Hearing Huang Yueli mention the matter of Medial Arch City, Li Moying’s eyes turned cold.","He snorted coldly with disdain, “So what if you don’t accept it? It’s great that I left Cloudy Qilin Clan Continent with you!”","Huang Yueli looked at his handsome face with a flash of determination, her heart was warm and moved, but at the same time she was a little helpless.","She stood on tiptoe, kissed Li Moying’s face, and said: “Alright, I know you are willing to wander the world with me, but I don’t want to leave the world with such a strong profound energy before the God Realm’s Grand Meet and go to the wilderness to suffer!”","!!","Li Moying lowered his eyes and stared into her big bright eyes, “Even if we leave the Amethyst Paramount Palace, it won’t affect our participation in the God Realm’s Grand Meet. You don’t have to worry.”","Huang Yueli smiled, and said: “I’m not worried, I just don’t think it’s necessary. And it’s really not a good time to disclose our relationship. You forgot, I’m from the Sacred Phoenix Clan...”","Hearing this, Li Moying’s brows frowned again, and they almost knit together.","If Huang Yueli was really an ordinary human girl, then it would be fine.","Even if the people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan don’t like the human race, as long as Li Moying is strong enough, they will have to admit her identity in the end.","But by chance, she is from the Sacred Phoenix Clan!","The enmity between the Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Sacred Phoenix Clan can’t be explained in a few words, it has lasted for hundreds of thousands of years!","Even if he is the only god-level genius in the family, he doesn’t dare to say that he can easily resolve this kind of enmity.","Seeing his troubled look, Huang Yueli raised the corners of her mouth slightly, “Now it’s your turn to worry? Actually, it’s nothing. The boat will go straight when it reaches the bridge. When the time comes, we’ll elope!”","Li Moying’s eyes lit up, “Elope! This is a good idea!”","He doesn’t like restraint by nature. During his time in the Cloudy Qilin Clan, even though the clan members didn’t dare to interfere with him, he still felt uncomfortable.","Thinking of being able to cultivate with the woman he loves while traveling in the God Realm, such a day is exactly what he dreams of.","“If you like, we can leave today! Yes, it’s best to leave today, so as not to argue with the people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan...” Li Moying thought quickly, thinking that this is really a very good idea .","Huang Yueli didn’t expect him to be so quick to decide, so she quickly stopped him again.","“Are you... are you listening to me? I mean, you can run away when you have nothing to do, not now!”","Upon hearing this, Li Moying immediately became discouraged. He stared at her deeply, and a look of disappointment flashed in his eyes, “Why can’t it be now?”","Huang Yueli said: “It will be the God Realm’s Grand Meet soon, and the resources of the Cloudy Qilin Clan are the best... Well, you are already at the late stage of the Heart Profound Realm, and it is estimated that no one can fight you except Jun Sihan. Yes, but, I am still at the early stage of the Heart Profound Realm, and I still plan to cultivate hard! After leaving the Amethyst Paramount Palace, where can I find such a treasured place?”","Li Moying listened to the beginning, opened his mouth, and was about to refute that he didn’t care about these resources.","But after hearing that it was his little fox who wanted to use the resources of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, he had no choice but to silently hold back the words that came to his lips.","His wife needs resources to cultivate, so he has no choice but to be patient...","“And...” Huang Yueli said again: “We still have important things to do during the God Realm’s Grand Meet, so it’s better not to make extra trouble at this juncture.”"]},{"number":3824,"title":"Chapter 3824 All Are Simply Routines (4)","paragraphs":["3824 All Are Simply Routines (4)","Li Moying suddenly remembered that she planned to settle scores with Huang Sanbai at the God Realm’s Grand Meet.","He then calmed down.","Yes, now was indeed a good time, but...","His heroic eyebrows furrowed slightly, “But, those women...”","!!","Huang Yueli looked up at him, pouted, “What? Are you really planning to go to a matchmaker and marry back all the women you like?”","“No...no! How is this possible? Little Li’er, I only have you in my heart...” Li Moying quickly expressed his loyalty.","Huang Yueli said with a smile: “That’s all right! I believe you won’t look them in the eye!”","As she spoke, she snuggled against Li Moying’s chest.","Li Moying looked at the well-behaved girl in his arms, and a gentle smile appeared on the corner of his mouth.","His little fox was really too cute!","And Liu Buyan, who hastily followed him out of the room, saw the two of them entangled together again, and vaguely heard their conversation, so he couldn’t help but cover his eyes and couldn’t bear to look directly.","Junior Sister, Junior Sister!","Did you just say that you should take ‘care’ of Li Moying and vent your anger?","How did it turn out that you took the initiative to say that you would trust others in the blink of an eye? ?","You have been tricked, did you know that?","...","After that day, neither Huang Yueli nor Li Moying took that episode to heart.","The two of them still stayed in and cultivate in retreat in the small courtyard every day. Only Liu Buyan occasionally visits other places in Amethyst Paramount Palace.","I don’t know what he heard outside, but every time he came back, he had a weird smile on his face.","Huang Yueli was very curious and wanted to inquire, but was stopped by Li Moying.","“Don’t go, what good things can he say! He must have heard some rumours outside again, and he is going to blackmail me!”","Huang Yueli was speechless, “Are you thinking too much? Senior Brother is just gossiping, and he won’t deliberately tell lies...”","It’s bad because it wasn’t a lie!","Li Moying didn’t dare to speak directly, so he could only change the subject abruptly, “Little Li’er, I feel a little stuffy in my chest, maybe I have misunderstood the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual”, come and help me find out... ”","Huang Yueli knew that he did it on purpose, but she could only give Liu Buyan an apologetic look, and went to cultivate with her husband.","Liu Buyan couldn’t help but snort coldly.","Count you as ruthless! Hmph!","He came here specially to tell them important news. Since they don’t bother to listen, there will be a good show to watch when things come to an end!","Early the next morning.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying were still asleep when they heard a sound of arguing outside the door.","Huang Yueli opened her eyes in a daze, and looked at the sky, “It’s only five o’clock, and it’s still dark, why would someone come here at this time?”","Don’t say it’s not dawn, even if it was dawn, it shouldn’t be so noisy here.","Li Moying’s small courtyard is now one of the forbidden areas of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Huang Yueli waited for a while, but the quarrel outside not only did not disappear, but became louder and louder.","She frowned, lifted a corner of the quilt, and was about to get up and look outside.","However, as soon as she moved, a powerful arm around her waist suddenly tightened, and her body was pulled backwards, hitting the man’s strong chest.","“Little Li’er, where are you going?”","Li Moying’s voice was still hoarse, and it sounded so sexy that Huang Yueli’s ears felt a little hot."]},{"number":3825,"title":"Chapter 3825 All Are Simply Routine (5)","paragraphs":["3825 All Are Simply Routine (5)","After Li Moying woke up, even though they didn’t continue their dual cultivation, Li Moying still insisted on sleeping in the same bed with her.","Huang Yueli didn’t quite believe in his self-control, and expressed firm opposition.","However, in the end, she still couldn’t help it after hearing Li Moying swear and talk about all kinds of things, so she could only agree.","Fortunately, this man despises Liu Buyan very much, but in fact he still has some scruples. He was afraid that his impulsiveness will affect Huang Yueli’s body, so he had been persevering and held back.","Huang Yueli pushed him and said, “It’s so noisy outside, I don’t know what’s going on, I want to go out and have a look.”","When Li Moying heard this, he also heard the commotion outside and immediately frowned.","He stuffed his wife back into the quilt and sat up by himself, “You continue to sleep for a while, I’ll go out and have a look.”","Huang Yueli was lying on the bed, grabbing the quilt that Li Moying had pulled down to her chin, watching her husband get off the ground with his upper body naked, pick up a black long robe, put it on his body, as he put on the gold embellished belt.","Tsk tsk, what a handsome man who was favoured by the heavens!","Huang Yueli admired him in her heart, when she suddenly saw Li Moying tilt his head and look at her.","“Sleep! I’ll be right back.”","With that said, he pushed open the door and walked out.","Huang Yueli lay on the bed and waited for a while, but she didn’t see him coming back. She pricked up her ears and seemed to hear the young woman’s voice again.","There was a woman?","She frowned suspiciously, and simply got up.","Anyway, she was already awake, so why not follow him out to watch the excitement.","Huang Yueli put on her coat and walked into the courtyard. She saw Li Moying standing in the middle of the courtyard from a distance, surrounded by several guards.","Not far away, there was another pretty girl who fell to the ground, her eyes were red, and she looked like she had been bullied miserably.","Huang Yueli’s eyes widened, “What’s the situation?”","“Little Li’er, why did you come out? Didn’t you tell you to continue sleeping?” Li Moying turned his head the moment he heard her voice, and saw that she was wearing thin clothes, and he frowned immediately. “How dare you come out wearing so little! Don’t you know it’s windy in the morning? You’re pretty good at telling me to pay attention to my body, how about you?”","Li Moying walked over quickly, took off his cloak, draped it over Huang Yueli’s shoulders, and at the same time clasped Huang Yueli’s slender waist through the thick cloak, and pulled her into his arms.","“If you catch a cold, see how I punish you!”","Huang Yueli didn’t take his fierce tone seriously at all, she was still looking at the little beauty on the ground with her head poking around.","“What’s going on? Why did that little girl come here? She came here so early in the morning? Oh, why does she seem to be crying!”","“This...cough cough!” Li Moying coughed twice, and said in a dodging manner: “Well...she just sent something.”","“Sent something? Sending it so early in the morning? What is it that is so urgent that she can’t afford to delay it? Why don’t I know?” Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes.","“Well... I don’t know either. The Patriarch must have a whim! Well, the delay is too long. Let’s go back to our room and continue to rest, or it will be dawn soon.”"]},{"number":3826,"title":"Chapter 3826 All Are Simply Routine (6)","paragraphs":["3826 All Are Simply Routine (6)","Li Moying forcibly changed the subject, grabbed his wife’s arm and tried to bring his precious little fox back to the room.","“Oh, wait! Wait a minute!”","However, Huang Yueli didn’t cooperate with him at all as she stood in place.","The gap between Huang Yueli’s cultivation level and his was not too big, and he was reluctant to be rough on his wife, so for a moment there, the two of them were in a deadlock.","!!","After Huang Yueli struggled a few times, she didn’t bother to argue with Li Moying any more, she turned directly to the guard standing beside her, and asked, “Brother Tianyi, have you been here all this time? What happened? Tell me quickly, don’t hide a single word!”","Li Tianyi and the rest of Li Moying’s bodyguards were also seriously injured when they were in Forest Shade Town, and they remained unconscious. Later, they were also rescued by Li Yuntao and the others.","Although they mainly suffered trauma and meridian damage, they inhaled very little evil qi, but after all, they did not have such powerful and perverted talent as Li Moying. This small dose was enough to keep them unconscious for several months.","After Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan arrived, she also took time to help them diagnose and treat them, and they finally woke up.","Li Tianyi and the others were grateful for Huang Yueli’s kindness, and they even recognized her as their Young Mistress in their hearts.","Before their bodies fully recovered, they rushed to Li Moying’s side to take care of him.","Li Moying wanted them to go back, but they refused to leave, so he could only agree.","However, considering that Li Tianyi and the others were also going to participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet, Li Moying didn’t arrange anything for them.","After all, this grand event for young geniuses in the God Realm may be just a formality for a peerless genius like Li Moying who has already become famous, but for ordinary young disciples, this was definitely an excellent opportunity to prove himself, if missed, it will never come again.","Needless to say, the God Realm’s Grand Meet was much more important to Li Tianyi and the others!","Not only that, Huang Yueli also took the initiative to give them some spiritual armaments that she had refined, as well as the elixirs obtained from Liu Buyan, which made them even more grateful to her.","Now, hearing her question, Li Tianyi was crying in his heart.","He really had the worst luck!","Why did she have to pick him out of all as soon as they arrived?","This question was one that might make him lose his life!","If he answers, he will offend his Young Master, if he doesn’t answer, he will offend his Young Madame!","Li Moying and Huang Yueli stared at him closely, their gazes were burning, cold sweat broke out on Li Tianyi’s forehead, dripping down in large drops.","“Ahem, well, what happened was...” In the end, he still couldn’t bear the pressure and opened his mouth, “This Young Miss Li Mingmei is the granddaughter of Elder Yu and a genius in our clan. This subordinate happened to be on watch today, at five o’clock, they found someone approaching the small courtyard, and when they went over to look, they found that it was Young Miss Mingmei.”","When Li Moying heard that Li Tianyi had acted so honestly, his gaze became even colder.","Li Tianyi was so frightened that the clothes on his back were drenched with sweat, and he really realized what it means to be trembling and walking on thin ice.","However, he still decided to continue talking.","Because, according to his observations of the Young Master and Young Madam during this period, to offend the Young Master himself is to offend one person, and if to offend the Young Madam, it was to offend the Young Master as well!"]},{"number":3827,"title":"Chapter 3827 All Are Simply Routine (7)","paragraphs":["3827 All Are Simply Routine (7)","He considered himself as a man of normal intelligence.","Whether it was worthwhile to offend one person, or to offend two people, this was easy to calculate.","Li Tianyi made up his mind, he didn’t dare to look into his Young Master’s eyes anymore as he stared straight at the ground and continued speaking quickly.","“This subordinate found it strange. It’s only five o’clock, and it’s not even dawn yet. A daughter of the clan actually ran in the back mountain! This subordinate was afraid that she has encountered some danger, so he hurried over to ask, and the result is , she said...but said...”","Li Moying’s gaze sharpened!","The profound power all over his body was released uncontrollably, and Li Tianyi couldn’t speak anymore.","Huang Yueli frowned, glared at Li Moying beside her, and was about to say something, but at this moment, the girl who had been sitting on the ground suddenly yelled.","“I said that I came to find the Young Master! I heard that the Young Master has been cultivating hard these days, so I specially prepared a pot of nourishing soup with my own hands. I wanted to give it to the Young Master and give him a good supplement. Brother Tianyi, what’s the matter? It’s hard to say? Why are you hesitating? It’s really weird!”","Huang Yueli’s gaze immediately fell on the girl, “You are Li Mingmei?”","“That’s right, I am!” The girl didn’t have any intention of hiding anything, she raised her chin and admitted generously, at the same time, she stared fiercely at Huang Yueli, “You are that Divine Doctor Li? I thought you were really a Divine Doctor, hmph, in the end, you actually seduced our Young Master...you are simply a shameless vixen!”","Li Mingmei came to deliver the soup, but was blocked by Li Tianyi and the others. They couldn’t even enter the courtyard.","There was a dispute between the two sides, Li Mingmei refused to leave no matter what, and deliberately raised her voice, finally woke up Huang Yueli, and even lured Li Moying out.","Seeing the appearance of the high-ranking male god in his heart, and seeing his ingeniously handsome face, Li Mingmei suddenly felt her legs go limp.","She stepped forward delicately, intending to bring the nourishing soup she brought to Li Moying.","But who knew that Li Moying didn’t even want to listen to her, he even ordered the guards to throw her out!","During the pushing and shoving, Li Mingmei fell to the ground. When she was wronged and puzzled, she saw a beautiful woman coming out of the room, and she was so close to Li Moying.","And the Young Master, who has always been cold and ruthless, was actually so gentle to her!","Li Mingmei couldn’t react at first, but after hearing their conversation, after thinking about it carefully, she recognized Huang Yueli’s identity!","At this moment, the only woman who can live in this courtyard openly was the Junior Sister of the Divine Doctor!","Li Mingmei consciously discovered the shocking secret. She was shocked and angry at the same time, and couldn’t help cursing: “It seems that it is fake for you to treat the Young Master, and it is true to take the opportunity to hook up with the strong of the ancient gods! No wonder Li Leyun will be kicked out of Amethyst Paramount Palace, it seems that you, a vixen, are behind the scenes...”","“Ahhhh!”","Before she could finish speaking, she suddenly let out a terrified cry!","The aura around Li Moying suddenly exploded, and an incomparably powerful profound force rushed towards her!","Li Mingmei’s original talent was far inferior to Li Leyun’s, so she couldn’t bear it even more.","Her body flew out!","“Hey! Moying, take it easy, take it easy. Don’t do anything first...”"]},{"number":3828,"title":"Chapter 3828 All Are Simply Routine (8)","paragraphs":["3828 All Are Simply Routine (8)","Seeing Li Moying’s eyes full of rage and coldness, Huang Yueli’s heart shuddered, and she hurriedly stopped in front of him.","“Don’t be like this. They just came to give you something. If you killed someone right here, Elder Yu would definitely not let it go!”","“Am I afraid of him?!” Li Moying smiled coldly.","Huang Yueli hurriedly followed Mao to comfort him, “Alright, alright, I know you’re not afraid, but there’s no need for that! She’s just an ignorant little girl, even if you kill her, it’s useless? Besides, she’s just scolded me a few words, it doesn’t hurtl...”","“It doesn’t hurt? Who dares to scold you?! That’s worse than killing me!” Li Moying sneered again, his voice getting colder.","Li Mingmei lay on the ground, feeling that her internal organs were on fire and she was obviously seriously injured.","Hearing Li Moying’s voice, she couldn’t help shivering on the spot.","She usually hears people say how strong and cold their Young Master was, and how ruthless he was when facing the demons on the battlefield.","Li Mingmei didn’t quite believe it at first.","Because, although Li Moying was very cold in the family, most of the time he was still very talkative. He never bothers to do things like bullying subordinates or other younger generations just because he’s a god-level genius .","This also gave many people the illusion that Li Moying was not as cruel as in the legend.","But now, Li Moying knocked her away with a single word of disagreement, and the attack was so sudden and merciless. If Huang Yueli hadn’t stopped him in time, she might have died because of a wrong word!","It was only then that Li Mingmei realized how superficial her understanding of this Young Master was.","Facing such a devil-like man, Huang Yueli didn’t feel afraid at all.","She was just a little helpless, knowing that these women talked nonsense and offended her husband again! To harm her, she has to try her best to smooth his ruffled hair!","She quickly stood on tiptoe, kissed Li Moying’s face, and said softly: “Alright, don’t be angry, I’m not angry myself? It doesn’t matter what others say, I only care about you! Aren’t I the only one in your heart?”","“Of course you are the only one in my heart!” Li Moying did not forget to show his loyalty at the first moment, and even forgot about killing people.","Huang Yueli curled her lips, “That’s fine! For my sake, we can’t fall out with the Cloudy Qilin Clan at this time, let this little girl go back!”","However, Li Moying didn’t do what she wanted right away and shook his head instead.","“No, if we let her go back like this, she already knows about the relationship between the two of us, and she will definitely talk nonsense in front of the Patriarch and those Elders. God knows what they will talk about you behind your back. We will also have a lot of trouble!”","Huang Yueli smiled and said, “Of course I’ve thought about this too! However, it’s not like there’s no solution.”","“What way?” Li Moying looked at her.","Huang Yueli said: “Do you still remember? There is a secret method recorded in the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual”, which can modify part of the memory, but it can’t last for too long, it can only last for three to half a year, and the effect will gradually disappear. However, this time is enough for us.”","After a month, they will set off to participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet. At that time, Huang Yueli’s identity will definitely not be concealed."]},{"number":3829,"title":"Chapter 3829 One After Another (1)","paragraphs":["3829 One After Another (1)","Hearing what she said, Li Moying also remembered, nodded immediately and said: “That’s right, let’s try then!”","Huang Yueli smiled, turned around and was about to walk towards Li Mingmei.","Li Moying stretched out his hand to grab her, “Little Li’er, let me do it!”","With that said, he walked directly towards Li Mingmei.","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes and didn’t stop him, but she still followed closely behind him.","Li Mingmei was injured and lay down on the ground, unable to get up for a long time, because she fell quite a distance, she could only see the very intimate movements between Huang Yueli and Li Moying, but could not hear what the two were talking about.","Seeing that the two of them walked over together after discussing for a while, Li Mingmei fixed her eyes on Huang Yueli, with shock and jealousy that couldn’t be concealed in her eyes.","The scene she saw today hit her extremely hard.","Originally, although she knew that she was not particularly outstanding among the daughters of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, she still had a dream of a young girl. She always felt that although she was not talented enough, she was not as beautiful as Li Leyun, but she can cook and is considerate, maybe the Young Master may like her?","But who knows, she finally mustered up the courage to act, and she failed the first time!","Moreover, she still saw an unbelievable scene!","Li Moying actually already has someone he likes and she just scolded that damn girl, yet she was taught a lesson by Li Moying himself!","This... How could this be true?","If Li Moying fell in love with Li Leyun, or another proud daughter of the ancient god clan, Li Mingmei felt disappointed, but still felt that it was barely acceptable.","Because she was really inferior to others.","But...","That Young Miss Li is nothing more than a doctor. Even if she says that she was a Divine Doctor, she was probably bragging outside in the name of her Senior Brother!","Moreover, she was only of a human race, and her cultivation talent was definitely not comparable to that of the god race!","Apart from being a little better looking, how was she better than others?","But for a peerless genius like Li Moying, there were so many beauties flovking to him and they were all within easy reach. Being good-looking was not a special advantage at all!","Li Mingmei’s heart turned a thousand times.","Despite the shock, when Li Moying’s tall figure appeared in front of her, with those stern black eyes staring at her, Li Mingmei still felt her heart beat faster.","The voice also softened, “Young Master, I really care about you, so I specially brought you a nourishing soup. You like to cultivate all night, and I deliberately stayed up until five o’clock, just to rest when you leave your seclusion and send it over in time. I hope you can understand Mei’er’s painstaking efforts...”","Like to cultivate all night?","Hearing these words, Huang Yueli was taken aback for a moment, then the corners of her mouth curled up, and she couldn’t help laughing.","It seems that Young Miss Li Mingmei is really sincere towards her husband, and she did a lot of homework before coming here. She must have paid a high price for the news from Li Sijing, right?","What she said casually was actually regarded as the truth by Li Mingmei.","In order to make Li Moying happy, she stayed up all night and waited helplessly in front of the stove to make soup for him...","Tsk tsk, even she was almost moved to tears by Li Mingmei!","It’s a pity that Li Mingmei probably never imagined that her hard work was not only in vain, but also counterproductive!"]},{"number":3830,"title":"Chapter 3830 One After Another (2)","paragraphs":["3830 One After Another (2)","Huang Yueli was snickering here, but Li Moying didn’t notice at all that there was something wrong with Li Mingmei’s words.","In fact, he didn’t listen to the nonsense of other people at all. Except for his little Li’er, other women were no different from air in his eyes.","He only noticed that his little fox suddenly smiled, and also showed two pointed canine teeth, making her look more like a fox.","“Little Li’er, what are you laughing at? Is there anything to be happy about?” He raised his eyebrows, and at the same time stretched out his hand, subconsciously wanting to pinch her pink and tender face.","!!","Huang Yueli took a step back, just in time to dodge.","“It’s nothing, let’s get down to business first, don’t waste time.” Huang Yueli changed the subject.","She would never tell Li Moying how she tricked these women who coveted her husband behind her back.","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but feel funny when she thought of how they would come to please Li Moying with high hopes in the future, but in the end they would annoy him all of a sudden.","Every husband who dared to hook up with her deserved it!","Li Moying felt a little strange, but since Li Mingmei was nearby, he was not in a hurry to ask questions now.","He took one more look at Huang Yueli, then turned to Li Mingmei.","“Is your name Li Mingmei?” A deep voice sounded.","Li Mingmei’s eyes widened immediately, full of surprise, “Yes, that’s right! Young Master, you actually remembered my name, I’m really honoured!”","Even the names of Li Leyun and Li Zijun could only be remembered by the Young Master after the Patriarch and the others mentioned them many times.","As a result, she only came this once, and Li Moying could accurately call her by her name!","She must have been moved by her temperament and appearance, as well as her thoughtfulness, gentleness and virtuousness!","Thinking of this, Li Mingmei became more defenseless in her heart, and her smile became more charming, “Young Master...”","This voice reached Huang Yueli’s ears, causing her to curl her lips in disdain, and even turned her head to stare at her husband.","Li Moying was completely unmoved, his expression was still extremely cold, and he slowly said: “Li Mingmei, you just came to the small courtyard in the back mountain today, and you were driven back by my guards when you didn’t see me. .As for the injury on your body, it was because you fell without seeing clearly while walking, remember?”","Huang Yueli listened, and couldn’t help but burst out laughing again.","She fell without seeing clearly while walking!","Who can fall and suffer such serious internal injuries? Unless it was jumping directly from the cliff!","However, as long as Li Mingmei was successfully brainwashed, and she insisted on it, no one else can say anything.","In Li Mingmei’s eyes, there was still a trace of clarity at the beginning, and when she heard what Li Moying said, she showed a puzzled expression, but just as she was about to ask, she felt a cold breath towards her chest looming...","Li Mingmei couldn’t help shivering all over, and suddenly felt a kind of coldness emanating from her bones.","As this cold feeling entered her mind along her meridians, her consciousness was blurred for a moment.","When she woke up, she had already forgotten where she was, and only felt pain all over her body.","Looking down, I didn’t know what happened and fell to the ground. Her whole body was covered in dirty mud, and the carefully stewed nourishing soup was also scattered all over the floor.","Li Mingmei’s heart ached when she saw the spill."]},{"number":3831,"title":"Chapter 3831 One After Another (3)","paragraphs":["3831 One After Another (3)","She wanted to get up from the ground, but found that she fell very hard, and her whole body hurt so badly that she couldn’t get up at all.","“Young Miss Mingmei, the Young Master has already said that he won’t see you anymore, so don’t make things difficult for us. If you don’t leave, we will be punished as well. Please go back!”","“That’s right, Young Miss Mingmei, you didn’t look at the road when you were walking, and you even fell down, spilling the soup! Seeing how bad your injury is, you should go back and rest quickly!”","“The Young Master is not targeting you, we really don’t allow outsiders to enter here.”","Li Tianyi and the others stood not far away, trying to persuade her.","Immediately in Li Mingmei’s mind, the image of herself falling and spilling the soup while walking at night appeared.","Although she faintly felt that something was wrong, she didn’t think too much about it. She just felt sorry for the soup that she carefully collected all kinds of natural materials and treasures and spent a lot of time stewing.","Li Tianyi took a step forward and said, “Young Miss Mingmei, I have medicine for internal injuries here, you should take one quickly, otherwise if the injury is delayed, we won’t be able to explain it to the Young Master.”","Li Tianyi said, and handed her a black pill.","Li Mingmei took it and swallowed it without thinking too much.","After taking the pill, she immediately felt that the pain in her body had improved significantly, and the stagnation in her meridians had also eased a lot.","Her eyes lit up immediately, “This is really a good medicine! Thank you so much!”","Others have come up with such high-quality pills to save her. If she stays here any longer, if Li Tianyi and the others are scolded, it will be unreasonable.","In desperation, Li Mingmei could only get up by herself, turned around and limped in the opposite direction.","Huang Yueli was hiding not far away, secretly watching.","Seeing Li Mingmei’s figure disappear, she showed a smile.","The elixir was indeed used to heal injuries, but it was not because she sympathized with Li Mingmei, but because she felt that the excuse Li Moying made just now was too ridiculous!","It doesn’t sound like it’s true that she fell while walking at night. If Li Mingmei went back to see an experienced doctor, there was a high possibility that she would be exposed.","In order to avoid trouble, she casually took an elixir to treat internal injuries, and healed her internal injuries first.","In this way, nothing will go wrong.","Huang Yueli nodded to Li Tianyi and the others, and then returned to the room.","As soon as Li Moying saw her, he immediately came over like a clingy little wolf dog, and hurriedly explained: “Little Li’er, I don’t know why someone came here suddenly and wanted to send me a gift. ... Cough cough, send me soup! I really don’t know anything! Since I woke up, I haven’t left the small courtyard, you should know, I definitely haven’t looked at other women!”","Li Moying was afraid that his wife would be jealous and had a cold war with him, so he simply didn’t pay any heed to his dignity and tried to show his innocence in all kinds of pestering ways.","Huang Yueli glanced at him, and suddenly said: “Don’t you still remember her name is Li Mingmei?”","Li Moying was taken aback, and then shouted loudly, “My Lady, I’ve definitely been wronged! I remember her name, isn’t it just to brainwash her? It is written in the “Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual” that you must call out the other party’s name” for the secret method to take effect. Otherwise, I am too lazy to care about the name of that unworthy woman!”"]},{"number":3832,"title":"Chapter 3832 One After Another (4)","paragraphs":["3832 One After Another (4)","Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows and with an expression full of distrust, she said, “Oh? Really? Could it be because someone spent hours making you some nourishing soup, which moved you? Speaking of which, the soup was accidentally spilled! It’s really a pity. If you still want to drink, you can ask someone to tell her! I guarantee that she will happily make another batch and bring it to you.”","Li Moying looked at her with her chin raised, obviously the sourness in her words was about to overflow, but she still had a proud expression on her face. He couldn’t help but feel amused.","“Little Li’er, what are you talking about? I only eat the dishes cooked by you alone! Dishes that are given by other women, I’ll just toss it without any discussion! Didn’t I just toss her soup?”","Thinking of Li Moying’s sudden anger at that time, Huang Yueli finally felt a little better, and glanced at him, “Hmph, you’re right!”","Actually, it’s not that she doesn’t know that Li Moying did nothing wrong today.","It’s just that, in the middle of the night, a woman came over eagerly to please her husband. Such a thing still made her a little upset.","Since she was unhappy, she naturally had to toss her husband a bit, so that she could balance her heart!","Seeing that she had softened, Li Moying immediately walked over, wrapped her in his arms, and lowered his head to kiss her on the lips.","“I already have such a perfect woman, and I’m not a fool. How could I still look up to those vulgar women out there?”","Huang Yueli snorted, but she didn’t dodge. She stood still and let her husband kiss her.","Just as the temperature between the two was gradually rising, a joking voice suddenly came from outside the door.","“Tsk tsk, I’ve heard it all. This morning, there was a good show at the gate of our courtyard! I heard that a certain person was targeted by a woman again, and this time the object was very virtuous. Deliver soup to your door! In my opinion, this delivery of soup is fake, but delivery of the person is real, right? Junior Sister, some men eat what’s in the bowl and think about what’s in the pot, this is absolutely unacceptable!”","Before Liu Buyan could arrive, his voice had already arrived.","And when he opened his mouth, it was in a gloating tone.","When Huang Yueli heard his voice, she froze immediately, and pushed Li Moying’s chest, trying to push him away.","However, Li Moying tightly clasped her slender waist, pressed her hand behind her head, and kissed her even more recklessly, not letting her back away.","At this moment, Liu Buyan had already reached the door of the room.","Looking inside, the smug expression froze immediately, “What...what’s the situation? Junior Sister, those little vixens outside of him have come to him, and you are not angry at all, and even kissed him? Sigh , How many times have I told you, this man... you can’t let him get away with it!”","Huang Yueli’s small face was stained with a blush.","She pushed Li Moying again. This time, the man let her go a bit, but he still put his arms around her waist, showing a possessive gesture.","Li Moying glanced coldly at Liu Buyan, and said, “Actually, you already knew what would happen today, right?”","Huang Yueli was startled when she heard the words, and then recalled the situation where Liu Buyan hesitated to speak a few days ago, she also understood, and immediately said dissatisfied: “Senior Brother, you are not being kind! You know, why didn’t you tell us ?”","Liu Buyan was innocent, “You didn’t ask?”"]},{"number":3833,"title":"Chapter 3833 Peach Blossom Destiny (1)","paragraphs":["3833 Peach Blossom Destiny (1)","“I even took the initiative to mention it, but you didn’t even look at it. I thought, Young Master Li had already figured out how to deal with it!”","As Liu Buyan said this, he couldn’t help laughing in his heart.","Should! Really should!","They only knew how to kiss and show their affection, how could they ignore him, her Senior Brother?!","Hmph! Now they should know, right?","Anyone who insults a single dog will not end well!","However, what surprised him was that Huang Yueli and Li Moying didn’t quarrel. Wasn’t his Junior Sister easily jealous? Hmm, she was so calm today? Could that bastard Li Moying have given her some kind medicine to bewilder her?","Before Liu Buyan could feel complacent, Li Moying’s cold voice came, “Since you won’t even talk about this, then what’s the use of you by our side? You can get out!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Liu Buyan felt a powerful and thick profound force wrap him around him, and pushed him out of the door.","“Hey, wait... wait...”","Liu Buyan hurriedly wanted to stop Li Moying but it was already too late.","With a “plop”, he fell on the grass outside again, and the door was slammed shut in front of him.","Liu Buyan gritted his teeth and got up, the expression on his face was depressing!","“Damn Li Moying, don’t you rely on your own cultivation to be higher than me! You kidnapped my Junior Sister, and yet you still treat me, a senior, with such disrespect!”","Having said that, Liu Buyan also understood that in the God Realm, strength was king.","Moreover, Li Moying was swayed by him today and almost offended his wife. He must have become stifled with anger...","“It seems that I won’t be able to see any big drama today... Sigh, if I had known that I wouldn’t have slept so soundly last night, I would have woken up earlier today!”","Liu Buyan patted the dirt on his body, turned around and left.","Li Tianyi and the others watched from the sidelines, the corners of their mouths twitching non-stop.","They had never seen this Divine Doctor Liu before, and it was the first time they saw this doctor after waking up this time.","It is said that he ascended from the same lower realm as the Young Master and the Young Madame, and was also her Senior Brother. He was very talented in medical skills.","However, this character is really indescribable, he is willing to die all day long!","But it’s strange to say that if it were someone else, it wouldn’t be fun to find their Young Master Like this all day long. I’m afraid the grass on the grave would be as tall as a person, but this Divine Doctor Liu would have fallen at most and hadn’t even scratched his skin. It seems that maybe he was really the Young Master’s good friend?","However, the way the two of them express their friendship is really incomprehensible to ordinary people...","Li Tianyi was stunned for a while, seeing that Liu Buyan had disappeared in the corridor, he hurried forward and knocked on the door.","“Liu Buyan, why haven’t you left yet? If you don’t leave, I’ll be rude, and I’ll show you what true love is!” Li Moying snorted coldly.","Hearing this, Li Tianyi was also terrified.","It turns out that in the past, the Young Master and the Young Madame were not really showing affection.","Then if he made up his mind to show off, what would it look like?","Can you still let single dogs live?","Li Tianyi hurriedly said: “Young...Young Master, it’s me, Li Tianyi. Just now you asked your subordinate to inquire about Young Miss Li Mingmei’s affairs, and your subordinate has already inquired clearly. I don’t know when I can report to you?”","Li Moying didn’t answer right away. There was a rustling sound in the room."]},{"number":3834,"title":"Chapter 3834 Peach Blossom Destiny (2)","paragraphs":["3834 Peach Blossom Destiny (2)","Li Tianyi was puzzled, but he didn’t dare to move, he could only stare at the ground, waiting quietly.","After a while, Huang Yueli’s voice came, “Brother Tianyi, please come in!”","As soon as Li Tianyi pushed the door and walked in, he didn’t even dare to lift his head. He kept his eyes on the ground all the time, and didn’t dare to squint at all.","Sitting on a chair, Huang Yueli laughed angrily at his exaggerated expression.","It’s all because of her Senior Brother who had been yelling outside! Look now, Li Tianyi and the rest had dodging gazes and with the guilty expression, it seems that she really did something shameful with Li Moying!","But in reality, all they did was to hug each other!","Compared to Huang Yueli’s depression, Li Moying’s expression was calm, and there was a flicker of apprehension in his eyes.","“Well, what have you heard? Tell me quickly.”","Li Tianyi said respectfully: “Yes! This subordinate just went to the Main Palace and asked the clansman then knew that the Patriarch invited all the Elders to the main hall to discuss. The topic was revolved around your marriage, Young Master. In the end, it was decided that your wife, Young Master, must be selected from within the clan. However, it does not have to be the top genius. It doesn’t matter which branch of the family she’s from and it doesn’t matter how talented she is. As long as the first lady to give birth to an heir will righteously become the Young Madame. Other women, as long as they have had a romantic relationship with the Young Master, can become a concubine...”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli’s complexion completely changed, it couldn’t be darker.","Although she also heard from Li Sijing earlier that the Cloudy Qilin Clan was going to choose a concubine for Li Moying.","However, Li Sijing didn’t understand it in detail, and she didn’t intend to be a phoenix herself, so she just said it as a gossip.","But now, Li Tianyi said the specific plan, but she still couldn’t accept it.","“The first to give birth to a heir for Young Master Li...the first! It seems that there are more than one or two women who will give birth for Young Master Li in the future, let alone those who can climb into Young Master Li’s bed! Young Master Li is really blessed! At that time, I, an old woman who has passed away, will no longer be a young sweet thing. Hmm, I have not been pregnant for two years after marrying you, so should I be kicked out immediately?”","Huang Yueli’s jealous tone made Li Moying shudder.","“Ahem, Little Li’er, what are you thinking? What kind of blessing is this? I’m about to die of anger, alright? How could the Patriarch do such a thing behind my back? I must go and explain it to him!”","“Make it clear? How can I say it clearly? The Patriarch is for your own good! How many men don’t love the women who come to your door? What’s more, the girls of the Cloudy Qilin Clan are all talented and beautiful. If you go outside, you will be sought after by young talents from the God Realm, but in front of our Young Master Li, not only do you have to recommend yourself as a pillow, but also everyone is rushing to give birth for you!”","Huang Yueli’s beautiful big eyes were about to burst into flames!","A woman like Li Leyun, although she considers herself to be Li Moying’s fiancée, in fact, she has never even touched a single finger of Li Moying’s, and, with Li Leyun’s identity, she will not be able to directly climb up Li Moying’s bed.","Just like that, Huang Yueli also felt that her own things were being coveted by others."]},{"number":3835,"title":"Chapter 3835 Peach Blossom Destiny (3)","paragraphs":["3835 Peach Blossom Destiny (3)","Now it’s even worse!","Li Shihong made such a condition that all Cloudy Qilin Clan ladies had hope and thought that they held a chance.","In order to successfully ascend to the throne of Young Madame, many people must have come up with various dirty tricks!","Whoever can get pregnant first, she will be able to be the wife of Li Moying, the number one genius in the God Realm!","Even without mentioning his shocking cultivation talent, just his face, would cause a disaster to the country! It was enough to make those women go through fire and water for him.","The more Huang Yueli thought about it, the more angry she felt, her cheeks puffed up, and shot a dagger glare towards Li Moying unceremoniously.","Li Moying’s heart was ringing with alarm bells. At this moment, he regretted why he let Li Tianyi in, and told the story in front of Huang Yueli.","He thought that a woman like Li Mingmei was already the most vile and shameless. His little fox was already angry just now, and it was impossible for her to be more angry.","But who would have known that every time Li Tianyi opened his mouth, Huang Yueli would be blown away!","Thinking of this, Li Moying turned his head and gave Li Tianyi a hard glare.","Why does this guy feel more and more stupid since he came back from the coma from the injury last time? He actually told Huang Yueli those words directly! Not even a touch of cover up! Wasn’t this trying to harm him?","Although Li Tianyi didn’t raise his head, he was not an idiot with a slow sense, and he immediately felt this extremely fierce murderous aura!","He almost cried on the spot.","After he finished speaking, he also realized that he was stupid, moreover, he was even more stupid than Divine Doctor Liu who was kicked out of the door just now!","This is the end... Maybe it will be even worse!","Fortunately, Li Moying didn’t have the time to do anything to him as he was still explaining to Huang Yueli.","“Little Li’er, Little Li’er, listen to me! This is all the wishful thinking of the Patriarch, and it has nothing to do with me. What... what kind of heir, it is nonsense! I only have you in my heart, I My body can only accept you! I have never even seen who those women are, and I have no interest in them!”","“Then if you’ve seen any of them before and think she’s pretty, you’ll be interested?”","“I...”","Li Moying almost bit off his own tongue, and quickly shook his head in denial, “No, no, even if I’ve seen anyone else, I’m not interested at all!”","Huang Yueli snorted coldly, without even looking at him.","When she was in the Lower Realm many years ago, someone did a divination for Mu Chengying at that time and mentioned that his life was too prosperous and has a peach blossom destiny. He would definitely become a flirtatious master, with lovers all over the world who were devoted to him.","Unless he meets the proud daughter of heaven who was more lucky than him and whose life is more precious than his, then it would be possible to calm down.","But his fate was already precious enough, so how could anyone be able to compare with him?","However, Huang Yueli didn’t take this nonsense to heart at the time.","After all, she was the little palace lord of the Mythical Flame Palace at that time, and she never felt that she was inferior to Mu Chengying in any way.","Facts have also proved that her fate has indeed suppressed Mu Chengying’s peach blossom destiny.","And now...","Her husband has been reborn as Li Moying, and they have also ascended to the God Realm.","But in the end, Li Moying’s fate seems to be the same? The peach blossoms are so exuberant that people can’t look directly at them!","But this time...","She also didn’t take those women seriously."]},{"number":3836,"title":"Chapter 3836 Peach Blossom Destiny (4)","paragraphs":["3836 Peach Blossom Destiny (4)","However, no matter how much she had disregarded it, she will definitely not be less jealous.","After all, women are so hypocritical!","Li Moying surrounded her and coaxed her for a long time, but he didn’t see any sign of improvement in her complexion.","He wanted to coax his wife well, but after much deliberation, there was nothing he could do.","As a gift, all his property has been handed over to Huang Yueli a long time ago, and his little fox has such high vision, he has never seen any good things, what else can he find to surprise her?","Normally, when he was jealous, Huang Yueli would cook his favorite dishes to coax him.","However, Li Moying’s own craftsmanship was not very good, and he had disgusted Huang Yueli countless times.","If he came to cook to coax his wife in such a manner, it might be counterproductive...","In desperation, Li Moying could only follow behind Huang Yueli shamelessly, wherever she went, he would follow.","Huang Yueli cultivated, and he meditated beside her.","When Huang Yueli was refining the weapon, he was watching the fire for her at the door.","When Huang Yueli took a bath, he just...","“Ouch! Lady, don’t hit me! I... I didn’t do anything!” Li Moying defended himself innocently.","Huang Yueli gave him a blank look, “Your hands are all in my skirt, how dare you say you didn’t do anything!”","“I just saw that you were too tired, so I wanted to help you take off your clothes, so that you could spend less effort.” Li Moying said with a serious face.","Huang Yueli was about to slap him away with a slap! When she was a three-year-old child, she could say such deceptive words!","This man clearly wanted to find an opportunity to kiss her, and then take the opportunity to use his beauty tricks to coax her.","It has to be said that this move was too ruthless, because Huang Yueli herself did not have the confidence to be immune to Li Moying’s beauty trick.","“I’m not tired at all! As long as you disappear from my eyes quickly!” Huang Yueli pursed her mouth and pushed his chest hard, trying to push him out of the room.","Li Moying really wanted to hang on, but she was afraid that his wife’s little hand would hurt if she exerted too much force, so he could only follow her strength and take a step back.","The moment he stepped out of the door with one foot, Li Moying suddenly thought of something, and his eyes lit up.","“By the way, Little Li’er, I suddenly thought of something!”","Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows and looked at him with an expression of “see how you play”.","Li Moying said: “The dual cultivation method of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow that we cultivated together, I found time to read it myself...”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli cursed under her breath.","She really shouldn’t have listened to Li Moying’s nonsense, his mind was simply full of such rubbish! Knowing that they can’t cultivate dual cultivation now, but went to read that book, it’s just bad intentions!","Just when she wanted to chase him away, Li Moying quickly continued: “It is written clearly that there are restrictions on both parties to cultivate this set of exercises. After the first dual cultivation, in the future, you can only dual cultivate with the same person, if you steal food outside, the strength that has increased due to the dual cultivation will gradually dissipate! Do you remember this?”","Huang Yueli was stunned, and vaguely remembered that there seemed to be such a thing.","Seeing her expression, Li Moying smiled smugly, “So, Little Li’er, you are just worrying blindly! Even if you don’t believe me, don’t you believe in the exercises of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow?”"]},{"number":3837,"title":"Chapter 3837 There Is Still This Move (1)","paragraphs":["3837 There Is Still This Move (1)","Huang Yueli originally wanted to continue putting on airs and let her husband coax her.","But she didn’t expect that Li Moying was so witty, and even went to study the dual cultivation method of Saint Iniquitous Shadow in depth.","Having said all that, no matter how difficult she made it for him, it seemed a bit unreasonable.","Huang Yueli glared at him, and reluctantly said: “Alright, what you said makes sense, then...”","Li Moying’s eyes lit up, and she was ready. He wanted to wait for Huang Yueli to forgive him, then embrace his little fox and throw her on the bed.","God knows, the little fox has been lukewarm to him these two days, which makes him so depressed that she won’t even let him kiss!","It made him wonder for a while, did he become ugly and unattractive to his wife?","Now he finally coaxed her...","However, just when Huang Yueli pouted and was about to continue speaking——","Suddenly, there was a series of knocks on the door.","This sudden change caused Huang Yueli to stop suddenly. She realized that the distance between the two was getting closer and closer, and they were close to kissing each other. She quickly pushed her husband.","“Someone is knocking on the door?”","Li Moying’s face turned dark immediately!","Just a little bit, he was able to kiss his own little fox!","At such a critical moment, which blind person dares to disturb him?","Li Moying’s face immediately darkened, and he raised her voice coldly and said, “Who’s outside?”","Outside the door, Li Tianer, who hadn’t received a response for a long time, was about to knock on the door again. When he heard his Young Master’s cold tone, he couldn’t help breaking out in a cold sweat.","It seems that he came at the wrong time. Could it be that the Young Master was staying with the Young Madame?","Thinking of this, Li Tianer was very annoyed. He didn’t read the almanac when he went out today! How could he be so unlucky?","And thinking of what he was going to report to Li Moying, Li Tianer became even more uneasy.","That day, because Li Mingmei was not dealt with properly, the Young Madame and the Young Master had a cold war. Li Tianyi was immediately dispatched by Li Moying to cut firewood in the backyard. Now, was it his turn?","“What’s the matter? What are you doing outside? Why don’t you come in?” Li Moying didn’t expect that the people outside didn’t respond, and frowned impatiently.","Li Tianer knew that it was too late for him to regret it now, so he could only bite the bullet and push the door in.","“Young...Young Master, it’s... subordinate.”","“What are you doing here? What’s the matter? Tell me!” Li Moying said angrily.","He can’t stand anyone who dares to disturb his intimacy with his little fox.","Seeing this, Huang Yueli quickly tugged him, and at the same time, glared at him.","Really! See how he scared the Brother Tianer?","As Li Moying’s close guards, who doesn’t know that Li Moying was very attached to his wife, and to dare to disturb him at this time, it only meant that they must have something important to report.","Huang Yueli turned to Li Tianer, and immediately showed a warm smile, “Brother Tianer, don’t worry, what happened? Take your time.”","Li Moying’s gaze towards Li Tianer became even more unkind.","His wife raised her nose and eyes at him, but she actually smiled at Li Tianer!","Now chopping firewood is useless, Li Tianer must be dispatched to the suburbs to dig coal!","Li Tianer lowered his head, felt two different eyes on him in front of him, and was even more nervous, almost kneeling down to this young couple!"]},{"number":3838,"title":"Chapter 3838 There Is Still This Move (2)","paragraphs":["3838 There Is Still This Move (2)","He was begging frantically in his heart, Young Madame, please do not smile at him!","He would rather the Young Madame be an arrogant Young Madame who was particularly harsh on her subordinates than this...","If Huang Yueli continued to smile, his life would probably be lost.","Li Tianer was afraid that there would be another accident, so he didn’t care about anything else, so he braced himself and quickly explained his intention.","“Young Master, Young Madame, it’s like this, a few visitors came to the courtyard just now...”","Li Moying heard the beginning, then interrupted him with a frown, “Didn’t I say it many times, I don’t see any outsiders, especially women! No matter which daughter in the family comes to this courtyard with any reason, stop them all for me! It doesn’t matter who they are! Is there even a need to ask?”","His displeased tone made Li Tianer tremble all over.","He quickly explained: “Young Master, this time is different, the Patriarch and Elder Qingsong personally brought people over, so it’s not easy for the subordinates to stop...”","Although Li Moying usually has no scruples in the clan, most of the time, he still will not refuse Patriarch Li Shihong in the face.","Last time because of Li Leyun’s matter, Li Moying had a little friction with Li Shihong. Although neither of them intended to hold grudges, it was not very appropriate to keep Li Shihong out at this time.","Therefore, Li Tianer and the other guards thought about it for a while before they finally decided to ask the Young Master for instructions at the risk of offending him.","After hearing this, Li Moying really hesitated.","But he hesitated for a while, and still said: “Please go back and inform Patriarch and Elder Qingsong that I said to not see any visitors, that’s...”","“No, you should go and meet them!” Huang Yueli interrupted him.","Li Moying frowned and looked at his beloved wife beside him.","He couldn’t bear to be separated from his Little Li’er, so he decided to refuse.","He had been looking forward to it for several days to finally reconcile with his wife and kiss her!","Other messy things are not as important as his wife, and Li Shihong and others have to stand aside!","Huang Yueli looked at his sad eyes, and pushed him, “You forgot? The order that Patriarch Li gave a few days ago?”","Li Moying was a little puzzled at first, because what Huang Yueli said was really a bit cryptic.","However, seeing his little fox puffed up her cheeks and seemed a little displeased, he suddenly remembered.","“You mean...the fact that the Patriarch wanted to choose a fiancée for me?” Li Moying’s mouth suddenly showed a smile, and his tone of voice was filled with a bit of joking.","Huang Yueli gave him a blank look, and twisted her fingers on his arm, “You have the nerve to say so! Take this opportunity to settle the matter, and if anyone comes to the door again, I will run away from home!”","Although Li Moying issued a strict order, no women are allowed to approach the courtyard, not even female animals!","However, there are still women who are not afraid of death, trying to get in by various methods.","How many people have the idea of flying up to the branches overnight, thinking that as long as they can climb into the Young Master’s bed, no matter what, at least they can be called the Young Master’s concubine.","With such a god-level genius as a husband, even if she was only a concubine, she could enjoy an extremely honourable position.","Just for this, no matter how much risk one took, it was worth it.","Besides, the Young Master was also a man, how can there be any reason not to eat the meat that was brought to his mouth?"]},{"number":3839,"title":"Chapter 3839 There Is Still This Move (3)","paragraphs":["3839 There Is Still This Move (3)","Even though Li Tianer and the others patrolled day and night, these women who were not afraid of death were expelled after they failed to get close to the small courtyard within a radius of ten miles.","However, Huang Yueli still felt a little overwhelmed.","She had made things difficult for Li Moying over the past two days and she somehow intends to vent her anger because of this.","When Li Moying heard his wife threaten to run away from home, he immediately shivered and dared not say anything more.","!!","He immediately raised his right hand and promised, “I’ll go right away, and I promise to take care of it. Little Li’er, please don’t run away from home. I’m absolutely loyal to you. Don’t think about it...”","Huang Yueli pursed her lips, “Then why don’t you go quickly?”","Li Moying looked at her, “How about...you stay with me?”","“Together?” Huang Yueli frowned, “No, what capacity should I go with you now? Our relationship can’t be revealed yet!”","Li Moying was extremely reluctant and did not feel like leaving her side at all so he quickly pretended to be pitiful and tried to persuade her, “But, I don’t want to see outsiders at all, I just want to be with you... If you don’t accompany me, I’m afraid I won’t have the patience to entertain the Patriarch and the others. Besides, don’t you want to hear for yourself how I reject them? Don’t worry, I won’t disclose the relationship between the two of us, just say that you worry about my body, and you have to follow and watch, that’s it.”","Li Tianer was listening to his Young Master’s words from the sidelines, his cold sweat dripping from his forehead onto the ground.","It’s not that he wants to stay here to eavesdrop so openly but the Young Master had not told him to leave, so he could only wait here and wait for the Young Master to go to the front hall to meet the Patriarch and the others.","As a result, this made him hear things he shouldn’t have heard.","Although the Young Master of his family has always been a typical wife-slave, and it was not uncommon to see how he pampers his wife excessively but hearing the usual cold-blooded and ruthless Young Master suddenly speak in such a coquettish tone, it still made him shudder all over and have goosebumps.","Was the man in front of him who was acting like a boy who was trying hard to please the rich woman really their wise and mighty Young Master?","Was there something wrong?","Or did Elder Tao and the others save the wrong person two months ago?","Li Tianer’s thoughts were flying amok when Huang Yueli’s voice suddenly sounded not far from him, “Brother Tianer, what’s wrong with you? Take us there quickly?”","“Eh? Ah, yes, yes! Young Master, Young Madame, please follow me!”","Li Tianer quickly came back to his senses, hurriedly strode to the front, and began to lead the way.","Not long after, Huang Yueli and Li Moying arrived at the front hall.","The courtyard where Li Moying lived temporarily was relatively simple, and the front hall for receiving guests was also quite small. With five or six people squeezed in, it seems a bit cramped.","The two walked into the front hall, and after only one glance, they were a little surprised.","Because, when Li Tianer reported earlier, he only mentioned that Li Shihong and Li Qingsong were among the visitors, but he didn’t mention that they brought such a large group of followers!","Except for Li Shihong and that Elder, the remaining four were all young clansmen.","Huang Yueli glanced at them, and felt that the aura emanating from them was quite strong, and they were obviously very talented masters.","When Li Shihong saw Li Moying, a smile appeared on his face.","“Moying, I haven’t seen you for a few days, but your complexion is quite good! I was worried that you advanced too fast and your body might not be able to bear it. Now it seems that I have been worrying too much!”"]},{"number":3840,"title":"Chapter 3840 There Is Still This Move (4)","paragraphs":["3840 There Is Still This Move (4)","Seeing Li Shihong’s enthusiastic attitude, Li Moying was too embarrassed to continue putting on a cold face.","He immediately nodded and said: “Thank you, Patriarch, for your concern. I have been treated by Divine Doctor Li and Divine Doctor Liu by my side. I haven’t felt any discomfort so far. It’s all thanks to the two of them that this advancement went so smoothly. ”","“Ha ha, that’s good, that’s good! The two Divine Doctors have shown great kindness to our Cloudy Qilin Clan, and I will always keep it in my heart.”","Li Shihong looked at Li Moying’s side. Although he was a little surprised that Li Moying would bring this Divine Doctor with him when he came to see him, he didn’t show it.","On the contrary, he also said a few words of courtesy to Huang Yueli.","In front of outsiders, Huang Yueli carefully kept a distance of more than five steps away from Li Moying, and kept a decent smile on her face, chatting with Li Shihong about Li Moying’s physical condition.","Li Moying listened from the side, and glanced at his wife with some dissatisfaction.","Why are you standing so far away?","Even if she didn’t admit that she was his wife, there was still no need to stay so far away!","He really wants to send these people away quickly, so that he can hug his little fox and give her a good kiss.","Thinking of this, Li Moying interrupted the conversation between Huang Yueli and Li Shihong, “Alright, there was nothing wrong with my health, and you have personally asked Divine Doctor Li, so you should feel relieved now? Is there anything else? ”","Li Shihong remembered the purpose of coming here today, paused, and turned his head to exchange a look with Li Qingsong beside him.","Li Moying saw their interaction, and suddenly had a bad premonition in his heart.","Li Shihong showed a kind smile, and said: “Moying, you know that the God Realm’s Grand Meet will start in about ten days. This competition is very important to the whole clan. It can be said to be the most important event in the past thirty years...”","Li Moying nodded and said: “I know. Don’t worry, Patriarch, my body has recovered very well, and I can participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet.”","“Ahem, you can compete, it’s basically confirmed now, but besides you, there must be a large number of people in our family who want to participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet. After all, apart from you being the number one, there are ninety nine places to compete for, and the clan also wants to occupy a few more places.” Li Shihong said.","Li Moying frowned, “So... what does this have to do with me? As far as I know, Elder Tao and the others are responsible for this matter, right?”","A big family like the Cloudy Qilin Clan naturally had long been prepared for such a major event as the God Realm’s Grand Meet.","Even twenty years ago, they began to select the geniuses in the clan and conduct targeted training.","Although according to the rules of the God Realm’s Grand Meet, all cultivators under the age of fifty and above the Dream Profound Realm can sign up for the competition, but in fact, ninety-nine percent of the people who sign up are just cannon fodder and truly capable of competing for the top 100 are only the most elite heaven-level geniuses of the major ancient God Clans.","Almost every God Realm’s Grand Meet, the top 100 were dominated by the major God Clans.","Moreover, the cultivators who can be ranked had all been carefully cultivated in the family since childhood.","Li Shihong smiled and said: “Our clan has five places that can skip the preliminary round and directly enter the semi-finals. Those who can enter the list of five people are the geniuses of our family who are most likely to get the ranking! You are one. In addition, a few days ago, the whole clan held a contest and four more were selected. They are the ones behind me!”"]},{"number":3841,"title":"Chapter 3841 There Is Still This Move (5)","paragraphs":["3841 There Is Still This Move (5)","After Li Shihong finished speaking, he looked at the people behind him.","The four hurried out and saluted Li Moying, “Young Master!”","Li Moying glanced at them lightly, frowned slightly, “The Patriarch means...”","Li Shihong hurriedly said: “The four of them admire you very much, and have always wanted to have the opportunity to practice with you. Moying, you see, it’s only a few days away from the God Realm’s Grand Meet, why don’t you let them stay with you? How about giving them some pointers when you have time?”","Hearing this, Li Moying frowned even more, “Patriarch, I don’t understand this. Although I have good talent, in terms of cultivation, I’m only at the Heart Profound Realm. There are so many Dao Profound Realms in our clan, not to mention the Elders of the Dao Profound Realm, and even the Supreme Elder who is at the Life Profound Realm, how can it be my turn to give advice to others?”","“Don’t say that!” Li Shihong smiled, and said: “Although cultivators in the Dao Profound Realm have a high understanding of martial arts and fighting skills, their comprehension of the laws of heaven and earth are really too deep for cultivators in the Dream Profound Realm. But you are different. Everyone is at the Heart Profound Realm, and your comprehension was much higher than theirs. Just give them a little guidance, and all of you will be able to make great progress. Especially now that time is tight, it will definitely be more effective to practice with you.”","As he spoke, he gave a look to the people behind him.","The four young cultivators were also very clever, and they complimented Li Moying one after another.","“Young Master, we have all admired you for a long time!”","“That’s right, Young Master, is also at the Heart Profound Realm, why can’t we block even one move from you, can you give us some tips on the techniques here?”","“We promise to practice quietly and will never disturb you, Young Master!”","The few of them were originally the top talents cultivated by the Cloudy Qilin Clan. They were among the most outstanding heaven-level geniuses in the clan, and even in the entire God Realm.","Therefore, in front of their peers, everyone was extremely arrogant with their nostrils upturned.","But now at Li Moying’s place, everyone was humbled and extremely respectful.","Moreover, this kind of respect was not due to the situation and had to pretend, but was full of reverence for Li Moying from the bottom of his heart!","Li Shihong laughed, “Moying, you have heard it all. The four of them are sincerely asking for advice. You don’t have to worry about it. Don’t worry, I have explained to them and will never disturb your cultivation. When you are free, just give them some pointers, that’s all.”","They immediately looked at Li Moying eagerly.","As far as this was concerned, Li Moying shouldn’t have refused due to emotion and reason.","But no one expected that after hearing so many compliments, Li Moying still had no expression on his face, and at the end, he shook his head again and said firmly: “No, please ask the Patriarch to take them back! ”","Li Shihong was taken aback, apparently he did not expect Li Moying to be so determined.","Even if he was too lazy to point these people out, it doesn’t take much effort to let them stay near the small courtyard to practice. At most, he just ignores them. Why was there any need to refuse?","As long as Li Moying nods, it was equivalent to selling favours to the branch Elders where these geniuses work, so don’t take it too easy.","It was also out of this consideration that Li Shihong brought them here excitedly."]},{"number":3842,"title":"Chapter 3842 There Is Still This Move (6)","paragraphs":["3842 There Is Still This Move (6)","“Moying...” Li Shihong wanted to persuade him again.","Before Li Moying could refuse, Huang Yueli took a step forward and interrupted him.","“Patriarch, you don’t need to persuade me anymore. Now that I’ve said this, I won’t hide it from you. Although Young Master Li’s health has recovered a lot, after all, his vital energy has been seriously injured, so he needs at least six hours a day. During this period, there should be no disturbance of any sound. Now there are few people in the small courtyard, and the guards are very careful, so there is no problem, but if there are more people, it will be chaotic!”","“What? You have to rest for such a long time every day? Is it because of the damage to the primordial spirit? But, didn’t you say that Moying has almost recovered? Even when he advanced, there were no accidents? ”","!!","As soon as he heard Huang Yueli say that Li Moying’s body still had problems, Li Shihong immediately became nervous, immediately put aside the matter of those few heavenly geniuses, and hurriedly asked questions.","Huang Yueli made a look of embarrassment, sneaked a glance at Li Moying, and then said: “This...is that Young Master Li has never let me tell. However, if so many outsiders are really allowed to live in, I’m really sorry. I worry...”","“Moying? Why don’t you tell me the truth? How is your body?” Li Shihong turned to Li Moying when he heard this, worrying and blaming him.","As soon as Li Moying heard his little fox speak, he immediately understood.","Without changing his face, he said calmly: “The soul is indeed a little damaged, but as long as I take a good rest, it will not affect anything. After the start of the God Realm’s Grand Meet, the first round of preliminary competition will take seven days, and it will be my turn after that. It must be more than 90% better. However, if someone disturbs my rest every day, it is not necessarily...”","“Ah? This...” Li Shihong was suddenly speechless.","He wanted Li Moying to keep him, but it involved his body...","This made him really unable to make a decision.","Seeing that Li Shihong didn’t speak, Li Moying was a little surprised, raised his eyebrows slightly, and secretly exchanged a look with his wife.","This was strange. According to Li Shihong’s consistent performance, no matter how important things were, nothing else was more important than Li Moying’s health. That was the top priority of the entire Cloudy Qilin Clan!","But now, after hearing the reason Huang Yueli made up, Li Shihong didn’t immediately give up his plan to send people to him?","This was really abnormal?","Pointing out four heaven-level geniuses was not a big deal for the clan, was it?","Huang Yueli looked at Li Shihong thoughtfully, and then looked behind him.","Among the four top heaven-level geniuses, three were young men, and only one was a woman. Given the strong bloodlines of the ancient god clan, all four of them were very good looking.","Huang Yueli’s eyes lingered on the woman for a while, before she was noticed by the other party, and raised her head to look at her.","Huang Yueli frowned slightly, suddenly feeling a little uncomfortable.","Although the other party looked very clean and tidy, just like a heroic heroine, completely different from Li Leyun’s white lotus, but for some reason, the other party’s eyes made her feel disgusted.","At this moment, after a short hesitation, Li Shihong finally spoke again.","“Well, you’re right. There are too many people, and it really affects your rest. How about this? I don’t ask you to let all four of them stay, just keep Zijun!”"]},{"number":3843,"title":"Chapter 3843 There Is Still This Move (7)","paragraphs":["3843 There Is Still This Move (7)","As soon as the words fell, Li Moying suddenly understood, and his face sank.","Li Shihong did not notice the change in his expression, and continued: “The four of them were selected by the family competition, and Zijun won the first place with an absolute advantage. This time, apart from you, Zijun is the most It is possible to get a good ranking in the God Realm’s Grand Meet. The elders of the family value her very much.”","He said, looking at Li Qingsong beside him, “Elder Qingsong, you have cultivated an outstanding talent for the family! If it weren’t for this family competition, I wouldn’t know that Zijun is already so strong now! ”","Li Qingsong twirled his beard and smiled peacefully, “Patriarch, you have overpraised me, Zijun is still young, and it is mostly luck that she won the first place in the family competition this time! If it weren’t for other masters in the family who did not turn up, without a big competition, it would be impossible for her to win so easily! Patriarch, please don’t praise her, if she gets carried away, it will be bad.”","!!","Hearing this, Li Shihong’s face changed slightly, but he quickly returned to normal.","The absent master in the family, although he said it in a cryptic manner, anyone who understands knows that he was referring to his niece Li Leyun?","Li Leyun has always overwhelmed Li Zijun in the past, but this time she was not here, so Li Zijun picked up a ready-made bargain.","Although the two girls were both heaven-level geniuses of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, there was still a difference in their closeness. He naturally hopes that his niece will be the first.","It’s a pity, Li Leyun really doesn’t live up to expectations!","It’s fine if she didn’t participate in the family competition, now even the opportunity to practice with Li Moying had been given to Li Zijun!","Li Shihong was inevitably depressed, but he still remembered that his identity was first and foremost the Patriarch of the entire Cloudy Qilin Clan, so he could barely suppress this discomfort.","He laughed dryly, and said, “Elder Qingsong is really worrying too much. Zijun has always been the most stable, and I am very relieved of her! Don’t be too harsh on her.”","“I’m doing it for her, Zijun has a bright future. It’s not just about talent and strength, but also a mind that matches it!” Li Qingsong laughed and looked at Li Zijun.","The meaning in the words was already implying that Li Zijun is the person who is most likely to be on the throne of Young Madame.","Li Zijun knew it well, lowered his head slightly, and a faint blush appeared on her face.","Although she has a cold personality and strength and was often said to be the same as a man in the family, she was still a girl after all.","Usually, she doesn’t show the shyness of a girl, and it’s only because, in her eyes, these heavenly geniuses in the family were not worthy of her.","But Li Moying was different...","Such a talent, such a status, such an appearance, and such... strong and domineering.","Please tell her, who can resist his charm?","Hearing that Li Leyun had implicated herself and was kicked out of by Li Moying’s name, Li Zijun was so excited that she almost jumped up.","Her chance finally came!","Although Li Shihong later changed his words and said that he would let Li Moying personally choose the woman he likes, instead of choosing from the heavenly geniuses, this made Li Zijun a little disappointed.","She was arrogant by nature, but she has no interest in competing with those earth-level geniuses!","But later, Li Moying rejected all those women who came to flatter him, which made her hopeful again."]},{"number":3844,"title":"Chapter 3844 There Is Still This Move (8)","paragraphs":["3844 There Is Still This Move (8)","Huang Yueli also noticed it at this time.","Today’s episode, why Li Moying was required to instruct the family’s heavenly geniuses in actual combat training, was actually a routine, the purpose was to pave the way for Li Zijun!","There was actually this move!","Directly ask the Patriarch and Elders to come forward and push people to Li Moying’s side.","This was much better than those women who came to seduce Li Moying with their own soup!","Huang Yueli had heard the name Li Zijun before, and it was said that she was the one who would finally compete with Li Leyun for the throne of Li Moying’s fiancée.","However, ever since Huang Yueli arrived at Amethyst Paramount Palace, she only saw Li Leyun jumping around by herself. This Li Zijun has not only never been here, but she has never met her before. She heard that she has been cultivating in her residence. .","Huang Yueli misunderstood that she had no interest in Li Moying, it was just the people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan talking nonsense.","But now it seems...","A certain person’s peach blossoms was really blooming everywhere, even in every corner!","At an angle where no one was paying attention, Huang Yueli raised her hand and twisted the back of Li Moying’s waist.","Li Moying gasped and almost screamed out.","Although his little fox’s attack was quite heavy, for him, such pain was easy to bear. What really made him tremble was when he discovered that his little fox was angry again!","Li Moying turned his head quickly, and blinked pitifully at his wife.","He was really wronged, right?","Where did these inexplicable rotten peach blossoms come from? He obviously never looked at any other women!","Li Shihong was really too hateful. There was really no way to stay in this Amethyst Paramount Palace!","After the God Realm’s Grand Meet, he might as well not come back!","To save the little fox from being jealous every day, he has no time to coax his wife from morning till night.","Huang Yueli glared at him, then turned her head arrogantly.","But at this time, Li Shihong and Li Qingsong were courteous back and forth, as if they were about to finalize the matter.","Hearing this, Li Moying couldn’t care less about coaxing his wife anymore, he couldn’t help frowning and said, “Patriarch, Elder Qingsong, I didn’t agree to let Li Zijun stay.”","Li Qingsong’s face froze immediately. He didn’t expect that the Young Master would be so disrespectful to him.","Li Shihong was also a little embarrassed, “Moying, just stay alone in the small courtyard. You also know Li Zijun. Her concentration in daily practice was no less than yours. She will never disturb you.”","“Since she’s practicing from morning to night, why does she have to come to me?” Li Moying refuted coldly.","“This... When you are free, you can give her pointers...”","“I’m not free!” Li Moying said simply and rudely.","Just now he had the time to argue with Li Shihong, but now, his little fox was angry! If he doesn’t rush to coax her, he will be deprived of the right to kiss again after working so hard for the past three days!","This was a top priority!","As soon as Li Moying spoke, everyone present froze in place.","Li Zijun’s blushing face just now became bloodless in an instant.","When she heard that Li Leyun was driven away and those flattering women were kicked out, Li Zijun was still secretly happy, thinking that she was the one who had really figured out what Li Moying liked.","A peerless genius like Li Moying would not indulge in beauty like ordinary men. His partner should be able to fight side by side with him!","This requires not only outstanding natural strength, but also calmness and determination to match it.","Just like her!"]},{"number":3845,"title":"Chapter 3845 Sworn (1)","paragraphs":["3845 Sworn (1)","Li Zijun came here full of confidence, thinking that Li Moying would let her stay for the sake of Li Shihong and others.","When the time comes, if she shows her excellence again, it will definitely impress Li Moying.","But who would have known that Li Moying not only didn’t look at her directly, but even didn’t give Li Shihong face, and refused without hesitation.","Li Shihong frowned, obviously displeased.","Seeing this, Huang Yueli hurriedly took a step forward, and said: “Patriarch Li, Elder Qingsong, it’s really inconvenient right now. Young Master Li will get a little irritable if he doesn’t rest well. He got up early, so his mind...”","She spoke slowly, her voice was soft but firm, and there seemed to be a magical power that could calm people’s hearts.","Li Shihong, who was still somewhat dissatisfied with Li Moying’s attitude, immediately relaxed.","That’s right, Li Moying hasn’t fully recovered, but for the sake of the family’s honour, he has been working hard to practice, and wants to represent the clan to participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet.","At this moment, he insisted on stuffing people here, which really disturbed him.","Anyway, the future was long, and it won’t be too late for them to cultivate their relationship after the God Realm’s Grand Meet competition was over.","If Li Zijun can be more aggressive and get a good ranking in the God Realm’s Grand Meet, maybe they can get Li Moying to notice her without the help of their Elders.","Thinking of this, Li Shihong didn’t harp on it any further, and said, “Alright, Moying, you still have to pay attention to your body, and if you feel uncomfortable, you should send someone to tell me in time, don’t hold it in. As for Li Zijun and the others... I’ll bring them back first!”","Li Moying didn’t respond.","Huang Yueli secretly kicked him before he said, “Thank you, Patriarch, for your understanding.”","Li Shihong nodded to Huang Yueli, “Then I’ll have to ask Divine Doctor Li to worry about it. Alright, let’s go.”","Li Qingsong was obviously quite unwilling, with an eager look on his face, as if he wanted to say something.","However, Li Shihong ignored him and walked outside first. In desperation, he had no choice but to follow.","The three male geniuses knew that they were the foils, so they all left without saying a word.","Only Li Zijun was at the end, walking slowly step by step, as if by doing so, she could wait until Li Moying suddenly opened his mouth to keep her.","However, until she stepped out of the courtyard with one foot, there was no movement behind her.","Li Zijun still couldn’t help it, and looked back.","At this glance, she couldn’t help being shocked.","Because, she seemed to see that Li Moying turned around and was talking to the girl beside him.","And the distance between the two seems to be a bit too close, already exceeding the distance between normal people talking.","It seems that if they get closer, the two can kiss each other at any time.","However, the position where Huang Yueli was standing happened to be behind Li Moying. Although Li Zijun felt that their posture was a bit weird, from her perspective, she really couldn’t see clearly what the two were doing.","Li Zijun stopped subconsciously and turned his head to see clearly.","But at this moment...","“Young Miss Zijun, you are going the wrong way. You have to go down the mountain on the left side.” A cold voice sounded.","Li Zijun was startled, and quickly turned back, “Uh? Ah! It’s...is it?”","Li Tianer obviously knew what she wanted to do, but he didn’t expose it. Instead, he made a “please” gesture to her."]},{"number":3846,"title":"Chapter 3846 Sworn (2)","paragraphs":["3846 Sworn (2)","“Young Miss Zijun, please go this way. The path behind the mountain was designed by an Array Master. If you take a wrong step, it can be dangerous. Please be careful.” Li Tianer emphasized with a smile on his face.","Li Zijun didn’t have a chance to see any more, so she could only laugh dryly, said “thank you” to Li Tianer, and hurried down the mountain.","Li Tianer personally followed a few steps behind, and saw Li Zijun’s back disappearing at the end of the path, and then went back to the room to report.","In view of the tragic experience that he and his colleagues were often reduced to cannon fodder for quarrels between young couple, when Li Tianer passed by, he had a good idea and hid in the corridor from a distance to observe.","!!","He had to be sure that there was no danger in the room before he dared to go in.","Fortunately, this time, he was lucky.","Li Moying seemed to have mastered the difficult technique of coaxing his wife, and this time he quickly calmed Huang Yueli.","When Li Tianer passed by, Li Moying was holding Huang Yueli in her arms, whispering in her ear.","Although Huang Yueli puffed her cheeks and looked arrogant, she still obediently leaned against her husband’s chest.","Li Tianer saw that the situation was good, so he hurried over and knocked on the door.","“Young Master, Young Madame.”","Li Moying’s deep eyes swept over him, “Did you see them leave for yourself?”","Li Tianer nodded hastily, “Yes! Subordinate saw that they had all gone down the mountain, so I came back to report. It’s just...”","“Just what?”","“It’s just...” Li Tianer hesitated for a moment before he said, “When Li Zijun left, she seemed to have seen something when she turned around. I saw that she seemed to be shocked...”","As soon as Huang Yueli heard it, she immediately understood.","She immediately stepped on the man next to her, “You, you... How many times have I told you, you haven’t left the courtyard yet, can you stop hugging in a hurry, you will be seen by others! You must say it’s impossible! Now?”","“You see it when you see it, so what? Li Zijun was not a fool, so naturally she should know that no one will believe her even if she tells it. Li Leyun was a lesson learned from the past!” Li Moying snorted coldly and said indifferently .","Having said that, his eyes were extremely sharp, making Li Tianer, who was swept by his eyes, sweat profusely from behind.","Oh my god, he was already so cautious, yet he still said the wrong thing, and was hated by the Young Master!","Ever since the Young Master got his wife, this job has become more and more difficult...","In the end, Li Moying still had to worry about coaxing his wife, so he didn’t have the energy to take care of him, so he waved his hand and sent him away.","Li Tianer felt relieved and ran away, as if there was a ghost chasing after him.","Huang Yueli looked funny and helpless, turned her head and gave her husband a glare, “Why are you so fierce? Didn’t you realize that your guards have been frightened by you all this time?”","“Who made them talk nonsense?” Li Moying said angrily, “Besides, I didn’t do anything to them. They were too careless to scare themselves.”","“You still have the nerve to say it! It’s obviously a rotten peach blossom you brought on yourself, why are you blaming Big Brother Tianyi and the others?”","Huang Yueli almost laughed out of anger. Does this man need to be so childish?","Li Moying didn’t take her words seriously at all, grabbed her slender waist, and pulled her into her arms, “Who told them to keep putting messy people into the courtyard and disturbing everyone? Can’t they just leave the two of us alone! Time to give them a lesson!”"]},{"number":3847,"title":"Chapter 3847 Sworn (3)","paragraphs":["3847 Sworn (3)","After hearing this, Huang Yueli couldn’t help but silently mourn for the guards.","In fact, she felt that Li Tianyi and Li Tianer already had a particularly good eye. However, it’s pitiful to follow such a master who doesn’t follow the rules...","Huang Yueli quickly remembered the previous topic, and continued to ask: “Brother Tianer said, Li Zijun turned around just now, do you think she actually saw what we were doing? She won’t come back in two days, right?”","Li Moying frowned, “Li Zijun has always been quite stable, not as impulsive as Li Leyun, even if she saw something, she probably wouldn’t gossip about it, but...”","!!","“But?” Huang Yueli’s eyes widened.","Li Moying thought of something, looked at the girl’s confused and cute expression, couldn’t help but lowered his head and stole a kiss on her lips, and said, “However, just in case, we should not stay in the courtyard any more. .”","Huang Yueli was startled, “You mean...”","“It just came to me that since you’ve arrived in the God Realm, you have been practicing intermittently. Although your cultivation base has also improved considerably, it seems that you don’t have much relevant experience in training combat skills...”","As soon as Li Moying said this, Huang Yueli immediately nodded, “That’s right! That’s true!”","After she arrived in the God Realm, she was hunted down by Huang Sanbai several times, and even stayed on the battlefield against the devils for a while.","Although these were all actual combat experiences, they were all learned by herself in battle and she had not studied them systematically.","Although Huang Yueli has not been in the God Realm for a long time, she has already heard people say that all the major forces in the God Realm will train their disciples in special fighting skills. It’s completely different from her own comprehension. The fighting skills accumulated through hundreds of thousands of years of family inheritance was definitely more efficient than her own.","Huang Yueli’s eyes lit up, and she reached out to grab the clothes on Li Moying’s chest, “Moying, are you going to take me to learn the fighting skills of the Cloudy Qilin Clan?”","Li Moying nodded with a smile, “I do have this idea. There is a special place for combat skills training in the back mountain of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. It is not far from our courtyard, but it is protected by an array, so you didn’t see it.”","No wonder!","Although they live in the back mountain, it should be inaccessible according to theory, but in fact, every time Liu Buyan goes out to collect medicinal materials, he will meet many cultivators from the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","It turned out that they would go to the training venue not far away to participate in the training.","“There is still such a good place, why didn’t you say it earlier?” Huang Yueli was already eager to try it.","Li Moying stroked her hair and said: “This training site is one of the most secret training places of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Only the direct descendants of the Cloudy Qilin Clan who have passed strict screening can enter. And , except for me, everyone has a limited time to enter it. Every month, the family will rank according to the strength of the younger generation of cultivators, so as to arrange the length of time for them to enter the training venue.”","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes, and asked, “Then... how much time does someone like Li Leyun have in a month?”","“Probably... sixty hours!” Li Moying pondered.","Huang Yueli frowned slightly, “She should be regarded as the first genius below you, right? She only has this little time?”"]},{"number":3848,"title":"Chapter 3848 Sworn (4)","paragraphs":["3848 Sworn (4)","With an allocation of only sixty hours in a month, after calculating, it was only five days.","When it was really necessary to cultivate, five days will pass in the blink of an eye, which was not enough at all!","Li Moying nodded and explained: “In order to maintain the operation of this array, a large amount of spirit beast crystal cores need to be consumed, so at most twenty people can enter at a time. In this way, the opportunity for those who cultivate inside becomes more precious. It was quite good to have sixty hours, and if one ranked after the top one hundred, there was only one hour per month. After three hundred, one will not be able to enter at all.”","In a big clan like the Cloudy Qilin Clan, there were countless children in the clan.","In Li Moying’s generation, there are at least tens of thousands of talented young cultivators above the earth level.","Naturally, it was impossible for all of these people to enter to cultivate. Most of them don’t even know the existence of this training ground.","When Huang Yueli heard this, she blinked her big eyes. In just an instant, she changed from a proud little fox to a cute little rabbit.","She wrapped her hands around Li Moying’s neck, rubbed against his chest, and said coyly, “Well, I understand, the opportunity to go in and practice was very rare! However, no matter how troublesome it is, my dear husband, you are so powerful, there must be a way to bring me in, right?”","Li Moying looked at the coquettish little fox in his arms and couldn’t help laughing.","She changed her face too quickly!","Just now, she was indifferent to him, but now she flatters him when she heard that he was going to take her in to cultivate.","However, what should he do if he found her expression so adorable? He really wants to kiss her now!","Alas, he was destined to be led by the nose by her his entire life!","Li Moying thought this way in his heart, and he didn’t hesitate in his actions. He immediately hugged his beloved wife in his arms tightly and kissed her.","Huang Yueli didn’t feel any psychological burden on her behaviour of flattering her husband in order to gain experience. She immediately tried her best to seduce her husband by imitating those female cultivators who wanted to rely on men to get ahead.","She was extremely obedient, extremely cooperative, and even had the mentality that he was king.","But who knew, just when she felt her body temperature rising, Li Moying suddenly pushed her away.","Huang Yueli was caught off guard, took a step back, widened her eyes, and looked at her husband in disbelief, “You...”","Li Moying’s face was as dark as the bottom of a pot, “I know you want it very much, but we can’t dual cultivate before the God Realm’s Grand Meet! This was what your dear Senior Brother said!”","Speaking of the latter, he gritted his teeth, and the words “dear Senior Brother” even popped out from between his teeth.","No matter how unhappy he was, as long as he thought of the consequences of dual cultivation, which might be harmful to his little fox, he still held back.","Huang Yueli looked down from his tense jaw all the way down to his lower abdomen, and couldn’t help but chuckle.","Li Moying glared at her, turned around and left without saying a word.","“Hey, wait, where are you going!” Huang Yueli quickly chased after him.","Li Moying’s cold voice came from not far away, “Go take a bath! Don’t follow!”","“A bath?”","Before Huang Yueli could react, she heard a “plop”, and Li Moying jumped directly into the pool in the courtyard in this cold climate! The birds that were perched around were frightened and flew away noisily.","Huang Yueli laughed so hard that she couldn’t straighten up.","It wasn’t until she went to bed at night that she remembered that she hadn’t asked Li Moying how to bring her into the training field."]},{"number":3849,"title":"Chapter 3849 Sworn (5)","paragraphs":["3849 Sworn (5)","Well, she knew the answer the next day.","Because she mocked her husband, Huang Yueli suffered inhumane revenge at night, she was harassed most of the night by being pressed on the bed by Li Moying.","Originally, Huang Yueli felt that anyway, since they couldn’t practice dual cultivation now, even if Li Moying had some bad intentions, he would be the one who was unlucky in the end.","In the end, she discovered that she thought of men too simply...","The regretful Huang Yueli hurriedly begged for mercy, but unfortunately, it was already too late.","The next day, she got up a little late, and when she woke up, she found that the position next to her was empty. She had no idea where Li Moying had gone.","Huang Yueli hurriedly got up, tidied up a little, and walked out of the room.","Li Moying and Liu Buyan were sitting opposite each other in the pavilion in the courtyard, and she didn’t know what they were talking about.","Seeing this scene, Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows unexpectedly.","This was quite rare!","After the two broke up in the lower realm, although they had barely reconciled, they either mocked each other or ignored each other when they met on usual days. If she wasn’t there, the two of them seemed to be able to fight at any time.","Today, sitting together so intimately and talking so close together, it feels like returning to the previous life...","And just yesterday, Li Moying had thrown Liu Buyan out of the room.","How long did it take for these two people to change?","While thinking, Huang Yueli walked towards the pavilion.","“Moying, you got up really early today! Why is Senior Brother here? Are you having breakfast together?”","Li Moying and Liu Buyan were focused on their discussion and it wasn’t until Huang Yueli made a sound that they realized that she was coming.","The two turned their heads suddenly, and saw a pure and beautiful young girl standing behind them. A pair of big sparkly eyes blinked while a ray of sun fell on her.","Li Moying’s heart trembled. Even though he had seen it countless times, his heart was still moved by this smile.","He stretched out his hand towards Huang Yueli, “Little Li’er, are you awake?”","“Well, I’m awake.”","Huang Yueli put her hand into his big hand obediently, and immediately after, Li Moying pulled her over and let her sit beside him.","Sure enough, there was a hearty breakfast on the table. There were three sets of bowls and chopsticks, and one set was reserved for Huang Yueli.","Smiling, Huang Yueli picked up the chopsticks and ate the snacks on the table, while listening to Li Moying’s instructions: “Go and bring the seafood porridge to the Young Madame. After cooking for so long, it should be cooked enough.”","Huang Yueli ate for a while, put down her chopsticks, and looked around, “What were you talking about just now? Why did you stop talking when I came over?”","Li Moying smiled and said, “It’s nothing serious, it’s not more important than your meal, drink the porridge while it’s hot.”","As he spoke, he simply picked up the spoon, cooled the porridge, and brought it to her mouth.","As for Liu Buyan, it was early in the morning. He had just eaten breakfast and now shoved with this inhumane public display of affection, he felt choked, so he didn’t speak.","Now that she realized it, she immediately curled her lips and cast a contemptuous look at Li Moying before turning to Huang Yueli, “Junior Sister, don’t listen to his nonsense, we were discussing just now, and we are going to be sworn Senior Brothers in the next two days.”","“Sworn...Brothers??”","Huang Yueli was taken aback, almost spat out the mouthful of porridge that her husband had just fed into her mouth.","“Who...who... what?!”"]},{"number":3850,"title":"Chapter 3850 Sworn (6)","paragraphs":["3850 Sworn (6)","Liu Buyan snorted coldly, “Who else is there? It’s me and the one next to you!”","Huang Yueli’s eyes almost popped out!","Did you make a mistake!","In the previous life, the relationship between the two of them was so good that they almost wore the same pair of pants. It seems that they were also sworn Senior Brothers in the early years.","But now...","As long as the two of them stayed together for an hour without quarrelling, she would be thankful, alright?","Still Sworn Brothers?","They weren’t kidding her, were they?","Huang Yueli looked at Liu Buyan, and found that although her Senior Brother looked disdainful, he seemed to be serious.","She turned her head to look at her husband again.","Li Moying was picking up a wet towel on the table, and was wiping the corners of her mouth that had been stained with porridge just now. Seeing her looking at him so adorably, he couldn’t help but hook his lips into a smile, “You heard me right, it was indeed me. I want to be sworn Brother with your Senior Brother.”","It took Huang Yueli a lot of effort to digest the shocking news, but she still couldn’t figure it out, “You two took the wrong medicine...cough cough, no, why can’t you think about it, and suddenly want to become Sworn Brothers? Such matters should be voluntary, and you must not force them, because you will not be happy if forced!”","After hearing this, Liu Buyan’s mouth twitched unnaturally.","What his Junior Sister said...","Those who don’t know clearly think that he and Li Moying are not going to be sworn Senior Brothers, but to get married!","“Junior Sister, you think too much. Although I don’t like Li Moying very much, who made him the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan? If we want to use the resources of the Cloudy Qilin Clan to cultivate, we can only rely on the identity of a lifesaver. It’s not enough, you need to have a deeper relationship with the Cloudy Qilin Clan. It’s obviously inappropriate to disclose your marriage with Li Moying now, so this is the only way left.”","Liu Buyan briefly explained a few words, and Huang Yueli suddenly understood.","It turns out that they did this to let her enter the training ground!","This was indeed a suitable and good method.","According to what Li Moying said yesterday, the place of experience was also a very precious cultivation resource for the members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Only the most outstanding geniuses in the family can enter.","Even if Li Moying was the Young Master of the family, it was not impossible to force people into it, but it will somewhat arouse the resentment of the clansmen.","With this method, at least this matter can be glossed over. Even if someone objects, it will be difficult to veto Li Moying’s request.","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli smiled, “So it’s like this... Husband, you are so smart!”","Li Moying looked at her smiling sweetly at him and felt soft in his heart. If Liu Buyan was not here, he would have kissed her on the spot.","He raised his hand and stroked Huang Yueli’s hair, “I said before, I will find a solution, you just have to trust me.”","Huang Yueli nodded.","Liu Buyan watched from the sidelines, but his heart was full!","Although this matter was Li Moying’s idea, he also cooperated, alright? Why did Junior Sister only thank that stinky brat?","Hmph! Was it really as they said, a married woman was like water that was thrown out?","Fortunately, Huang Yueli finally didn’t forget him. When she turned her head, she finally saw his ugly expression.","Huang Yueli thought that her Senior Brother was unwilling to become Sworn Brothers with Li Moying, so she hurriedly turned her head, “Husband, actually, you don’t have to force Senior Brother, wouldn’t it be better if I were to switch with him? To save another detour, maybe there will be someone else opposing this.”"]},{"number":3851,"title":"Chapter 3851 Sworn (7)","paragraphs":["3851 Sworn (7)","After all, there was still a difference between being the Young Master’s Sworn Brother’s Junior Sister and the Young Master’s Sworn Sister.","Obviously, the latter’s identity sounds closer.","Li Moying glanced at her, smiled lightly and said, “You are my wife! How can you become my sister? Even if it’s fake, it’s propostreous!”","He had no way to treat his little fox as his younger sister, and it was definitely possible for him to slip her identity out at any time.","Hearing this, Huang Yueli was also speechless, and seeing that Liu Buyan himself did not object, she immediately stopped talking.","Li Moying and Liu Buyan discussed for a while, and decided that this matter should be completed as soon as possible.","Because, the day of the God Realm’s Grand Meet was coming soon, and there was not much time left for Huang Yueli to cultivate.","After breakfast, Li Moying immediately went to Li Shihong’s place and informed him that he would be Sworn Brothers with Liu Buyan.","“What?” Li Shihong was very surprised, “Why did you make such a sudden decision?”","Li Moying said lightly, “Brother Liu and I hit it off right away, and these days he’d been taking good care of me and he’s like a lost brother to me, so we decided to become Sworn Brothers. This is my private matter, and I didn’t want it to be known to everyone. However, I plan to make it clear tomorrow. Take Senior Brother and Young Miss Li to the place of experience, so I came to inform the Patriarch.”","Li Shihong was even more surprised, “What? You...you still want to take them to the place of experience? How can that be done? It’s not like you don’t know that it was one of the best cultivation resources of the clan! Only the most outstanding young cultivators in the clan can enter! Besides, why would the two Divine Doctors go to such a place to cultivate?”","Hearing this, Li Moying put away his lazy and casual posture, and his expression became serious.","“What? Whoever said that Doctors don’t cultivate? As far as I know, Brother Liu and Young Miss Li both have heavenly talents.”","“What? Heavenly talent? Are you joking?” Li Shihong’s eyes widened.","This news was really surprising!","It never occurred to Li Shihong that two of them who look so young, despite their high level of medical skills, actually have such outstanding martial talent?","The two are not direct descendants of the ancient gods...","Being able to have such a talent can be said to be very rare among ordinary cultivators.","Before he could recover from his surprise, Li Moying had already continued talking.","“Patriarch, now Liu Buyan is my Sworn Elder Brother, he and Young Miss Li can be regarded as half members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan! Besides, the two of them have saved my life. At that time, the clan invited them to, we clearly said that as long as I can be cured, all their requirements can be met. Now it’s just a place to borrow experience, and all the Patriarch needs to nod, does the clan have to go back on their word?”","Li Moying’s voice was steady, and he spoke slowly.","Although the volume was not high, it was filled with a natural and powerful force.","Even a strong man like Li Shihong, who has been in the top position for a long time, was influenced by his aura invisibly, and was persuaded by him to a certain extent.","“This...you are right to say so, but now is an extraordinary time!” Li Shihong frowned, his face full of hesitation, “The God Realm’s Grand Meet was about to begin, how many talented cultivators in the family are waiting to enter? It’s not that you don’t know about cultivation in the place of experience! Now, Elders come to me every day, begging me to spare a little more time for their juniors, but I can’t do anything!”"]},{"number":3852,"title":"Chapter 3852 Sworn (8)","paragraphs":["3852 Sworn (8)","“Now I have to allocate time to two Divine Doctors? It’s really difficult for me to do this!”","What Li Shihong said was not an excuse, but a real difficulty.","Li Moying knew this very well.","Because of this, he insisted on being Sworn Brothers with Liu Buyan.","!!","If it wasn’t the eve of the God Realm’s Grand Meet, but normal times, he would have brought people in directly, and no one would object.","Li Moying’s face remained unchanged, “Patriarch, you have always been very prestigious in the clan, I believe this was not a difficult task for you. The matter has been finished, I will not bother you, I will go back first.”","“Hey, wait a minute... this kid, just left a big trouble and ran away by himself?”","After Li Moying informed Li Shihong, he and Liu Buyan each drank a glass of blood wine in the afternoon, and the ceremony was considered successful.","Huang Yueli watched from the side, and was speechless.","Perfunctory, too perfunctory!","Looking at the disgusting eyes of the two of them, who can believe that these two were Sworn Brothers?","Thanks to Li Moying’s guards, they can still talk nonsense with their eyes open and flatter them desperately.","“Congratulations, Young Master and Divine Doctor Liu for becoming Senior Brothers with different surnames!”","“Congratulations, Young Master! Congratulations to Divine Doctor Liu!”","“The Young Master and Doctor Liu are both first-class geniuses in our God Realm! One is well versed in martial arts while the other is a master of medicine. ”","The more Huang Yueli listened, the more speechless she became. She thought that Li Moying’s subordinates would be more virtuous, but in the end, they were still shameless when flattering their Master!","“Little Li’er...”","Just as Huang Yueli was dreaming, a familiar magnetic voice suddenly sounded in her ears.","She turned her head and saw that Li Moying had walked behind her at some point, and as soon as he raised her hand, he took her into her arms.","Huang Yueli raised her chin, and before she could speak, she felt the man’s scorching breath invade her lips.","Huang Yueli pushed him hastily, “You are Sworn Brothers with my Senior Brother, so you can be regarded as my half Senior Brother. How could you have the nerve to do such a thing to your Junior Sister?”","Li Moying snorted coldly, “It’s not you who became Sworn Sister with me, what kind of sister are you?”","He lowered his head, and smiled softly on her lips: “If you are really my sister, then I can’t do anything about it, I can only rebel once...”","While Huang Yueli was in a daze, he quickly approached and took her breath away again.","...","The next morning, the three of them came to the training place together.","The guards at the entrance hurriedly bowed their heads when they saw Li Moying coming.","“I have seen the Young Master!”","“Young Master, are you here to cultivate?”","Li Moying nodded slightly, “I want to take my Sworn Brother and his Junior Sister to cultivate together. This is the Patriarch’s token.”","The leader of the guard took a look at the scroll, then looked up in surprise, and looked at the man and woman beside Li Moying.","Liu Buyan and Huang Yueli are now celebrities in Amethyst Paramount Palace. Even if they haven’t met them in person, they have probably heard of them. Therefore, the head of the guards quickly guessed their identities.","But aren’t these two Divine Doctors? Why do you come here?","Moreover, Li Moying actually called Liu Buyan his Sworn Brother... When did they become Sworn Brothers? Why haven’t you heard of such a big thing?","“Young Master, did you make a mistake? Divine Doctor Liu and Divine Doctor Li...are they going to enter the training ground?”","Li Moying looked indifferent, “What? Do you have any doubts about what I said? Is the Patriarch’s token useless?”"]},{"number":3853,"title":"Chapter 3853 Just Wait!(1)","paragraphs":["3853 Just Wait!(1)","“Ah? No... No, I don’t dare!”","Hearing the anger hidden in Li Moying’s voice, the Captain of the guards lowered his head in fear, not daring to ask any more questions.","“Young Master, two Divine Doctors, this way please...”","Li Moying nodded slightly, and led Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan straight into the training ground.","The Captain of the guards looked at the backs of the three of them, but couldn’t recover for a long time.","Although he didn’t dare to say anything in front of Li Moying, the doubts in his heart didn’t decrease in the slightest.","The other guards also had the same doubts.","As soon as Li Moying left, they couldn’t help but start to discuss fervantly.","“The two other people who were brought by the Young Master, are they Divine Doctor Liu and Divine Doctor Li?”","“It’s said that the Young Master has a very good relationship with the two Divine Doctors. It seems to be true! That Divine Doctor Li is so beautiful! Even Young Miss Leyun, the number one beauty of our Cloudy Qilin Clan, can’t match up to her. She has an ethereal temperament...”","“Alright, don’t look around! I still think this is too strange. Even if the Young Master makes good friends with them, this is one of the most important training places for the family. How could he bring these two in?”","“However, the Young Master still has the token of the Patriarch! Even the Patriarch gave permission...”","“Just now, the Young Master said that he became Sworn Brothers with Divine Doctor Liu? It can’t be true, can it?”","Just when they were puzzled, there was another sound of footsteps.","Everyone quickly shut their mouths, cheered up, and prepared to welcome the visitor.","Those who will come to this place of experience were all talented cultivators in the clan and they couldn’t afford to offend any of them!","After seeing the identity of the visitor, the Captain of the guard hurriedly stepped forward to salute, “Young Miss Zijun, you also came to cultivate today? What a coincidence, the Young Master just entered just a quarter of an hour ago.”","He took the initiative to tell Li Moying’s whereabouts.","Any news about the Young Master was what the proud daughters of the family wanted to know at all costs.","The Captain of the guard was also happy to use this news to curry favor with Li Zijun. After all, after Li Leyun lost power, Li Zijun became the most likely woman to marry Li Moying.","Sure enough, when Li Zijun heard this, her eyes lit up immediately.","“The Young Master also came here to cultivate? And he just entered?”","The leader of the guards nodded and said, “Yes.”","Li Zijun immediately looked very excited.","The few young cultivators who came with her also became happy.","“We have come to the place of experience several times, but we have not been able to meet the Young Master. What a coincidence!”","“If you think about it, the Young Master was also preparing for the God Realm’s Grand Meet! When the time comes, the entire God Realm will definitely be shocked!”","“This is also the fate between Young Miss Zijun and the Young Master! Sister Zijun came here, and the Young Master just happened to be here too. Isn’t this fate?”","Hearing the words of these young cultivators, even Li Zijun, who had a steady personality, couldn’t help but twitched the corners of her mouth and showed a bit of a smile.","Originally, she planned to cultivate with Li Moying to highlight her talent and strength, so that Li Moying could realize that she was the most suitable woman for him.","But who knows, Li Moying rejected her on the spot, and didn’t even give Li Shihong any face.","But now, just when she was about to give up, the two met at the place of experience!","Does this really mean that the two of them were destined?","Li Zijun was full of energy, and walked towards the entrance."]},{"number":3854,"title":"Chapter 3854 Just Wait!(2)","paragraphs":["3854 Just Wait!(2)","However, as soon as she took a few steps, she was stopped by the guards.","“Young Miss Zijun, please wait a moment.”","Hearing what the Captain of the guards said, Li Zijun looked back suspiciously, “Is there anything else?”","She couldn’t wait to meet Li Moying.","The Captain of the guards said hesitantly, “Uh, well...Young Miss Zijun, there are only four places left in the training place. You brought so many people here this time, I’m afraid you can’t all go in and cultivate. I still have to trouble you to discuss the order of entry first, otherwise, it will be difficult for us to do things.”","Li Zijun immediately frowned, “What? There are only four places? Didn’t I make an appointment yesterday?”","In order to prevent disputes between the geniuses in the clan over the cultivation resources, it was necessary to make an appointment in advance if they wanted to enter the training ground.","Li Zijun was sure that there was a space first before she brought these people here.","The Captain of the guards said: “Yes, that’s true but the Young Master did it on a temporary basis...”","Before he could finish speaking, Li Zijun looked stunned, “Oh, yes, the Young Master doesn’t need to make an appointment when he comes here, and everyone has to make room for him, so there will be one less vacant place.”","She turned her head to look at the group of followers behind her, “Chenhua, I can only trouble you to wait for a while! Your Second Sister’s training time is only ten hours, you can come in tomorrow.”","The ones she brought, although they followed her with a respectful attitude, were actually all young cultivators from the Cloudy Qilin Clan who were still somewhat famous, at least they could be ranked in the top 200, and they had time to cultivate.","These people are all planning to participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet, and they came here with Li Zijun this time because they thought that it might be more beneficial to cultivate with a top genius like her.","Li Chenhua was the last one among them. When he heard Li Zijun’s roll call, he was quite self-conscious and immediately stood up.","“Alright, my cultivation is the worst here, so I’ll just wait an extra day.”","Li Zijun nodded in satisfaction, turned around, and strode towards the entrance again.","Who knows, this time, she was stopped again.","Li Zijun’s face suddenly turned ugly, “What’s going on? I’ve already reduced one quota, why can’t I get in?”","Li Zijun was also a top genius with a high status in the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Although she was much more stable than Li Leyun, she still had a temper.","Being blocked several times made her a little impatient.","The Captain of the guards was embarrassed, but he still said bravely: “This...Young Miss Zijun, it’s not that I want to make things difficult for you, but...well, I’m afraid it’s not enough for you to remove only one person, you have to to leave three people!”","Li Zijun was startled, then frowned, “What do you mean? Could there be someone else jumping in line besides the Young Master? Who gave them the courage?”","She, Li Zijun, ranked third among the family’s geniuses, and now that Li Leyun was gone, who else would dare to step in front of her?","Seeing her misunderstanding, the Captain of the guard hurriedly explained: “No...it’s not that someone jumped in the line! It’s just...the Young Master brought two people in! You know, we dare not disobey the Young Master’s order, and the Young Master was still carrying the Patriarch’s token this time...”","“What did you say? The Young Master brought people in personally?”"]},{"number":3855,"title":"Chapter 3855 Just Wait!(3)","paragraphs":["3855 Just Wait!(3)","Li Zijun’s eyes widened, and she couldn’t believe his ears for a moment!","Li Moying has always been a loner in the family, and never cultivated with other people.","Even his personal bodyguards would not follow him to the training ground.","Li Leyun used to think that just because she was the Patriarch’s niece, she wanted to partner with Li Moying to cultivate together, but was completely ignored and became the laughing stock of the entire Amethyst Paramount Palace.","This time, Li Moying actually brought someone in?","How could this be true?","However, the serious expression of the Captain of the guards did not seem to be deceiving her at all and there was no need for him to deceive.","Li Zijun’s heart sank and she suddenly had a bad feeling. She asked, “Who did the Young Master bring in? What was the Patriarch’s token? Why didn’t I know about this?”","The Captain of the guards didn’t hide anything, and immediately told the truth, “The Young Master brought the two Divine Doctors.”","“What? Aren’t the two of them doctors? What are they going to do in the training place?”","“This... I also have such questions, but if the Young Master doesn’t say anything, we don’t dare to ask more questions! Moreover, the Young Master also brought a token from the Patriarch, specifically authorizing the two of them to enter the training ground. As guards, what else can we say?”","Li Zijun was full of doubts, but seeing the performance of these guards, she knew that there was nothing more to ask.","She frowned tightly and didn’t speak for a while.","Behind her, the young cultivators also looked at each other.","“What’s the matter? Why did the two Divine Doctors come here? It’s not necessarily for cultivation, right?”","“Are you kidding me? This is a place specially designed for the top geniuses of the ancient gods to cultivate. Although ordinary cultivators will not be killed if they enter, they will not be able to comprehend any deep meaning from it. It’s just a waste of time!”","“It’s fine for them to waste time, but it takes up the time of those of us who really need to experience! I wonder what Young Master is thinking? Why did he bring them in?”","“Shhh! Are you someone who can point and talk about the Young Master’s decisions? Anyway, the two doctors probably won’t be able to stand it after staying in there for an hour. We’ll just wait.”","The soft discussions of several people reminded Li Zijun.","Cultivators with insufficient cultivation base and comprehension, once entering such a profound and complex array, will soon be unable to bear it due to excessive mental power consumption, and can only choose to quit.","So, no matter whether these two Divine Doctors came in out of curiosity or other reasons, they couldn’t stay for long.","She really doesn’t need to argue with them.","Li Zijun turned her head and looked behind her, “The last two should stay here too! Don’t worry, you can go in after a while.”","She turned to the Captain of the guards again, “In this way, we have reduced from seven people to four, can we go in?”","Only then did the Captain of the guards nod his head, “Young Miss Zijun, this way please...”","...","At the same time, Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan had followed Li Moying into the training ground.","As far as the eye could see, it was a huge castle-like building.","The surrounding circle was made up of towers.","Huang Yueli roughly counted them, and found that there were exactly twenty towers, and they were connected by walls, and the walls were covered with various arrays, interlinked with each other, forming a circular array."]},{"number":3856,"title":"Chapter 3856 Just Wait!(4)","paragraphs":["3856 Just Wait!(4)","Seeing his little fox looking around curiously, Li Moying came over and gently wrapped his arms around her waist.","“How is it? Are you ready?”","Huang Yueli leaned against his chest, raised her head and asked, “I’m all ready, tell me quickly, what should I do now?”","Li Moying looked at her nestled in his arms like a kitten with a hint of impatience, he couldn’t help but laugh, “Why are you in a hurry? You came with me, there is no time limit, you can stay as long as you want.”","This was Li Moying playing tricks. When asking Li Shihong for the token, he deliberately didn’t mention the time limit.","Li Shihong was angry with him for a while, and he was so angry that he forgot about it. In this way, Huang Yueli could stay here until she was satisfied.","Huang Yueli snorted, “Even if there is no time limit, we won’t be able to stay for a few days. We still have to participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet!”","Li Moying also realized this, his expression became serious and she stopped teasing her.","“Alright, then let me introduce you. Do you see these towers on the side? These are the places where cultivators learn the secret art. There are people in the towers with lights on the top, and the others are empty. You can choose any one to enter, it is all the same. After entering, all kinds of combat secrets collected by the Cloudy Qilin Clan for hundreds of thousands of years, as well as the images left by the famous Life Profound Realm powerhouses, will reappear in the tower. You can choose the image you want to comprehend and watch.”","When Huang Yueli heard this, she immediately was amazed.","“It’s really a place where the ancient gods cultivated! There are still images of the powerful people in the Life Profound Realm! You can also form images of so many combat secrets, which is much simpler and easier to understand than directly reading various secret manuals! No wonder there are so many talented fighters from the ancient gods, and the fighters from ordinary small forces are not at the same level in terms of resources...”","Li Moying looked at her sparkling eyes, and couldn’t help but kiss her on the face, “This is only a small part of the resources of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, Amethyst Paramount Palace still has a lot of cultivation resources, waiting for us in the God Realm. After getting married again, I will take you there one by one.”","Huang Yueli nodded, completely unaware that she had been kissed.","Her mind has been attracted by the secret techniques described by Li Moying, and she really wanted to go into the tower right away to see these images.","Liu Buyan was brutally showered with their affection again, the corners of his mouth twitched, and he turned his eyes away.","With this turn, he saw the square in the middle,","There is a huge light curtain outside the square, like an upside-down bowl, covering the square in the middle.","There were faint rays of light flashing inside.","He walked over curiously, looked at it, but couldn’t see why, then turned around and asked, “Moying, what is this for?”","Li Moying was reluctant to be separated from his little fox, and was about to take this last chance to take more liberties, when he suddenly heard Liu Buyan interrupt. His face darkened immediately and he glared at him.","“These towers are places for comprehension, and the trial field in the middle is the place to test the effect of comprehension. Inside is a huge Illusion Array. Once cultivators enter it, they will transform into different levels of combat opponents. At first It’s just the lowest level of spirit beasts, and then the difficulty gradually increases, not only the level of spirit beasts gets higher and higher, but also various famous cultivators will appear to fight against those who enter it.”"]},{"number":3857,"title":"Chapter 3857 Just Wait!(5)","paragraphs":["3857 Just Wait!(5)","Hearing this, the eyes of Liu Buyan and Huang Yueli lit up at the same time.","Back in the Soaring Heavens Continent, there were quite a few big sects that had similar trial Illusion Arrays, but none of them were on such a large scale.","Moreover, the Illusion Arrays that can transform into high-level monsters were generally exhausted. This one of the Cloudy Qilin Clan can also transform into the phantoms of cultivators that have existed in the past, which was simply unimaginable!","I don’t know what kind of Array Master was able to complete such an Illusion Array.","Only a big Ancient God Clan with hundreds of thousands of years of accumulation can do it.","Liu Buyan couldn’t help sighing, “I must say... Li Moying, you are really lucky! After arriving in the God Realm, you still have such good resources. At least you haven’t forgotten about us and know that you want to bring us here to cultivate. ”","As soon as the words fell, Li Moying glanced at him, and said coolly, “Don’t be sentimental, I just brought Little Li’er here, as for you... If it wasn’t for worrying about an excuse, why should I bring you such a burden?”","Upon hearing this, Liu Buyan’s face turned green.","“Li Moying! What do you mean? Don’t think that I can’t beat you now, so you can talk nonsense! I’m your Sworn Brother! Huh? Come on, what do you call me again?”","This was what Liu Buyan was most proud of recently.","Back then, when they were still in the Lower Realm and when the two were Sworn Brothers, Liu Buyan was actually one year younger than Mu Chengying.","However, after Li Moying was reincarnated, he was younger than him, and the age difference was not even one or two years.","When they became Sworn Brothers again, Liu Buyan turned into the Elder Brother.","The corners of Li Moying’s mouth twitched, completely ignoring him.","What Elder Brother? He really wanted to throw Liu Buyan out!","Looking at the interaction between the two, Huang Yueli couldn’t help being amused, and shook her head, “Alright, stop talking so much nonsense, let’s hurry up and start cultivating!”","She really had enough of the two of them!","Obviously, he wanted to help Liu Buyan, so he specially brought him to the training place, but he just refused to admit it, and looked so disgusted...","Forget it, maybe this was an alternative way for them to express their friendship, so she should leave it alone.","His little Junior Sister had already spoken up, so Liu Buyan didn’t continue to argue with Li Moying. He looked around, picked a tower that was empty, and walked over to it, ready to start.","But just before he walked in, Li Moying suddenly spoke again.","“By the way, don’t blame me for not reminding you... Enlightenment in the tower will consume a lot of mental power of the cultivators, so our Cloudy Qilin Clan will limit the strength and time of the cultivators who come to seek enlightenment, not only It’s for the allocation of resources, and it’s also for fear that someone will get hurt due to excessive enlightenment. For someone like you, it’s probably enough to stay for an hour, so don’t hold on... Otherwise, if your soul is damaged, we can’t save you! ”","Liu Buyan’s heart skipped a beat, he really wanted to slap Li Moying away!","It’s a pity that the strength was not enough...","He gritted his teeth and said, “Thank you for your reminder! However, you are really worrying too much. It’s fine for me to stay for a few more hours!”","With that said, he strode into the tower without even turning his head.","Not long after, the lights above the tower lit up."]},{"number":3858,"title":"Chapter 3858 Just Wait and See!(6)","paragraphs":["3858 Just Wait and See!(6)","Apparently, Liu Buyan has already begun to comprehend.","Huang Yueli raised her head and glared at her husband, “You, you... that’s enough! Why do you keep provoking my Senior Brother? Although his talent is not very high, he is a Doctor after all, and his mental strength is much stronger than that of ordinary martial cultivators so it will definitely not be a problem to persist for a while.”","She didn’t believe that Li Moying didn’t know this, her husband was just making trouble on purpose!","Li Moying stretched out his hand to hook her slender waist, lowered his head as he brushed his lips gently over her small earlobes, and the scorching breath brushed over her tender skin, a blush suddenly appeared on Huang Yueli’s face.","“I call it the Provocative Method. If you stimulate him, he will work hard. The God Realm is a place where strength speaks. I let him cultivate hard, isn’t it all for his own good! Little Li’er, how can you wrong me? ”","It sounds quite reasonable, but... it seems that something was not quite right?","Huang Yueli really wanted to refute her husband’s remarks, but being engulfed by Li Moying’s strong masculine aura, it left her no time to think too much.","“Little Li’er, you don’t believe your husband, and even question me... Tell me, how do you compensate me, huh?”","Li Moying’s deep voice rang in her ears.","At the end, his seductive tone carried an unspeakable temptation, and made her legs go weak for a while.","Foul! This man!","It’s no wonder that all the girls of the Cloudy Qilin Clan were fascinated by him...","Thoughts flashed vaguely in Huang Yueli’s mind, and while hesitating, her lips had been grabbed by a man again, and she was tossed and crushed.","Just then, there was a sound of footsteps behind them.","At the same time, there was also the voice of speaking.","“I was delayed by those guards for so long just now, I guess the Young Master has already gone to the tower!”","“Oh, what a pity. If I hadn’t been stopped, I would have been able to see the Young Master with my own eyes! Maybe I could have said a few words to him!”","“Don’t dream! The Young Master has such a cold personality, if you rush to disturb him and affect his cultivation, you will be miserable!”","“I’m just talking... Hey, there seems to be someone in front?”","“Could it be that the Young Master hasn’t entered the tower yet? Let’s go over and have a look!”","Seeing a figure in front of the Illusion Array from a distance, the young cultivators immediately became excited, one by one quickening their pace, and walked towards this side.","Huang Yueli suddenly woke up, remembered where they were, and quickly pushed Li Moying.","Li Moying didn’t insist. He raised his head and left her lips, but his right hand was still on her waist.","This man!","What kind of situation was it, hurry up and separate from her!","However, at this moment, she couldn’t care less about educating her husband, so she quickly pushed him again. Feeling the man’s strength relax, she fled from his arms and took two steps back at the same time.","The moment his arms were empty, he immediately frowned, his face full of displeasure.","However, before he could open his mouth, the young cultivators who came in just now had already rushed forward.","“Young...Young Master! It’s really the Young Master!”","“Oh my goodness, this is the first time I’ve seen the Young Master with my own eyes!”","“Oh, why are you in a daze! Why don’t you hurry up and salute the Young Master?”","“Oh, yes, yes! Greetings to the Young Master!”","Several young cultivators bowed and saluted at the same time.","Only then did Li Moying turn around."]},{"number":3859,"title":"Chapter 3859 Just Wait and See!(7)","paragraphs":["3859 Just Wait and See!(7)","He was in a bad mood when he was interrupted midway because he was making out with his wife.","Seeing these clansmen, he didn’t have a good face. The corners of his mouth were tightly pursed, his cold gaze swept over their heads and he didn’t say a word.","The young cultivators were bowing and since they didn’t hear him say anything, they didn’t dare to get up casually. They were even more terrified when they noticed the icy aura and powerful coercion emanating from Li Moying’s body.","Their Young Master...as expected, just as in the legend, not only was he handsome, but also his strength was astonishing! Far beyond their geniuses of the same generation!","!!","Moreover, it was as indifferent as in the legend...","Huang Yueli was standing right behind Li Moying. Seeing this, she secretly tugged on the clothes behind him.","Only then did Li Moying snort coldly, “Everyone should be excused. Now that you’re here, this opportunity is rare, so let’s cultivate hard.”","“Yes! Thank you, Young Master, for your concern!”","After receiving a word of encouragement from him, all the young cultivators present were overjoyed.","Li Moying himself was very upset. He wanted to talk to Huang Yueli before she entered the tower, but now he had no chance.","He could only wait for them to go out from the place of experience.","“Litt...cough cough, Young Miss Li...”","Under Huang Yueli’s stare, Li Moying could only reluctantly change her words.","Huang Yueli kept a safe distance from him, with a decent but somewhat alienated smile on her face, “Young Master Li, what else is there?”","Li Moying pursed his lips in dissatisfaction. Such an expression made him feel too uncomfortable! He can’t wait to catch the little fox back and kiss her directly, but, after they leave the training ground, he will probably be punished to kneel on the washboard...","Just when Young Master Li was extremely entangled, there were still some people who didn’t have eyes.","“Young Master, you didn’t have time to guide us in the small courtyard the day before yesterday. I thought I had no chance to cultivate with you. I didn’t expect to meet you today. What a coincidence.”","A calm female voice suddenly sounded.","Huang Yueli turned her head when she heard the sound, and saw Li Zijun standing no more than ten steps away, looking at them.","Her brows immediately frowned.","This Li Zijun was too lingering! Even when she came here to cultivate with her husband, she will meet her!","She was already feeling impatient and Li Moying was even more impatient.","He just glanced at Li Zijun coldly, but didn’t respond.","Li Zijun was ignored, and it was inevitable that she felt aggrieved, but she was more calm than Li Leyun, and she still maintained a graceful posture, “Huh? Isn’t this Divine Doctor Li? I didn’t expect that you would also go to the training place. I heard that Divine Doctor Liu is also here, why didn’t I see him?”","Her voice was not soft, and there were not many people here, and all the young cultivators present heard it.","At the same time, they all felt puzzled.","“That’s right, where is Divine Doctor Liu?”","“I just heard that the three of them came in together. Why was Divine Doctor Liu missing?”","Huang Yueli was a little impatient, but thinking that these were all members of Li Moying’s clan, she couldn’t be too indifferent, so she casually explained: “As soon as my Senior Brother came in, he rushed straight to the tower.”","Most of the people looked stunned, “Unexpectedly, Divine Doctor Liu is more diligent than us!”","But to Li Zijun’s ears, it’s not that simple.","When they entered, it was pretty far away and there was another stone tablet blocking."]},{"number":3860,"title":"Chapter 3860 Just Wait and See!(8)","paragraphs":["3860 Just Wait and See!(8)","Therefore, many people just saw someone, but couldn’t see clearly what they were doing.","Only Li Zijun’s spiritual sense was the strongest, and she walked the fastest. She was the first to approach Li Moying and Huang Yueli.","Therefore, she saw the scene where Huang Yueli pushed Li Moying away just now!","Even though Huang Yueli kept a certain distance from Li Moying and seemed decent when she spoke, what happened at that moment just now was still presented repeatedly in front of Li Zijun’s eyes.","At this moment, she seemed calm, but in fact, there was already a burning flame of jealousy in her heart!","She knew it, she just knew it!","Liu Buyan went to the Amethyst Paramount Palace to treat the Young Master’s illness, but he insisted on bringing such a beautiful Junior Sister with him, there must be something wrong!","In fact, from the first day Huang Yueli arrived in Amethyst Paramount Palace, there were many people who had such doubts. Li Leyun was just the most ignorant one among them. She dared to provoke Huang Yueli face to face, but it didn’t mean that others didn’t harbour similar thoughts.","Li Zijun suspected it from the beginning, but there was no evidence.","The day before yesterday, Li Shihong took her to the small courtyard. She personally saw the legendary Divine Doctor Li, and her intuition immediately told her that this woman was very threatening!","Even though Huang Yueli and Li Moying didn’t have any intimate interactions that day, even the two old foxes, Li Shihong and Li Qingsong, didn’t notice anything wrong, but Li Zijun felt that Huang Yueli was not pleasing to the eye.","Now, she was finally sure that this Divine Doctor Li was really seducing their Young Master!","Thinking of this, Li Zijun tried his best to suppress it, but he couldn’t completely calm down, and his words became more sharp, “I didn’t expect that the two doctors are also interested in martial arts training! However, I still want to remind Divine Doctor Li that this place of experience was originally only accessible to the top geniuses of the younger generation of our Cloudy Qilin Clan, because cultivators with ordinary talents, even if they were forcibly brought in through their relationship, they would not be able to comprehend anything. Talented cultivators don’t have enough time to comprehend.”","Speaking of which, she seemed to suddenly realize that she had said something wrong, and quickly covered her mouth with a frightened expression.","“Uh, Divine Doctor Li, I’m not saying that you are relying on your connections to open the back door, but... oh! I blame me for not being able to speak! I’m just worried that you will not be able to improve your strength, and you will be easily injured... ...”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli couldn’t help but sneered.","This Li Zijun was at a much higher level than Li Leyun.","What she said was not satirising them, but in fact, every word and every word was talking about it. They were brought in by hugging Li Moying’s thigh!","At the same time, I did not forget to point out that she and Liu Buyan took up the training time of other Cloudy Qilin Clan cultivators, but in fact their cultivation level was not high enough and could not comprehend anything at all.","To put it bluntly, it means occupying the latrine and not shitting.","These words, to the ears of ordinary cultivators, it made them uncomfortable.","Sure enough, as soon as Li Zijun finished speaking, the young cultivators behind her looked at Huang Yueli differently, becoming full of hostility.","In order to be able to go to the place of experience to comprehend, which one didn’t they put in arduous efforts? Not only did they cultivate day and night, but they also defeated countless geniuses of the same race to stand here."]},{"number":3861,"title":"Chapter 3861 Just Wait!(9)","paragraphs":["3861 Just Wait!(9)","The results of it? They specially picked a good time to come here, but they were told that they couldn’t go in to cultivate!","The reason was that the quota was taken by these two Divine Doctors who came through the back door!","If these two Divine Doctors were really geniuses in martial cultivation, or at least have some talent in it, then in order to repay their kindness for saving the Young Master, it was not unreasonable to let them cultivate in the place of experience.","However, judging by the delicate appearance of this Divine Doctor Li, she might only be able to hold a few gold needles with her strength. She doesn’t look like a martial cultivator at all!","She took up the spot and slipped in. It wasn’t just because she was curious, she wanted to come in and take a look, right?","Huang Yueli raised her head and glanced lightly at Li Zijun, “Thank you for reminding me, Young Miss Zijun, it’s just a study of the secrets of combat, and it’s not a top-notch ancient inheritance. Thinking about it, I won’t be injured.”","Although the training grounds of the Cloudy Qilin Clan are very rare, they can only be regarded as the training resources of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, which are still different from the ancient inheritance.","The inheritance that Huang Yueli accepted before was to bring out the ability of the trainee to the limit, and it was even impossible to guarantee the safety of the cultivator’s life.","Even Huang Yueli herself had to go through a narrow escape several times before she got these inheritances and got to where she was today.","In contrast, the training place of the Cloudy Qilin Clan was just an ordinary training place. Although the person who designed this Illusion Array had done it grandly, but for the cultivators, this place was really not a dangerous place.","What she said was the truth out of feeling, but it was too unpleasant for these geniuses of the Cloudy Qilin Clan to hear these words.","There was such a place of experience in the clan, and that was what they, the children of the ancient gods, are most proud of!","It’s not easy for them to come in to cultivate and withstand the pressure in the tower!","What does this young female doctor know? How dare she talk nonsense like that?","This was simply trampling their face on the ground!","“Divine Doctor Li, what you said was wrong. The place of experience has always been very dangerous for cultivators with talent below the heavenly level! Every year, clansmen with insufficient cultivation are injured here, and there are even people who are shocked to the point of death. know!”","“That’s right, this was the training place of our Cloudy Qilin Clan. It’s completely different from the training places of those small forces outside!”","“Be careful now, when you get hurt, it will be too late to regret.”","Everyone was a little dissatisfied and couldn’t help muttering.","Due to the presence of Li Moying, no one dared to say too much, but the dissatisfaction in his eyes was very obvious.","The more Li Moying listened to everyone’s arguments, his complexion became more and more ugly, and his gaze gradually turned gloomy.","Seeing that he was about to lose his temper, Huang Yueli hurriedly grabbed the hem of his clothes secretly from behind him.","When Li Moying heard that these people dared to slander his little fox, he was already on the verge of bursting into anger, but when he felt the little fox’s little paw gently scratching his back, his body froze suddenly.","He subconsciously turned his head to look at Huang Yueli, only to see Huang Yueli slightly shaking her head towards him.","Although Li Moying was full of anger, he had no choice but to forcefully suppress it after his little fox had already signalled it.","Huang Yueli secretly heaved a sigh of relief, and glanced at the young cultivators, “Thank you for your concern, the time for cultivation is precious, I’m rushing to comprehend so I won’t talk any more!”"]},{"number":3862,"title":"Chapter 3862 Just Wait!(10)","paragraphs":["3862 Just Wait!(10)","Huang Yueli didn’t want her husband to get into a conflict with his clansmen because of her.","So, she didn’t intend to continue on.","However, Li Zijun managed to stir up the hostility of the clan towards Huang Yueli, how could she let her leave so easily.","Seeing that Huang Yueli swallowed her anger and wanted to leave, she decided that she had hit Huang Yueli’s sore spot!","This female doctor obviously pretended to be talented in martial arts to please the Young Master, and even pestered the Young Master to give her a chance to enter the training ground!","It’s a pity that her true strength was still shady, and she wanted to leave quickly because she was afraid that she would reveal her truth if she continued.","Li Zijun took a step forward and blocked Huang Yueli’s way, “Divine Doctor Li, you shouldn’t go to the tower, I’m doing it for your own good! Even if you want to show yourself in front of the Young Master, you have to see if you have the ability? If it’s self-defeating, wouldn’t it be shooting yourself in the foot?”","Huang Yueli’s face suddenly darkened.","She didn’t care about them, it was all for Li Moying’s face.","Unexpectedly, this Li Zijun was so ungrateful, so relentless!","Or... She saw the scene where she made out with Li Moying just now?","Huang Yueli sneered, and no longer held back her words.","“Young Miss Zijun, don’t you think you are overstepping this a little? I was able to come to the place of training because I got the approval from the Patriarch! If any of you have any opinions, you can talk to the Patriarch directly. Why bother acting here in all sorts of ways? Don’t worry, I will consider my own safety, after all, I am a Doctor and you are not!”","“You...” Li Zijun’s eyes widened with astonishment.","For a moment, she was overwhelmed by the aura emanating from Huang Yueli’s body, and she was speechless.","She never expected that this seemingly very delicate girl would actually have such a fierce side!","Just looking at her appearance, Huang Yueli looks like a gentle and harmless little white rabbit. Standing next to Li Moying, she was like a small bird. It’s completely unimaginable that she would have such an aura!","Huang Yueli reprimanded coldly: “Get out of the way!”","The other cultivators were not as determined as Li Zijun. Under her strong gaze, they all subconsciously took a few steps back to make way.","Huang Yueli walked straight through the crowd.","Seeing that she was about to walk to the edge of the tower, Li Zijun suddenly regained her senses.","She hurriedly called out, “Divine Doctor Li, since you think you are qualified to stay in the training place, do you dare to compete with us? If you win, then we will admit that you are qualified to stay here!”","Huang Yueli walked forward without looking back, completely ignoring her, not even pausing for a moment, completely ignoring Li Zijun.","Li Zijun’s face turned even darker.","Unexpectedly, Huang Yueli would dare to ignore her like this!","Did she think she was Li Leyun? She’s just a doctor. Did she think that she was superior to others because she hooked up with the Young Master?","She was very angry, but still suppressed her anger, and said again: “Divine Doctor Li, don’t think that I didn’t see it just now, you and the Young Master were clearly hugging each other just now! That’s why you made the Young Master bring you here!”","“What?!”","“How can that be?!”","“She and the Young Master... No, it’s impossible!”"]},{"number":3863,"title":"Chapter 3863 Just Wait!(11)","paragraphs":["3863 Just Wait!(11)","Li Zijun’s words was like a boulder falling into the water, arousing violent reactions from all around.","For a moment, the young cultivators couldn’t care less about Li Moying being nearby, and all screamed out of control.","This news was really shocking!","No, it’s not a shock, it’s no different from a thunderous bolt from out of the blue!","This slender and beautiful Divine Doctor Li actually has...what kind of relationship with the Young Master? ? She doesn’t look like that a fox vixen, does she?","Of course, what was even more unbelievable is that everyone in the Cloudy Qilin Clan knows how cold their Young Master was.","How many proud daughters of the Ancient God Clan threw themselves into his arms, and he acted as if he hadn’t seen it! Li Leyun and Li Zijun, two of the most outstanding geniuses in the clan, fought openly and secretly for him, but in the end, Li Moying’s attitude towards them was always impartial – completely ignoring them!","But now?","The Young Master was hugging Divine Doctor Li...?","If it was normal, when they heard Li Zijun’s remarks, everyone would only think it was impossible, but when they came in just now, they all saw the Young Master and Doctor Li standing together with their own eyes!","Although they stood far away and were blocked by the stone tablet, they didn’t see what the two of them were doing.","However, Huang Yueli was standing behind Li Moying at that time, and the two of them were very close, this was undeniable!","For a moment, everyone’s eyes on Huang Yueli changed.","Li Zijun knew that all the cultivators present had believed her words, so he couldn’t help feeling proud.","She raised her chin and said in a loud voice: “Divine Doctor Li, who is the Young Master with? We didn’t dare to say anything. However, our Cloudy Qilin Clan has rules after all, let alone you are not a young lady of the clan, even if you are, you have to follow the clan rules! If you want to enter the training ground to practice, you have to prove that you really have enough strength to crush your peers! Otherwise, even if the Young Master is willing to make an exception for you, how can he face all the clansmen? Do you know how others will talk about the Young Master behind his back? If you can’t even consider this for the Young Master, then I really doubt whether you have feelings for the Young Master...”","“Shut up!” Li Moying hollered in anger.","The voice was full of profound force and coercion, like a thunderbolt, it exploded in Li Zijun’s ears.","She took two steps back, her face suddenly turned pale, and a trace of blood spilled from the corner of her mouth.","“Young Miss Zijun!!”","The young cultivators all cried out!","No one expected that Li Moying would strike suddenly, and strike so hard!","But in fact, what they didn’t know was that Li Moying had already restrained himself very, very much, because his little fox had hinted to him just now that he couldn’t get mad on this occasion!","Although he felt that Huang Yueli’s worry was unnecessary, he was still willing to listen to his wife’s words. After all, in his heart, his wife was always right!","However, Li Zijun’s words pressed Huang Yueli step by step. The more she said, the more she went too far. In the end, he still couldn’t hold back.","The cultivator who had a good relationship with Li Zijun hurried over to help her, but Li Zijun shook her head and refused, holding her chest and forcefully standing up straight.","She gritted her teeth and continued: “Young Master, even if you will be angry, I have to tell the truth! If Divine Doctor Li wants to be the young lady of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, she must behave like a young lady! I must not Let her damage your reputation, Young Master!”"]},{"number":3864,"title":"Chapter 3864 Just Wait!(12)","paragraphs":["3864 Just Wait!(12)","“Young Miss Zijun!”","“Young Miss Zijun, you...why are you doing this!”","“Some women only know how to charm the Young Master and obtain resources from the Young Master. Only we, Young Miss Zijun, really think about the Young Master...”","At this moment, Li Zijun was suffering from burning pains due to the internal injury in her chest, and she almost couldn’t even stand up.","However, listening to the discussions of the cultivators around her, she felt a burst of joy in her heart!","Against the Young Master’s fierce gaze that seemed to want to kill someone, she said these words because what she wanted to achieve was nothing more than this goal!","She wants everyone to know that she was the only person who was truly open-minded and magnanimous, who can consider for the whole clan, and who can be qualified for the role of future mistress!","Compared with her, Li Leyun was just a stupid big sister with no brains, and Divine Doctor Li was a beautiful embroidered pillow.","And the Young Master was used to those beauties who are obedient to him. Now that he sees such a stubborn woman who insists on her own opinion, she will definitely be moved by her integrity and will look at her differently!","Li Zijun noticed that Li Moying’s gaze had been on her all the time, so he couldn’t help but raise his chin, trying hard to present his most beautiful angle in front of his sweetheart.","This was the best opportunity for her to show her face after two years of dormancy!","Hearing Li Zijun’s words, Huang Yueli stopped a long time ago and turned around.","Seeing Li Zijun’s contrived performance, a sneer appeared on the corner of her mouth.","Did Li Zijun think that Li Moying would really like her? As everyone knows, Li Moying now even has the heart to kill someone!","However, this Li Zijun was much smarter than Li Leyun.","What she said, although suspected of intentionally provoking trouble, was more or less reasonable, and it also resonated with those young cultivators.","If Li Moying really made a move here, there would be something wrong with Li Zijun. If the news got out, it would definitely damage his prestige in the clan.","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli hurried over before her husband exploded, and said, “Alright, I’ll compete with you guys!”","Hearing this, Li Zijun froze for a moment, “What... what?”","“Didn’t you just say it yourself? Let me compare with you to prove that I am qualified to stay here. Now that I agree, tell me, how do you want to compete?” Huang Yueli said casually.","Since Li Zijun was in a hurry to seek her own abuse, there was no need for her to be polite!","How dare a mere heaven-level genius dare to challenge her? She had to admire Li Zijun’s courage!","However, Li Zijun didn’t know anything about the opponent she was about to face, and thought that the one standing opposite her was a female doctor with average talent.","Seeing that she was so stupid as to agree to the challenge, she couldn’t help but secretly rejoice. This damn girl really doesn’t know how to live or die, and this embarrassment was definitely lost! Moreover, the sword has no eyes during the competition, and you might get injured. This was really a dead end!","Li Zijun hurriedly said: “Alright, you said it yourself! The method of the competition is very simple.”","She said, pointing to the Illusion Array in the middle of the training ground, “Have you seen this Illusion Array? This Illusion Array is used to test the fighting ability of cultivators. After entering the Illusion Array, there will be various Spirit beasts appearing. If you kill spirit beasts of different strengths, you will get different points, which will be displayed on the stone tablet next to you.”"]},{"number":3865,"title":"Chapter 3865 Just Wait!(13)","paragraphs":["3865 Just Wait!(13)","Huang Yueli followed her fingers and looked over, then nodded secretly.","When Li Zijun said this, she understood it. No wonder when she approached just now, she seemed to vaguely see the handwriting on the stone tablet, but before she could see it clearly, she was distracted by the dispute between Li Moying and Liu Buyan.","Li Moying was quite perfunctory to Liu Buyan, and he didn’t make it clear when she introduced the Illusion Array. On the contrary, Li Zijun made it clearer.","Huang Yueli nodded and said, “So that’s it. The numbers on the front are the points obtained by the cultivators who are training. So, the numbers on the back of the stele are the strength rankings of your Cloudy Qilin Clan cultivators?”","!!","She turned to the back of the stele and looked up and down. The name on the top came into view, and it was Li Moying!","Her husband was amazing!","Huang Yueli and You Rongyan frowned, and continued to read.","She fully thought that the second place would be Li Leyun, Li Zijun, etc., but in the end, she kept scanning down, and at the end of the 100-person list, she didn’t see any name she remembered.","Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes, and just when she was a little surprised, she heard Li Zijun say: “The back was indeed a ranking, but it was the ranking of all the geniuses of our Cloudy Qilin Clan for millions of years! As long as they are under the age of fifty, the results of the trials are left here, and they can all be listed on the top! So...you know the strength of our Young Master now? You are completely different from him! Don’t think that you can use superficial medical skills, It can be compared with a peerless genius like the Young Master!”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli was a little surprised, and looked back at her husband.","Li Moying had a cold face, and looked over coldly. The moment he met Huang Yueli’s eyes, he gave her an arrogant look and turned his head away.","Huang Yueli almost laughed out aloud.","This man was really becoming more and more naive. Was he really the number one genius on the stele for millions of years?","Wasn’t it because she didn’t let him kill someone, and even agreed to Li Zijun’s challenge? How could he lose his temper so childishly?","Seeing Huang Yueli’s silence, Li Zijun thought she was ashamed of herself, so she couldn’t help but sneered.","“Do you understand now? Do you know what you should do?”","“Understand what?” Huang Yueli turned her head, with an innocent expression on her face, “Oh, I understand...”","Li Zijun was elated in her heart when she heard this.","But before she could laugh, Huang Yueli continued, “I understand, Young Master Li is indeed a peerless genius. To him, both you and me are nothing. We are just straw bags, well since everyone is similar, there’s no need for the pot calling kettle black!”","When Li Zijun heard this, she was so angry that she almost couldn’t hold back her curses!","She considers herself a first-class genius of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Even if she can’t compare to Li Moying, she was not comparable to a weak doctor like Huang Yueli!","However, she couldn’t say anything to refute.","Because she was the one who asked Huang Yueli to look at the ranking on the stele.","In the ranking above, Li Moying was number one, and she couldn’t even rank in the top 100. Compared to Li Moying, it’s alright to say she’s an idiot.","“You...don’t play tricks here!” Li Zijun barely suppressed the anger in her chest, and gave Huang Yueli a vicious look, “Today’s competition will be held in the Illusion Array, and if your points can surpass any one of us, you win!”"]},{"number":3866,"title":"Chapter 3866 Just Wait and See!(14)","paragraphs":["3866 Just Wait and See!(14)","Hearing this, Huang Yueli said unexpectedly: “Any one? I thought... the one who wanted to compete with me was you!”","Li Zijun’s face suddenly showed a very complacent expression and she glanced at Huang Yueli, with a bit of disdain on the corner of his mouth.","“Compete with me? Divine Doctor Li, although you are very courageous, it is impossible to compare against me! Although I don’t have the strength to rank in the top 100 of the overall list, the best score I’ve scored so far has already reached more than a thousand points! This time, I have cultivated for a long time and came prepared in order to score a higher record. If I compete with you, it’s just bullying the weak. Even if I win, I won’t feel happy about it.","After hearing these words, Huang Yueli’s gaze subconsciously fell on the back of the stone tablet.","!!","Li Moying’s name was followed by a number, 187,365. Age at completion was 23.","Next, the second place’s points was not too far behind him, with more than 160,000 points, but he was already 49 years old when he finished.","There was a bigger gap between each of the subsequent rankings, and the subsequent difference in placings were even further apart. When she saw the 100th place, one could actually be on the list with only 20,000 points.","1,000 points...","This was a far cry from being on the list. She even began to wonder how many tens of thousands of people there were behind.","It’s such a shameful matter yet that Li Zijun still had the cheek to speak out.","The corner of Huang Yueli’s mouth twitched, she couldn’t control the expression on her face.","It might be that her disdain was a bit too obvious, Li Zijun also realized it and her expression immediately turned darker.","“What? You still think my points are too low? It seems that you really haven’t seen anything in the world, and you don’t know what 1,000 points means!”","“Oh? What does it mean?” Huang Yueli quickly put on an expression of humbly asking for advice and coupled it with her big sparkly eyes blinking.","“Let me tell you, once entering this Illusion Array, all cultivators’ cultivation bases will be cleared, and they will be collectively transformed into the late stage of the Dream Profound Realm, and the spirit beasts inside are of the lowest level, which is equivalent to the early stage of the Dream Profound Realm, and the number of them appearing at the same time is also very little, but at this time, killing a spirit beast was only one point. As the battle time increases, the strength of spirit beasts will continue to increase, and the number of simultaneous appearances will also double, and the points will also double! However, the strength of the cultivator itself remains unchanged and it will always be at the late stage of the Heart Profound Realm. To reach 1,000 points like me, one must kill at least twenty mid-stage Heart Profound Realm spirit beasts, or more than ten middle-stage Heart Profound Realm cultivators. ”","Li Zijun’s face lit up as she mentioned her own achievements.","And the amazed expressions on the faces of the young cultivators behind her also proved this point.","“I have long heard that Young Miss Zijun was amazing in actual combat, even more powerful than Young Miss Leyun. She even won a thousand points in the Illusion Array. I thought it was just a rumour, but it turned out to be true!”","“That’s amazing! Last time I tried my best, I only got 300 points...”","“Young Miss Zijun suffers because the purity of her bloodline is slightly lower, and the speed of accumulating her cultivation base is slower, but her comprehension is definitely top-notch!”","“Actually, just having a high cultivation level was nothing. When you really need to fight outside, the actual combat ability is the most important thing.”","Li Zijun looked at Huang Yueli, and slightly curled her lips, “Young Miss Li, do you understand now? In the Illusion Array, all the treasures of heaven and earth are useless, even cultivation is useless, you can only rely on your own fighting skills!”"]},{"number":3867,"title":"Chapter 3867 Just Wait!(15)","paragraphs":["3867 Just Wait!(15)","Li Zijun thought that after hearing this, the weak female doctor would turn pale with fright.","After all, people like them who only know alchemy and read medical books were not real cultivators at all, and their cultivation may not be bad, but they probably have never participated in a serious battle, let alone have any skills.","But who knew, when she glanced at Huang Yueli with complacency, she saw that she had a thoughtful expression on her face instead.","Looking carefully, it seems that there was still a bit of surprise, and there was no sign of being frightened at all.","!!","Li Zijun couldn’t help but gnash her teeth inwardly.","Let this damn girl continue pretending here! After entering the Illusion Array, it’s good not to be scared and cry there and then!","Huang Yueli was really pleasantly surprised. In the Illusion Array, all the trainees could be trained at the same level, forcing them to fight higher and higher. This was what can really stimulate the potential of cultivators, and it was the most efficient way of cultivation. No wonder her husband’s strength had improved by leaps and bounds after arriving in the God Realm!","However, to complete such an Illusion Array, the difficulty level was simply too high.","Even a talented person like Huang Yueli, who was very talented in arrays, felt that it was almost impossible to do it... The background of the Cloudy Qilin Clan was really extraordinary!","Seeing her deep in thought, Li Zijun sneered in her heart, but said: “Divine Doctor Li, I know that this is your first time, so I won’t make it difficult for you. We will all enter the Illusion Array to participate in the Trial, when the time comes, the points will be displayed on the front of the stone tablet, as long as you can surpass any one of us, it will prove that you are qualified to enter the place of experience!”","“Don’t worry, I’m definitely not cheating on you. This time I came in with me, and two of them came to the place of experience for the first time. They have no experience like you, and the foundation is the same. As long as you are strong enough, there is still hope to surpass them.”","As Li Zijun said, she raised her hand to introduce the two young cultivators behind her.","A man and a woman, both around 30 years old. It can be seen that they have the lowest status among the people who came in this time, so they were standing at the back.","Even so, when the two of them looked at Huang Yueli, they couldn’t hide the pride on their faces.","In their view, Li Zijun’s polite words just now are definitely a model of talking nonsense with open eyes, and she said it so nicely just to take into account the Young Master’s face.","It’s just a female doctor, she looks weak at first glance, want to compare her fighting skills with talented cultivators like them? How was it possible to win?","They nodded towards Huang Yueli.","Although she didn’t like her in her heart, she didn’t dare to talk nonsense under Li Moying’s nose.","Huang Yueli smiled slightly, she didn’t mind their attitude at all, she just smiled at Li Zijun and said, “This arrangement is fine, I have no objection.”","When Li Zijun heard this, she was very pleasantly surprised. She couldn’t control the expression on her face and smiled.","Turning her head to look at Li Moying, she found that although his face was ugly, he still stood behind Huang Yueli without saying a word, and had no intention of stopping their competition at all.","When Li Zijun saw it, she immediately lost her mind.","It seems that their Young Master doesn’t value this Divine Doctor Li as much as she imagined!","Although he brought her in, he didn’t mean to protect her at all.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t have agreed to let Divine Doctor Li participate in this match!"]},{"number":3868,"title":"Chapter 3868 Just Wait!(16)","paragraphs":["3868 Just Wait!(16)","As long as she loses today, even if the tone was set for the entire Cloudy Qilin Clan, even if Li Moying continues to be with her in the future, there was no way for her to gain the approval of all the clansmen and become the Young Madame of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","It’s impossible for Li Moying not to know this, but he still didn’t stop it.","The only explanation was that the Young Master never thought of letting Divine Doctor Li become his wife!","I guess it was because of her beauty that he couldn’t help but get close to her, but it was just for fun.","!!","A man like the Young Master has the clearest mind, but he can never make a mistake about what kind of woman he would be with and what kind of status he has.","After Li Zijun figured this out, she secretly heaved a sigh of relief, and was even more confident in herself.","She felt that her performance today must have left a deep impression on Li Moying’s heart! In the future, as long as she works a little harder, the position of Young Madam will be beckoning to her!","Li Zijun took two deep breaths, suppressed the excitement in his heart, and said as calmly as possible: “Divine Doctor Li, since you agree, let’s start the competition? Do you want to enter the Illusion Array first, or prepare for it? Shall we go in after the trial?”","Huang Yueli shook her head, “Not at all.”","Li Zijun frowned immediately, “What? Divine Doctor Li, do you want to go back on your word?”","She stared at Huang Yueli closely, for fear that she would suddenly wake up and reject this unreasonable proposal.","However, Huang Yueli just smiled and said: “I don’t want to regret it, it’s just... I just came in, and I haven’t even entered the tower to study. To be honest, I really don’t have much experience in combat skills.” I haven’t learned much before, so I’m sure I won’t get many points if I enter the Illusion Array like this. So, I’d better go to the tower to comprehend first, and then go to the trial, can you see if it’s convenient?”","After hearing this, Li Zijun exhaled a long breath.","It’s fine as long as you don’t go back on your word!","Her expression relaxed, and she immediately showed a smile, “Divine Doctor Li, this was my negligence, and it really shouldn’t be! I forgot that this was the first time you came here and you haven’t even tried to comprehend it. Then you should hurry to the tower. We’ll wait for you here, and when you’re done, we’ll go to the Illusion Array to compete.”","Huang Yueli nodded, “This arrangement sounds much better.”","As she spoke, she turned around and seemed to want to leave, but after taking two steps, she suddenly stopped and looked at the others, “What? I am the only one going to the tower? Don’t you need to go to enlightenment?”","Li Zijun chuckled, “Let’s not go! Otherwise, everyone’s enlightenment time is different, so we can’t get together. Although the trial points of the last twenty people will be kept on the front of the stone tablet for a while, However, it was fairer to witness in person. Divine Doctor Li, don’t worry, we are waiting for you here!”","Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes, “You guys want to wait for me here? But, I’m a slow learner, maybe I might take a long time to comprehend!”","Li Zijun wanted to laugh even more.","She’s just a doctor. Did she think that she was a genius martial cultivator and had been comprehending for a long time?","It was estimated that she would be kicked out in less than a quarter of an hour!","They’ll just wait here and chat for a bit, it didn’t take much effort at all!","She said with a smile on her face: “It’s alright, we will wait for you patiently, please go ahead!”"]},{"number":3869,"title":"Chapter 3869 Wait A While Longer (1)","paragraphs":["3869 Wait A While Longer (1)","Huang Yueli gave her a meaningful look, without saying anything more, she turned around and walked towards an empty tower.","She has already reminded Li Zijun and the others, which can be regarded as the utmost benevolence.","It was Li Zijun and the others who insisted on waiting for her outside.","Since they were so persistent, she could only let them wait!","Huang Yueli pushed open the door of the tower and walked in.","The furnishings inside were different from what she had imagined. It didn’t look like an ordinary Illusion Array. On the contrary, it looked like a library.","In the small room, the four walls were full of floor-to-ceiling bookcases, densely packed with various classics.","Huang Yueli got closer, and saw several lines of marks on each floor of the bookcase, indicating the attributes and types of the classics on this floor.","She walked around the wall and looked around casually. There were at least tens of thousands of books here, and they are all combat secrets!","Although she had been prepared for a long time, such a scene still shocked her heart.","The Cloudy Qilin Clan really deserves to be one of the top Ancient God Clans. The accumulation of resources in the clan was indeed unfathomable...","In the God Realm, combat secrets were very precious. If ordinary cultivators can get a copy of the lowest level, they would be treasured as heirlooms.","And the Cloudy Qilin Clan... actually got tens of thousands of copies here, and even let the geniuses in the clan choose!","It’s no wonder that the cultivators of the ancient god race were several times stronger than the cultivators of the human race with the same talent! The gap in cultivation resources between the two sides was really too big!","However, Huang Yueli also noticed that at least three quarters of these combat secrets were of the Thunder attribute.","This was not surprising. After all, the main attribute of the Cloudy Qilin Clan was the thunder attribute, and it was only natural that they would have a preference for the thunder attribute’s skills.","It’s just that, for Huang Yueli, a cultivator who majored in the fire attribute, the options became smaller.","Huang Yueli thought for a while, then walked to the bookcase marked with the attribute of fire, took a manual from above, and opened it.","The yellowed paper was opened in her hands...","Suddenly, a golden light flashed in front of her eyes, and immediately after that, the illusory figure of a cultivator appeared in the centre of the room.","A feeling of dizziness also appeared in Huang Yueli’s mind. She closed her eyes to suppress this uncomfortable feeling.","When she opened her eyes again, the bookcases around her seemed to disappear in an instant, and she seemed to be in nothingness. Apart from herself, only the illusory figure of the cultivator in the centre remained.","Huang Yueli frowned slightly, and before she had time to react, the illusory figure started to move.","The illusory figure held a soft sword in his hand. On the sword, dazzling golden flames continuously lit up. As the illusory figure continued to make moves, the energy of the fire attribute was driven by the patterns on the sword and the surrounding temperature gradually increased...","Huang Yueli’s attitude was relatively casual at first, but later on, her expression became more and more focused.","Because, she discovered that this set of secret techniques performed by the illusory figure was really infinitely mysterious! It was much more clever than the fighting techniques she usually uses!","Moreover, if such a complicated exercise was written on paper, no matter how detailed it was, it would take a lot of effort to understand it thoroughly.","But now, the secret method of battle was displayed by an illusory figure and the flames seemed to be imprinted in Huang Yueli’s mind."]},{"number":3870,"title":"Chapter 3870 Wait A While Longer (2)","paragraphs":["3870 Wait A While Longer (2)","Huang Yueli just saw it once and felt the profound strength in her body, which seemed to faintly follow the illusory figure’s movements, had resonated with it.","All distracting thoughts in her mind disappeared and all her mind was immersed in this set of secret techniques.","It wasn’t until the illusory figure in the middle of the room stopped that she gradually woke up.","The illusory figure put away the sword and it gradually became transparent, and disappeared from Huang Yueli’s eyes a few breaths of time later.","!!","The scenes around her also changed back, and the surrounding walls and bookcases reappeared.","Huang Yueli blinked for a moment and soon understood.","It seems that as long as she chooses the combat secret method she wants to cultivate and opens it, she will be transported to the secret realm of this secret method and watch the illusory figure display the contents.","“This is really convenient! The secret book just now was quite simple. Let me see if there is anything more useful!”","Huang Yueli’s eyes lit up, she stopped wasting time and began to carefully observe each book on the bookcase and choose it.","It didn’t take long before she picked out seven or eight fire-attribute combat secrets, and two that were common to all attributes.","“Well, let’s read these first! As the saying goes, haste makes waste. If you read too many secrets at once, you may not be able to fully comprehend the content. Learning these few should be enough for me to use at the God Realm’s Grand Meet.”","Huang Yueli fiddled with the cover of the manuals as she spoke her thoughts aloud.","“Alright, let’s start!”","Huang Yueli raised her hand and stretched her waist, her spirits lifted, she stretched out her hand and opened the cover of the top book.","The golden light flashed...","...","And outside the tower, near the stone tablet of the Illusion Array.","At this very moment, Li Zijun was standing there waiting with the few of her attendants.","Several people gathered together, looking eagerly at the tower where Huang Yueli entered.","At first, everyone thought that Huang Yueli would be kicked out soon.","Because it sounds simple to turn the content of the secret combat method into an illusory figure , but in fact, it was also a heavy burden for those who watch the illusory figure.","When teleporting in and out of the secret realm, there was a lot of pressure on the cultivator’s soul and the slightly weaker cultivators couldn’t bear it at all.","Not only that, but the process of watching the illusory figure was also constantly consuming the cultivator’s spiritual power. The longer the viewing time, the more it will be consumed, and the higher the level of the secret technique, the more spiritual power it consumes will increase exponentially.","According to their estimates, with Huang Yueli’s strength, at most, she could open a book of the most common one. If she took a second look, she would be kicked out due to exhaustion of mental power.","Everyone waited and waited without saying a word.","I don’t know who suddenly called out, “Huh? How long has it been?”","Li Zijun was in a daze just now because she was too bored, but she suddenly woke up when he heard this sound, and found that Huang Yueli had already entered the tower for more than a quarter of an hour!","She was obviously not the only one who noticed this, and other cultivators also began to whisper about it.","“It’s been a quarter of an hour, and Divine Doctor Li hasn’t come out yet?”","“This is strange...”","“What’s so strange? Divine Divine Doctor Li is afterall a Spirit Medicine Master! The spiritual power of a Spirit Medicine Master should be much higher than that of ordinary cultivators of the same level. It’s not a strange thing to be able to stay in the tower for a while.”","Hearing this, Li Zijun suddenly understood."]},{"number":3871,"title":"Chapter 3871 Wait A While Longer (3)","paragraphs":["3871 Wait A While Longer (3)","Yes!","She was so anxious to slap that Divine Doctor Li in the face just now that she forgot such an important matter!","That damn girl was a Spirit Medicine Master. Even if her overall strength is terrible, her mental strength should still be good.","It’s no wonder she was so confident when she entered the tower just now.","!!","Li Zijun frowned, feeling that she had miscalculated, but she quickly calmed down again.","“It seems that Divine Doctor Li’s spiritual power is not bad, so that’s good, she can comprehend and gain something valuable in time for the Grand Meet and gain a few more points, which can be regarded as living up to the Young Master’s expectations since he was the one who brought her in.” Li Zijun said with a slight smile.","Hearing this, there was a burst of admiration from the crowd.","Li Zijun’s words were very decent, and she did not reveal her eagerness for Huang Yueli’s misfortune at all.","On the contrary, the meaning in her words seemed to be very considerate for Huang Yueli, hoping that she would understand a little more, which seemed very magnanimous.","At the same time, Li Moying was brought in, implying that if Huang Yueli didn’t make any progress after enlightenment, then she would be sorry for Li Moying.","She said this on purpose to leave a nail in Li Moying’s heart.","If Huang Yueli behaves badly later, it will easily make Li Moying think wrongly, thinking that she had shamed him and failed his expectations.","After Li Zijun finished speaking, she didn’t forget to sneak a glance at Li Moying, hoping to get Li Moying’s admiring gaze.","However, Li Moying remained expressionless, and didn’t even give her any part in his peripheral vision from the corner of his eyes.","Li Zijun wanted to say something more, but suddenly, he saw Li Moying take a few steps forward.","When Li Moying moved, everyone fell silent and looked at him unexpectedly.","Because, since Huang Yueli entered the tower, he has not moved or spoken, just stood there, as if waiting for everyone to compete in front of him.","But now, he suddenly moved?","Under the watchful eyes of everyone, Li Moying still looked cold, and walked straight towards the tower where Huang Yueli was.","“Young Master, this ...” Li Zijun couldn’t hold back his voice.","Seeing Li Moying like this, could it be that something went wrong in the tower with that Divine Doctor Li, and the Young Master was in a hurry to save people?","This thought came to the minds of the cultivators present at the same time.","Because it was unexpected that Huang Yueli could stay in the tower for such a long time, but looking at Li Moying’s performance, it was easy for people to have such an association.","For a moment, Li Zijun felt secretly happy.","It seems that Divine Doctor Li was not as mentally powerful as she thought, but she was injured while holding on inside!","Now that’s all right, that damn girl can’t even enter the Illusion Array, so she’s about to leave the place of training in despair!","This time it’ll be really embarrassing. Hmph! Let’s see what face that damn girl has to rely on to stay by the Young Master’s side!","However, before Li Zijun was happy, she suddenly found that when Li Moying walked in front of Huang Yueli’s tower, he didn’t intend to stop at all, but took a few steps forward and walked past the gate of the tower!","Everyone’s eyes widened. They were very surprised. They didn’t know why he didn’t stop.","The next moment, Li Moying’s figure disappeared at the door of another tower next to him.","Li Zijun stared at the closed door for a long time before coming back to her senses."]},{"number":3872,"title":"Chapter 3872 Wait A While Longer (4)","paragraphs":["3872 Wait A While Longer (4)","Li Moying didn’t go to save her at all just now, but... but to enter the tower to gain enlightenment!","He would walk towards the tower where Huang Yueli was, as if it was just... along the way?","Actually, it’s just because the tower next to Huang Yueli happened to be empty...","Li Zijun’s face turned livid all of a sudden, not to mention how stifled her chest felt but she couldn’t explain why!","Just now, it was clear that she was thinking too much. Even if she felt that she was being tricked, she couldn’t blame others.","The other cultivators also looked at each other in blank dismay. For a moment, they didn’t know what to do.","An awkward atmosphere ensued in the open space.","After a while, someone mustered up the courage, walked up to Li Zijun, and asked in a low voice: “Young Miss Zijun, why did the Young Master suddenly enter the tower? Doesn’t he plan to stay here and see that Divine Doctor Li?” was it the performance of entering the Illusion Array for the first time?”","Li Zijun snorted coldly, “You’re asking me, then who should I ask?”","She was full of depression and had nowhere to vent, when someone came knocking, she immediately gave him an annoyed look.","Seeing that she was so angry, the other cultivators didn’t dare to speak.","Li Zijun took a few deep breaths before suppressing the anger in her heart. After thinking about it again, her face finally calmed down a lot.","“When you ask this question, don’t you think about it for yourself first? The God Realm’s Grand Meet is about to take place, and the time for the Young Master to cultivate is also very precious. Can he still wait here for her? Waiting here to watch her embarrassment? You guys think too highly of that Divine Doctor Li! How can she be able to delay so much of Young Master’s precious time!”","Li Zijun’s tone was still not very good, but after hearing what she said, the faces of the young cultivators all showed sudden understanding.","“That’s right, that’s true, the Young Master also wants to cultivate!”","“What’s the identity of the Young Master? Can he be here waiting like us?”","“Hey, I saw the Young Master deliberately brought her to the place of training earlier. I thought the Young Master valued her a lot. It turns out...that’s all!”","“Hehe, she’s just a doctor after all. Not to mention her, how can there be a woman in the God Realm who can be compared to the Young Master? The Young Master has already treated her very well.”","After Li Moying left, the cultivators present no longer had any scruples, they no longer deliberately lowered their voices, and the content of their speech became bolder and bolder.","However, they all felt that what they said was very objective and reasonable.","After all, in their view, Li Moying’s performance of ignoring Huang Yueli the whole time and directly entering the tower to cultivate already explained everything.","“Young Miss Zijun, if I knew that the Young Master had this attitude towards her, there’s no need for us to bet like this with her?”","“That’s right, the Young Master is devoted to climbing to the peak. How could he be fascinated by seeing a beauty? The attitude of our clan is already here. Even if we don’t compete with Divine Doctor Li, the Young Master will still consider the opinions of the clan!”","“Or, let’s leave her alone, just go to the tower to study!”","For some low-ranking cultivators, the time they can stay in the training place was only a few hours, and every moment was very precious.","Now, a quarter of an hour has been wasted waiting for Huang Yueli to come out, and some people are a little anxious.","However, Li Zijun’s attitude was still very firm.","“Since we agreed to compete, we must not go back on our word! She will definitely come out soon, so wait!”"]},{"number":3873,"title":"Chapter 3873 Wait A While Longer (5)","paragraphs":["3873 Wait A While Longer (5)","Li Zijun didn’t believe that anything wrong would happen at all.","Even if it was an earth-level genius, it was absolutely impossible to stay for an hour when entering the tower for the first time! You can only stay for three quarters of an hour at most.","For that stinky girl, half an hour was definitely her limit, but it’s just a little bit longer.","Li Zijun was also unwilling to miss the opportunity to humiliate Huang Yueli.","If that damn girl sneaked away while she was going to the tower , she wouldn’t be able to find such a good opportunity again!","Li Zijun made up her mind. Although the other cultivators were somewhat reluctant, they did not dare to offend her openly. They could only hold back their temper and continue to wait.","Time passed bit by bit.","Above the tower where Huang Yueli was, the red light was always on, without any sign of going out.","As time passed, Li Zijun also became a little irritable.","She frowned and asked the people around her, “How long has Divine Doctor Li been in?”","“It... it’s been... an hour since she first went in...” Her attendant said hesitantly.","To be honest, no one present expected that Huang Yueli would be able to stay in the tower for such a long time!","Hearing that an hour had passed, everyone showed astonishment on their faces.","Li Zijun’s face turned livid, “What? An hour?? Are you sure? Have you seen it clearly? How could it be an hour!”","The servant was yelled at by her impatiently, looking a little aggrieved, “This...Young Miss Zijun, if you don’t believe me, you can see for yourself. I...I didn’t see it wrong...”","In fact, there was no need for him to emphasize again, Li Zijun was already completely sure.","Huang Yueli had really stayed in the tower for an entire hour!","Only more, no less!","“How was this possible? Isn’t Young Miss Li a Spirit Medicine Master? Judging by her usual delicate appearance, the profound force on her body was not particularly strong. It doesn’t feel like a talented cultivator at all?”","“However, she has indeed stayed in the tower for so long. Everyone has seen it with their own eyes. It must be fake, right? From this point of view, she should have at least an earth-level talent.”","“No, you can’t say that! Since she’s a Spirit Medicine Master, maybe she has an exceptional strong mental power?”","“I’ve heard that the spirit power of Spirit Medicine Masters focuses on manipulation, while us cultivators focus on bearing pressure. There’s still a big difference between the two. Even if she can persist for a while longer than cultivators of the same level, it is impossible for her to persist for more than twice as much. time. Therefore, her talent can at least reach the upper-middle level of the younger generation of our Cloudy Qilin Clan.”","All the cultivators were stunned by Huang Yueli’s performance. After finally digesting the reality, they couldn’t help discussing in a low voice.","The evaluation of Huang Yueli has also improved a lot.","In the God Realm, earth-level geniuses can actually be regarded as first-rate geniuses. Even among the ancient gods, there are not many of them, and among the younger generation, there are only 30% of them at most.","Therefore, they think that Huang Yueli was at the upper-middle level among the geniuses of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, which was generally not a problem.","However, Li Zijun didn’t like to hear them discussing the big truth.","Her complexion suddenly sank, and she said sharply: “Enough! Don’t talk nonsense anymore! Even if Divine Doctor Li’s talent is fair, she is definitely not qualified to enter the training ground!”"]},{"number":3874,"title":"Chapter 3874 Wait A While Longer (6)","paragraphs":["3874 Wait A While Longer (6)","“You can’t lower the standard for her just because she has an affair with the Young Master, right? This is a humiliation to the entire Cloudy Qilin Clan!” Li Zijun said righteously.","Hearing this, the cultivators all lowered their heads, not daring to speak again.","Seeing that they seemed to have an idea, Li Zijun immediately slowed down her tone and said, “You guys have to figure out where you stand! This genius Divine Doctor Li and her senior brother are occupying the training time of the real genius in our clan! Think about it.” Li Chenhua and the others who were stopped outside just now! Do you want to be like them?”","Hearing this, the young cultivators were all ashamed of what they said just now.","!!","That’s right, even if that Divin Doctor Li was a rare earth-level genius among the human race, what does it have to do with them?","They were all the top batch of geniuses at the earth level. They have been screened by the clan and defeated countless opponents before they have obtained the qualifications for training here.","That little girl... Why is she relying on the Young Master’s relationship to be like them?","No, it’s not the same!","That little girl’s training time in the place of experience was unlimited!","Compared with her, those of them who can only practice for a few hours a month are no different from beggars on the street.","Li Zijun’s short words reaffirmed their determination to humiliate Huang Yueli severely.","Everyone was very united, they all gritted their teeth and stared at the gate of the tower, waiting for Huang Yueli to come out from inside.","An hour had passed!","Can she persist longer than this?","That is the most incredible thing in the world!","So, next, she may appear at any time, and she may miss it if she blinks her eyes a little.","Everyone believed so firmly, but all of them stared until their eyes ached, and they began to cry against the wind, but they still didn’t see Huang Yueli’s shadow.","Li Zijun waited and waited, feeling more and more wrong.","She looked up suspiciously at the tower where Huang Yueli was. In the dense mist of profound energy, only the bright light on the top of the tower was always on, which looked strange and ironic.","Li Zijun gritted his teeth, “How long has it been!”","Her words were like a thunderbolt, waking up the cultivators who had been stunned in place.","“It’s...it’s...it’s...it’s been half an hour...”","The attendant checked the time and spoke in disbelief, his voice began to visibly tremble.","Two and a half hours passed before they knew it!","Even if the time Huang Yueli wasted betting with them was deducted, there would still be at least two full hours left.","That female doctor had been in the tower for so long!","Realizing this, the faces of the last two cultivators who came in this time instantly turned pale!","Because, as earth level geniuses who entered the training ground for the first time, they were not sure that they could stay in the tower for two hours!","Most people only comprehend for an hour for the first time, and then enter the Illusion Array for a trial, and if they have some insights, they will be considered as having completed the first experience.","It will take ten days and half a month to go back and digest the first harvest before returning to study.","Otherwise, the consciousness would not be able to withstand such intense wear and pressure, and it would easily cause damage to the primordial spirit, and it would be difficult to heal."]},{"number":3875,"title":"Chapter 3875 Wait A While Longer (7)","paragraphs":["3875 Wait A While Longer (7)","But now, a female Spirit Medicine Master who seems to be mediocre has actually comprehended for two straight hours?","Considering these cultivators who were regarded as outstanding among earth level geniuses, the amount of time she persisted was much longer!","Realizing this, the two were hit hard.","They even began to doubt their own strength.","!!","They couldn’t even compare to a Spirit Medicine Master of the human race. Can they really win the ranking in the God Realm’s Grand Meet? Maybe they can’t even pass the first round of trials!","Seeing the faces of these people, Li Zijun also understood a little bit.","She couldn’t help but cursed them as trash in her heart!","Li Zijun sneered and said, “It seems that this Divine Doctor Li has a really strong mental power. It’s no wonder that she’s able to study medicine with her Senior Brother at a young age, and she’s able to cure such a rare condition which Young Master had. But , medical skills were medical skills, martial skills were martial skills, these were two completely different fields. No matter how strong her mental power was, it was nothing more than a little more comprehension in the tower. What was the use of this? After entering the illusion, wouldn’t it be extremely embarrassing to fight in the array? The strength of our cultivators still has to be reflected through fighting!”","After hearing this, the cultivator who had already lost his confidence was slightly relieved.","That’s right, even if Divine Doctor Li stayed in the tower longer, it was probably because of her special physique.","However, no matter how powerful her mental power is, she still can’t get one more point in the Illusion Array!","These are just false strengths!","After figuring this out, the faces of the young cultivators looked much better.","However, they couldn’t sit still anymore, looked at Li Zijun, and pleaded cautiously: “Young Miss Zijun, two hours have passed now, and I only have ten hours in total, if I drag it any longer, there is not much time left. Can I... um, go in and study it first?”","Hearing this, Li Zijun’s expression turned a little ugly.","She kept these people here, and she didn’t have to wait with her.","It’s because she considers herself to be the top three heavenly genius of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, so how could she condescend to compete with Huang Yueli in the Illusion Array?","She was not stupid!","Competing with people who are obviously inferior to her, if she wins, she will be considered as big bullying the small, and if she loses...Of course, it was impossible for her to lose!","However, for the sake of her own reputation, she didn’t plan to settle this by herself, she just wanted to let the weakest follower she brought to crush Huang Yueli.","Only in this way can she show how noble her status was and how powerful she was! She was completely different from that Divine Doctor Li, which would only make him feel ashamed.","The plan itself was perfect, but Huang Yueli stayed in the tower for so long, which far exceeded Li Zijun’s expectations.","Now, when her followers requested to go into the tower for their own comprehension, she couldn’t refuse.","It’s not bad to drag someone to wait for a quarter of an hour, half an hour.","It’s been more than two hours now, if it drags on, the other party won’t be able to cultivate, wasting this rare opportunity to comprehend, only the heavens know how much hatred would be accumulated towards her when they leave!","However, she was not reconciled to asking her to wait here alone.","After thinking about it, she gritted her teeth and said, “You guys wait with me for a while, it won’t be long! I will compensate you twice for the time you wasted this time, next month!”"]},{"number":3876,"title":"Chapter 3876 Wait A While Longer (8)","paragraphs":["3876 Wait A While Longer (8)","Although the training time obtained by each young cultivator was fixed, if one does not need it, one can transfer one’s own training time to others.","Hearing that Li Zijun was willing to spend double the time next month to make up for them, everyone’s eyes lit up.","It was very difficult to improve the clan ranking by one rank, let alone gain double the experience time.","The reward Li Zijun proposed was a huge temptation for everyone present.","!!","They were elated and immediately responded with zest: “Young Miss Zijun, don’t worry! We are definitely on your side. We will wait until that Divine Doctor Li comes out! When we enter the Illusion Array, we will behave well and let her know the gap between herself and the Ancient God Clan cultivators!”","Li Zijun laughed dryly, “That’s a lot of hard work for you guys. If you think about it, you won’t be able to wait for long.”","“Don’t worry, don’t worry!” Several people waved their hands repeatedly.","Li Zijun was not as patient as they were.","For the sake of double compensation, they no longer had a problem with how long they wait now, but these times were all taken out of her own training time!","Time passed by bit by bit, as if cutting her flesh with a knife, it made her heart ache!","Another hour passed.","Li Zijun’s eyes widened, and her gaze was so intent that it almost pierced through the wooden door of the tower, but there was still no sign of the door being opened...","Li Zijun was so anxious that she felt an evil fire rushing up to her chest, making her so anxious that she almost vomited blood!","She couldn’t believe that such a thing existed in the world!","That damn girl staying in the tower for two hours was already bizarre and weird enough, but she could barely comfort herself because that little girl’s mental strength was strong.","But now, three hours had actually passed!","That Divine Doctor Li hasn’t come out yet. Could it be that she was really a genius?","No, it’s impossible!","Li Zijun shook his head vigorously, refusing to believe the result of this guess.","However, what she didn’t expect was that three hours was just the beginning.","Soon, four hours passed.","Five hours have passed...","With a soft “poof”, a golden light suddenly flashed in the crowd.","This scene really shocked people, especially when everyone discovered that after the golden light disappeared, one of their partners disappeared, and people couldn’t help but scream.","“Ah! Li Yinyin is gone! There are... ghosts!”","“Damn you! It’s not the first time you’ve entered the training ground! That means her training time is already up, alright? Is it worth all the fuss?”","Once the prescribed training time is exceeded, cultivators will be forcibly teleported out of this area.","Of course, this was limited to the situation where the cultivator was in the tower or open space. If the trial was in the Illusion Array, it can still be postponed until the end of the trial.","“Oh, that’s right, I forgot...” The person who screamed just now realized that he was very ashamed.","But after thinking about it, he was terrified again, “What? I remember that Li Yinyin has ten hours to cultivate, and she hasn’t come to cultivate this month! So, we have been waiting here for ten hours! ! Then Divine Doctor Li hasn’t come out yet?”","The remaining two attendants looked at Li Zijun in unison.","The door of the tower was still closed!"]},{"number":3877,"title":"Chapter 3877 Beauty Without Brains (1)","paragraphs":["3877 Beauty Without Brains (1)","Ten hours passed, yet there was still no sign that the door was about to open!","Hearing the cautious questions from her followers, Li Zijun could no longer maintain her usual indifferent and arrogant aura, and screamed like a mouse whose tail had been stepped on, “You’re asking me?! Well, who should I ask then?! Each of you, tweeting around one after another, what is it like? All that damn girl did was stay in the tower for a longer time, is there a need to kick up such a fuss?”","The followers were startled by the change in her tone and they all fell silent, not daring to speak any further.","However, they were not blind, and they could tell that Li Zijun was already very disturbed.","!!","As soon as Li Zijun spoke, she realized her own gaffe.","She took several deep breaths, trying to calm herself down a bit, but unfortunately, it did not have much effect.","Huang Yueli has yet to come out, she must be the most nervous and anxious!","Among other things, she had promised those followers just now that she would compensate them double!","Seeing that ten hours had passed, it meant that she had to compensate for each of them twenty hours!","Three people, that was a whopping sixty hours!","She also replaced Li Leyun and became the second-ranked young cultivator in the clan, so she has so much training time. This time, she will pay them all!","Moreover, this was not over yet.","Because, that Divine Doctor Li hasn’t come out until now, and was still staying in the tower! She didn’t even know when she was going to wait till!","Li Zijun stared at the tightly closed door, flames were about to burst out from her eyes!","She couldn’t figure out how that damn girl had persisted in it for so long.","Ten hours have passed, and there are only two possible reasons why she was still in the tower.","One of them was that Divine Doctor Li was actually a heavenly genius, moreover, a top heavenly genius!","Because Li Zijun himself, at most, stayed in the tower for twelve hours in a row. Now, Huang Yueli’s persistence was almost equal to her.","Of course, Li Zijun didn’t believe that Huang Yueli would have such a talent.","Because human cultivators were essentially different from the ancient gods. Because of their bloodlines, they were generally not as talented as the gods, and even heaven-level geniuses were rare. Every time one appears, it will become a sensation in the God Realm, and will be protected by all the high-level cultivators of the entire human race. .","If that little girl was a heavenly talent, how could she be a barefoot doctor and run around with her Senior Brother all over the God Realm?","Now that this possibility was denied, there was only one reason left.","That is...that Divine Doctor Li has died in the tower!","However, this may also make her a little hard to believe, because the training place of the Cloudy Qilin Clan was still very safe. Once the spiritual power of the cultivators drops to a certain level, they will take the initiative to send the person inside out. After so many years, there has never been any accidents...","Unless...","“Could it be that the tower can only send cultivators from the God Clan out, and that little girl is from the human clan, so she was not sent out in time and died inside?”","Li Zijun pondered secretly, a cold light flashed in her eyes.","If this was the case, then it would really save a lot of trouble."]},{"number":3878,"title":"Chapter 3878 Beauty Without Brains (2)","paragraphs":["3878 Beauty Without Brains (2)","However, she was still unable to confirm whether the little girl was dead or alive.","Li Zijun thought about it for a while, and still felt that the possibility of Huang Yueli’s death was the greatest!","She turned her head and looked at the remaining followers behind her, “Since that Divine Doctor Li hasn’t come out, I won’t delay your training time. If you want to go to the tower, you can go there by yourself.”","Li Zijun waved her hand towards them.","!!","When the they heard this, they were a little reluctant.","Now, they don’t have much time left to cultivate. If they enter the tower to comprehend, it is estimated that half of the comprehension will be sent out. Why not spend it here with Li Zijun and get double time compensation?!","However, Li Zijun was obviously very distressed about the training time she had to compensate for, and she didn’t want to let them waste any more time here, so she kept urging the two of them.","In desperation, they could only choose a direction and entered a tower each.","Li Zijun was the only one left in the open space.","The surroundings suddenly became quiet, not even a little noise.","Such an extremely quiet environment would have given people a huge mental pressure. What’s more, Li Zijun was already restless, and she was still entangled with the huge question on why Huang Yueli didn’t come out.","Not long after, she felt that she was going crazy, and she was completely caught in a dilemma!","Now, she has wasted ten full hours in the training ground!","What’s more, she lost 60 hours of training time next month!","Such a long period of time, even for a genius like her, was an extremely painful and huge loss!","So, she can no longer stay here any longer.","She entered the training ground at the last moment to hone herself in order to get a good ranking in the God Realm’s Grand Meet, but in the end, after a day and a night passed, she still did nothing, just being silly by standing and waiting here!","She couldn’t go on like this.","However, she felt even more unwilling to let her enter the tower now.","Because, if Huang Yueli was going to come out, whether it’s a living person or a corpse, it’s probably within this short period of time.","Li Zijun has already wasted such a long time for her. If she misses the time when the other party gets sent out, she will really gain nothing. All her time and energy will be fed to the dog!","Just when Li Zijun was hesitating, suddenly, a silver light flashed.","The position where this figure appeared was in the same direction as the tower that Huang Yueli entered just now.","Li Zijun was shocked suddenly, and the feeling of confusion and entanglement just now was swept away!","“The damn girl finally came out! It’s too coincidental to come out! If I had known, I wouldn’t have let those people enter the tower yet, it’s so close!”","She was excited for a while, and wanted to go up and humiliate Huang Yueli.","“Ha ha, Divine Doctor Li, you finally came out! I’ve been waiting for you for a long time!”","As she walked, she sneered and said.","Now that there were no other outsiders here, Li Zijunno longer had any scruples, so she didn’t continue with her farce any more.","But who knows, she only took a few steps forward when she felt something was wrong.","The figure that was transmitted from the silver light seems... a bit too tall?"]},{"number":3879,"title":"Chapter 3879 Beauty Without Brains (3)","paragraphs":["3879 Beauty Without Brains (3)","That Divine Doctor Li was obviously a petite and slender girl, so it was impossible to be so tall, right?","At this moment, the person who came made a suspicious voice, “Huh? Who are you? Are you looking for my Junior Sister?”","When Li Zijun heard that it was a man’s voice, her whole body froze immediately. When she took a closer look, she realised that it was Liu Buyan who came out of the silver light!","Li Zijun’s eyes widened, looking at Liu Buyan’s handsome face, she couldn’t recover for a while.","!!","Because he spent a lot of energy in the tower, Liu Buyan’s face was quite pale. He also felt dizzy and he couldn’t see things clearly.","If he hadn’t suddenly heard the word “Divine Doctor Li”, he wouldn’t have realized that there were other people in the training ground.","Liu Buyan tried his best to suppress the feeling of dizziness, squinted his eyes and looked around, and then recognized the person in front of him, “Oh, you are that... Li Zijun, right? I think I’ve seen you once before at the front hall.”","Only now did Li Zijun rouse from her stupor and couldn’t help but exclaim: “You...you are Liu Buyan!”","“Yes, it’s me.” Liu Buyan nodded slightly, still a little unclear about the situation.","But Li Zijun had already come to her senses at this time and asked in disbelief: “You, you...have you been comprehending in the tower?”","At this time, she suddenly remembered one thing, an important point that was completely ignored by everyone!","That is, Li Moying clearly brought his Sworn Brother and his Junior Sister into the training ground, but after they entered, they only saw Huang Yueli and Li Moying! Throughout the entire time, they had not seen Liu Buyan at all!","At that time, Li Zijun was overwhelmed by jealousy because she had seen Li Moying and Huang Yueli get close, and everyone subconsciously felt that Liu Buyan was just a facade they had fabricated, so they all ignored this fact. No one thought about where Liu Buyan was!","It wasn’t until now, after Li Zijun had been waiting here for nearly eleven hours, that she realized that Liu Buyan had been in the tower the entire time and he had already begun to comprehend before Li Zijun and the others entered the training ground!","At the same time, Li Zijun also discovered another thing that horrified her.","That is, Liu Buyan has been comprehending in the tower for eleven hours straight!","Thinking of this, Li Zijun’s face suddenly became extremely pale.","With such a cultivation base, staying in the tower for three hours would be considered quite a lot!","But now, Liu Buyan actually stayed in the tower for eleven hours!","If she hadn’t seen it with her own eyes, Li Zijun would never have believed it was real!","But the facts were in front of her eyes, she couldn’t help but believe it!","At the same time, Li Zijun thought of something even more terrifying.","If Liu Buyan could stay in the tower for eleven hours, then as his fellow disciple, that damn girl surnamed Li can also stay in the tower for more than ten hours?","So, that damn girl didn’t have an accident in the tower at all, but had been comprehending in it?"]},{"number":3880,"title":"Chapter 3880 Beauty Without Brains (4)","paragraphs":["3880 Beauty Without Brains (4)","Li Zijun doesn’t want to believe such a thing, but this was the most likely to happen...","Liu Buyan frowned slightly, and glanced at Li Zijun suspiciously.","He had heard of Li Zijun’s name, and knew that Li Zijun was one of Li Moying’s fiance candidate.","However, Li Zijun’s appearance on weekdays was quite calm and composed, which was different from Li Leyun who was like a stalker and a shameless woman. Therefore, Liu Buyan had a good impression of her.","!!","He had no idea that Li Zijun had made a bet with his younger Junior Sister here just now, so he was very surprised by Li Zijun’s overreaction.","“Young Miss Zijun also came here to cultivate, right? Why don’t you go in and comprehend?” Liu Buyan raised his eyebrows.","“Uh, this... I have something to do...”","“What’s the matter?” Liu Buyan became even more puzzled.","But he heard that the time to cultivate in the place of experience was very precious. Some people will not cultivate here, and they will say that they have something to do?","What’s the big deal that can’t be settled outside before coming in?","However, this was someone else’s business, Liu Buyan never meddles in other people’s business.","He didn’t say much, but after nodding to Li Zijun, he walked straight towards the Illusion Array.","Li Zijun was still in a trance from the blow, but suddenly she saw Liu Buyan enter the Illusion Array. She suddenly thought of something, and rushed to the stone tablet next to the Illusion Array.","It was an indisputable fact that Liu Buyan was able to stay in the tower for so long because of his strong mental strength.","But, what was his strength? How many points can he get in the Illusion Array?","Li Zijun still doesn’t know anything about these issues.","Now, it was a great opportunity to see Liu Buyan’s performance in the Illusion Array.","As long as she knows Liu Buyan’s level of strength, then Divine Doctor Li should be pretty much the same, right? After all, they were ‘brothers and sisters’!","In the centre of the stone tablet, there was a huge “zero” character.","Liu Buyan went in for a while before “zero” changed to “one”.","After a short while, the number changed to “two”.","Soon after, the numbers began to change in succession as it slowly increased.","Li Zijun was very nervous at first, and she didn’t even dare to blink her eyes, because someone who can stay in the tower for more than ten hours was at least a heaven-level talent, and it was also considered as a first-class talent among the ancient gods. Even some geniuses who are good at fighting can get higher scores than her, hence Li Zijun did not dare not take it lightly.","But seeing the speed at which the points were rising, Li Zijun was secretly relieved, but at the same time a little disappointed.","“Is there anything wrong? It only takes a dozen breaths to gain one point... This speed is slower than that of a turtle! What was going on with this Liu Buyan? Normally, even if it was the bottom of the heaven-level genius, by this time should score about a hundred points, but he only gained ten over points?”","While Li Zijun was thinking, another silver light flashed before her eyes.","With a “bang”, Liu Buyan’s body slammed heavily on the ground not far in front of her in a strange posture.","“Ughhhh, damn it!”","Liu Buyan groaned, supported his sprained waist, and struggled to get up from the ground.","He was sent out of the Illusion Array.","At that time, he was picked up by the sharp horns of a spirit beast and flew into the sky. In a blink of an eye, he appeared outside the Illusion Array."]},{"number":3881,"title":"Chapter 3881 Beauty Without Brains (5)","paragraphs":["3881 Beauty Without Brains (5)","He had fallen all the way from the sky and he landed in a very awkward position. He fell so badly that he almost vomited blood.","“Damn that Li Moying! Can’t he speak clearly? Hph, he’s obviously trying to trick me!”","Liu Buyan thought of Li Moying’s perfunctory attitude before, which obviously misled him, making him think that the Illusion Array was very safe.","But that’s not the case at all!","!!","Liu Buyan seriously suspected that Li Moying wanted to punish him on purpose!","With that man’s narrow-mindedness, this was very likely to happen!","When Liu Buyan got up, he suddenly felt someone staring at him.","As soon as he turned his head, he met Li Zijun’s puzzled eyes.","Liu Buyan frowned slightly, feeling puzzled in his heart, but he didn’t express it right away.","“YoungMiss Zijun, is your matter still unresolved? Why are you still here? Is there anything I can do to help you?” Liu Buyan said calmly with a warm smile on his face.","With this smile, even a girl with a heart like Li Zijun couldn’t help but look at him more.","“Ah, it’s all right, I’m just... just seeing you entering the Illusion Array, I was a little curious... cough, I’m really sorry...”","Originally, Li Zijun was also very dissatisfied with Liu Buyan, thinking that he deliberately brought his Junior Sister to climb into a high position and that he was not a good person.","However, when facing Liu Buyan in person, she couldn’t express the sarcasm she was holding back.","After all, Liu Buyan seems to have a good temper, polite, and personable. From the appearance alone, he was no worse than the genius cultivators of the Ancient God Clan.","At this time, Li Zijun’s thoughts were that that damn girl surnamed Li was really shameless and dissatisfied!","Already having a handsome Senior Brother like Liu Buyan, but a toad wants to eat swan meat, so she still craved for her Young Master! It’s just skittish!","Liu Buyan glanced at Li Zijun. For some reason, he always felt that Li Zijun’s behavior was weird.","At this time, he found words on the stone tablet beside Li Zijun, “Young Miss Zijun, what are you looking at?”","Li Zijun was a little embarrassed, “I’m just looking casually, just looking casually...”","Although everyone who enters the illusory figure formation knows that the points they get inside will be seen by people outside, it was still a bit embarrassing to be caught face to face.","However, Liu Buyan walked up to her, took a casual glance, and understood, his face turned dark immediately.","This, this, this... was really embarrassing!","When he entered the illusory figure formation just now, he was completely unprepared. In addition, the spirit beasts in the God Realm had different attack methods from the monsters in the Lower Realm. Liu Buyan was caught off guard and was full of flaws. After killing several lowest-level spirit beasts, he was teleported out.","During the whole process, he didn’t even use the fighting skills he learned in the tower.","It’s really... appalling, extremely embarrassing.","Of course, after the teleportation, he thought about it a little bit, and felt that he would be so miserable mainly because of his inexperience. After he arrived in the God Realm, he had not experienced any battles at all. Mistakes are also normal.","The next attempt will definitely make great progress."]},{"number":3882,"title":"Chapter 3882 Beauty Without Brains (6)","paragraphs":["3882 Beauty Without Brains (6)","After figuring this out, Liu Buyan didn’t feel at ease about his embarrassment just now.","However, now he suddenly discovered that his points were not only known to him, but will be displayed on the stone tablet!","It was also seen by the cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","This time, it was very embarrassing...","!!","He coughed twice, “Young Miss Zijun laughed, I’m not very good at fighting.”","Li Zijun smiled, and comforted him with empathy, “Don’t worry about Divine Doctor Liu, the Illusion Array of our Cloudy Qilin Clan is famous in the entire God Realm, and most geniuses of our clan can’t get a high score, not to mention you are a Spirit Medicine Master. Thinking about it, there must be very few Spirit Medicine Masters with your strength.”","Liu Buyan laughed dryly twice, and brought up the topic.","For some reason, he always felt that Li Zijun’s words were a little weird.","Although the meaning in her words was to comfort him, it still revealed her contempt for the Spirit Medicine Master.","Ordinary cultivators are very friendly to Spirit Medicine Masters, Li Zijun was rare.","Liu Buyan was a little suspicious. After thinking about it, he should keep a distance from Li Zijun, so he kept away from her on the pretext of wanting to cultivate by himself.","Before leaving, he purposely walked around behind the stone tablet and glanced at the overall ranking of the Illusion Array points.","The corners of Liu Buyan’s mouth couldn’t help twitching when he saw the huge words “Li Moying” at the top of the list and the almost innumerable points behind it.","“This kid... really deserves to be a god-level genius! There is no one who is so strong!”","Liu Buyan found a corner and sat down cross-legged.","After experiencing the hustle and bustle in the Illusion Array just now, he has gained a lot of insights, and he also realised that there was still a lot to think about in order to truly apply the combat skills learned in the tower to actual combat.","Therefore, he did not rashly enter the Illusion Array again, but chose to cultivate for a while first.","Not knowinghow long it took, Liu Buyan finally sorted out the combat secrets in his mind and after he felt a little more confident, he opened his eyes and stood up again.","As soon as he moved, he noticed that Li Zijun’s gaze gravitated towards him.","Liu Buyan frowned slightly, and the doubts in his heart deepened... Li Zijun was still in the open space, what exactly did she want to do?","Liu Buyan didn’t talk to her again, and walked straight to the Illusion Array.","This time, he still didn’t last long. After earning more than 30 points, he was bitten by a spirit beast by the neck, making a glorious sacrifice!","“Damn, this is too difficult! Come again!”","This time Liu Buyan fell out in an even more embarrassing posture, directly breaking three of his ribs, but luckily he was a Spirit Medicine Master himself, and this kind of common physical trauma was nothing to him at all. After a few pills, it will be alive and well.","Successive failures also aroused his fighting spirit, making him more and more courageous, defeating and fighting repeatedly.","Liu Buyan entered the Illusion Array five times in a row, and his score was higher each time, but he still couldn’t exceed 100 points.","As a last resort, he could only sit down on the edge of the Illusion Array again, “This is not going to work, I must have done something wrong...”","Liu Buyan closed his eyes and started to think again.","This Liu Buyan’s point increase speed was too fast!","If she hadn’t seen it with her own eyes, she would have thought that she was dreaming!"]},{"number":3883,"title":"Chapter 3883 Beauty Without Brains (7)","paragraphs":["3883 Beauty Without Brains (7)","When Liu Buyan first entered the Illusion Array, his score could be described as horrible.","Li Zijun originally thought that he could comprehend for eleven hours in the tower, and thought he was some kind of hidden heavenly genius.","But it turned out that Liu Buyan only scored more than ten points!","It wasted her expectations for Liu Buyan’s performance that she had of him at the beginning.","!!","In the end, he was nothing more than an embroidered pillow. He looked very powerful, but his actual combat ability was frighteningly low!","However, just when Li Zijun had already looked down upon Liu Buyan, she was surprised by Liu Buyan’s performance!","Liu Buyan entered the Illusion Array five times, and his score continued to increase. In less than an hour, his score increased by six times!","Although until now, his highest score was only 96 points, which was not even a fracton of Li Moying’s, but the speed of this improvement was enough to be described as amazing!","Li Zijun has never heard of anyone who can improve so much in an hour!","She couldn’t help thinking, if Liu Buyan spent a few more hours, could it be improved several times? Doubling like this, it won’t be long before he could surpass her.","However, what Li Zijun was worried about did not happen.","After Liu Buyan reached 96 points, as if he had realised something, he sat cross-legged on the ground again, closed his eyes and thought silently.","It took him a long time to think this time, and he didn’t move for more than two hours.","Li Zijun originally glanced at him from time to time, but later, seeing that he was not moving, she gradually ignored him and turned his attention to Huang Yueli again.","The gate of that tower was still closed...","Why hasn’t the damn girl come out yet?","At this moment, two more silver lights flashed.","Li Zijun looked over excitedly, but in the end, she was disappointed again...","“Why is it you?”","What came out were Li Zijun’s followers.","Seeing that there was still only Li Zijun in the open space, and there was no sign of Huang Yueli, the two of them panicked for a while, and their words became cautious.","“We are running out of time, we can only comprehend here first.”","“Uh...Young Miss Zijun, hasn’t Divine Doctor Li come out yet? Have you been waiting here all this time?”","Li Zijun looked at the time, and found that another three hours had passed, and immediately became angry.","No matter how she thought about it, she couldn’t understand why that damn girl could persist for so long!","“Hmph, only Heaven knows what’s going on with that surnamed Li? Could it be that she’s afraid of competing with us, so she hid in the tower and dared not come out?”","Hearing this, the attendant couldn’t help being full of doubts, “Young Miss Zijun, Divine Doctor Li hasn’t come out for so long, so something really happened, right? Should we inform the elders of the clan, we can’t cause any one’s death!”","Li Zijun sneered, “No, I don’t think anything will happen to her! You don’t know something, just when you were in the tower, Liu Buyan came out of the tower, and he has been comprehending for eleven hours in a row. Nothing happened. It seems that these Spirit Medicine Masters are really strong mentally, and it should be normal for his Junior Sister to persist for a few more hours.”","“What? Doctor Liu can stay in the tower for eleven hours?”","“Could it be that Divine Doctor Liu is actually a heaven-level genius? If that’s the case, then Divine Doctor Li could also...”"]},{"number":3884,"title":"Chapter 3884 Beauty Without Brains (8)","paragraphs":["3884 Beauty Without Brains (8)","One follower almost blurted out!","Halfway through the speech, she realized that she had said the wrong thing, so she shut her mouth hastily, and looked at Li Zijun with some trepidation.","Li Zijun said angrily: “What are you guessing? Strong mental power does not equate to strong strength! Just now, Liu Buyan has tried several times in the Illusion Array, and his points have never exceeded 100 points. Hmph! What kind of genius is this? It’s clearly an embroidered pillow, which looks good but it’s just stuffed with straw! She’s just a beauty with no brains!”","Although Liu Buyan’s speed of progress surprised her, but after she calmed down and thought about it, Li Zijun felt that she must have thought too much.","!!","When the points are low, a slight increase could inherently double the points, but that’s because the base itself was very low.","It’s going to be very difficult if one really wants to double the score after it’s over 100 points.","Therefore, Liu Buyan’s performance today could only be said to be a special case. In the final analysis, it was because his score was too low!","If Huang Yueli’s strength was similar to his, then there was nothing to worry about.","When the followers heard Li Zijun’s remarks, they immediately felt relieved, and none of them thought too much about it.","After all, Liu Buyan was a Spirit Medicine Master. Martial Cultivators like them claim to be superior in strength, and they don’t think there was any Spirit Medicine Master that could be stronger than them.","“I see. No wonder that Divine Doctor Li has been able to stay in the tower for so long!”","“Speaking of which, she should indeed be a talented Spirit Medicine Master. It’s said that Spirit Medicine Masters with high spiritual power will also have high attainments in the future.”","“Even if she is a Divine Doctor, so what? Can she compare with our Young Master? Her background, talent, status, which one was worthy of the Young Master? She was still not qualified to be the Young Madame of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!”","“That’s right, she bewitched the Young Master with her beauty, and let the Young Master disregard the rules of our clan for her sake. She’s a vixen at all! Young Miss Zijun, you must not let her go!”","The two were originally Li Zijun’s followers, so they naturally stood firmly on Li Zijun’s side and demoted Huang Yueli to nothing.","Only then did Li Zijun feel a little better, and a sneer appeared on the corner of his mouth, “Don’t worry, Divine Doctor Li herself agreed to this competition, and I didn’t force her to do so. Even if she loses the competition, she can only lose face. If anything, she has only herself to blame! Even the Young Master has nothing to say! However, we didn’t expect her to stay in the tower for so long, it was a mistake...”","She paused, then looked at the two followers, “Aren’t you going to be sent out soon? After you go back, see which geniuses in the clan have not used up their training time, and ask them to apply to cultivate. Especially those that rank lower...”","What’s more, more people were needed to watch, so that the shame of that damn girl would be more thorough, and more people can help her go out to publicize, so that the entire Cloudy Qilin Clan can know that under the dignified appearance of Divine Doctor Li, what was going on? What kind of a vicious woman who was shameless and obsessed with the Young Master!","The two followers understood and nodded repeatedly, “Yes, we promise to complete the task!”","They didn’t have much time left, so they were sent away very quickly.","Li Zijun sneered, and when she turned around, he saw Liu Buyan in the corner, who opened his eyes at some point and stared straight at her.","“You...” Li Zijun was taken aback."]},{"number":3885,"title":"Chapter 3885 He Can Also Say Sweet Words?(1)","paragraphs":["3885 He Can Also Say Sweet Words?(1)","A trace of coldness flashed across Liu Buyan’s usually gentle face.","“It turns out that you have never entered the tower to cultivate, but you just want to plot against my Junior Sister...Young Miss Zijun, you are a dignified daughter of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Don’t you think you think highly of us too much?”","Li Zijun had already forgotten that Liu Buyan was still by her side just now and she suddenly exposed the truth, she felt a little embarrassed for a while.","However, she quickly calmed down.","!!","So what if Liu Buyan knew about it?","To put it bluntly, he was just a Spirit Medicine Master, a cultivator with less than 100 Illusion Array points, what could he do to her?","Li Zijun stopped pretending, and said directly with a cold face: “Divine Doctor Liu, please be careful with what you say. Why do I have to plot against your Junior Sister? But you two, you can be said to be far-sighted! You can even think of it, in the name of the Young Master’s medical consultation, you two entered the Amethyst Paramount Palace, and on the pretext that the Young Master needs to rest, dismissed all of us from the clan. In fact, it was to let Young Miss Li have a chance to get close to the Young Master, right?”","She stared at Liu Buyan, her eyes were full of disdain, “I have to say, you two brothers and sisters are really good at it! In the past two years, there have been so many women who want to climb up to the Young Master, and only your trick is the best! It works, judging by the Young Master’s attitude towards Divine Doctor Li, she can’t escape the position of a concubine in the future! I should congratulate you all!”","Liu Buyan was taken aback when he heard her expose the relationship between Huang Yueli and Li Moying in a few words.","Although he had long thought that his Junior Sister and her husband would show their affection every day, and they would be exposed sooner or later, but after he entered the tower once, Li Zijun saw through the relationship between the two, isn’t it too fast? Too sudden?","However, after hearing Li Zijun’s words, he became more impolite, and he was not so good-tempered, so he sneered.","“Young Miss Zijun’s words are really interesting! In the name of seeing a doctor, I gave my Junior Sister to your Young Master? I don’t know how thick-skinned one can be to say such a thing! What happened to your Young Master at that time? It wasn’t for me and my Junior Sister, he might be dead now! If your Patriarch hadn’t begged me to save someone, I wouldn’t be happy to come to Amethyst Paramount Palace! Now that someone has been saved, you just forget about the situation at that time, right?”","Liu Buyan smiled coldly and said bluntly.","This time he came to Amethyst Paramount Palace, he has learned a lot.","When he was in the lower realm before, he had heard how crazy the women who stuck to Li Moying were, but he had never seen it with his own eyes.","This time, after seeing it for himself, he realised that the rumours were not exaggerated at all.","Whether it’s Li Leyun or Li Zijun, they were both talented and beautiful ladies of the Ancient God Clan, but they could say such confusing words to slander his Junior Sister!","Liu Buyan was not an easy-going person either, as soon as he opened his mouth, he poked Li Zijun’s sore spots with every sentence.","Sure enough, Li Zijun’s face turned pale little by little, her eyes widened and she shook her head, “Impossible, how could the Young Master pester that little girl and talk sweetly?”"]},{"number":3886,"title":"Chapter 3886 He Can Also Say Sweet Words?(2)","paragraphs":["3886 He Can Also Say Sweet Words?(2)","“You...you stop talking nonsense there!”","Li Zijun did not believe such a thing would happen.","She couldn’t be more clear about Li Moying’s attitude towards those women who admired him.","Whether it’s the talented girl in the clan, or the proud daughter of other Ancient God Clans who admire him, Li Moying has never looked directly at any of them.","!!","Some bold and ignorant women would even take the initiative to show favour to Li Moying, but what they got in return was nothing but complete ignorance.","Even those who dared to seduce Li Moying directly were beaten mercilessly by him.","Li Zijun even suspected that in Li Moying’s eyes, these delicate and beautiful girls were not as attractive as a book of martial arts secrets.","Therefore, she has always felt that even if Li Moying gets married in the future, he will only marry the woman he thinks was the most suitable to be a young wife, and they would only treat each other with respect.","However, Li Zijun didn’t think there was anything wrong with this.","With a husband like Li Moying, she will definitely become the envy of all the women in the God Realm. Even if Li Moying’s talent, strength, identity, and status are not mentioned, just looking at his flawless handsome face every day makes her feel like a young girl. She was willing to do anything!","But now...","Liu Buyna had actually said that Li Moying stalked his Junior Sister, and even coaxed her with sweet words?","Li Zijun’s first reaction was that Liu Buyan was lying!","Even if she was beaten to death, she couldn’t even imagine Li Moying would ever sweet talk.","Liu Buyan sneered, “I’m talking nonsense? I’d rather be talking nonsense! A man like Li Moying who attracts others is not reliable at all, and he’s not suitable for my Junior Sister at all! Do you think that we would be proud about this? Hmph! He’s too insidious and cunning, not only can coax people, but also give things away. In order to please my Junior Sister, he even brought her here to cultivate. I admire him for being so good at coaxing girls!”","Liu Buyan vented all the grievances of being robbed of love by Li Moying at once. When he despised Li Moying, he was very sincere.","Back then, when he was in Soaring Heavens Continent, he was the one who fell in love with Huang Yueli before Li Moying. In the end, because Li Moying was so shameless, in the end he came from behind and snatched her away!","Even if he was just thinking about those things back then, he was still very angry!","“Impossible! This is absolutely impossible!”","Li Zijun gnashed her teeth! A raging fire of jealousy ignited in her heart!","She couldn’t accept it!","According to Liu Buyan, did Li Moying give that little girl something? And took the initiative to bring her to cultivate? How can that be?","However, looking at the expression on Liu Buyan’s face, it really doesn’t seem like he was telling a lie.","The scene she saw when she entered the place of training emerged in Li Zijun’s mind. At that time, when Li Moying embraced Huang Yueli, the expression on his face was indeed very gentle...","It’s just that Li Zijun has been hypnotising herself, it’s all because of her delusional vision!","“You...don’t think that you can fool me by making up these things. I know the character of the Young Master much better than you! What you said is absolutely impossible! I remind you kindly, please don’t do it again in the future. If such nonsense reaches the Young Master’s ears, your Junior Sister will fall out of favour immediately!”"]},{"number":3887,"title":"Chapter 3887 He Can Also Say Sweet Words?(3)","paragraphs":["3887 He Can Also Say Sweet Words?(3)","Seeing that Li Zijun was still in self denial, Liu Buyan curled his lips in disdain, and didn’t continue talking.","Anyway, after Li Moying and Huang Yueli come out, Li Zijun will know how wrong she was!","The two of them could blind others with their show anytime and anywhere, and even Liu Buyan himself couldn’t stand it. He sincerely hoped that Li Zijun would be able to withstand such a heavy blow by then.","However, seeing that he was silent, Li Zijun misunderstood what he meant.","!!","She couldn’t help laughing, “It seems that Divine Doctor Liu also knows the seriousness of the matter? There was one more thing I want to tell you. The Young Master knows about the bet between your Junior Sister and I. The bet was made under his witness. If the Young Master really dotes on your Junior Sister as you said, so why didn’t he stand up for her? How could he let her lose such a big bet?”","This was also the biggest evidence for Li Zijun to believe that Li Moying doesn’t care about Huang Yueli.","Whenever Li Zijun’s heart wavered, as long as she thought of Li Moying watching her bet with Huang Yueli and did not stop her, she felt that Li Moying was nothing more than Huang Yueli! Just treat her as a temporary plaything.","When Liu Buyan heard this, his eyebrows raised exaggeratedly.","“So, do you really want to bet with my Junior Sister? What are you betting on? Who has lasted longer in the Illusion Array or who has more points?”","“That’s right!” Li Zijun raised her chin arrogantly, “Of course it’s true! Even the Young Master agrees with us to bet, and this cannot be changed! You’d better pray that your Junior Sister’s fighting power is stronger than yours, otherwise If not, then she will not only shame herself but she will also implicate our Young Master!”","Liu Buyan gave Li Zijun a sympathetic look.","This woman was still complacent here, and she didn’t know that she was tricked by that black-bellied little couple!","Still trying to embarrass his Junior Sister?","In the end, it would definitely be Li Zijun who would be crying miserably!","If Li Zijun knew that the one she dared to challenge was a god-level genius comparable to Li Moying, would she cry in fright on the spot?","Forget it, let’s save some face for her. After all, her good days were numbered...","He pursed his lips, “Since Li Moying has agreed, there is nothing I can do.”","Liu did not say anything, shrugged his shoulders, “Alright, I’m going back to the tower to study, you can continue to wait here! Maybe my Junior Sister will come out soon.”","With Huang Yueli’s strength, even if she stayed in the tower for a month, there would be no problem.","I really hope that Li Zijun can wait until the moment when Huang Yueli shows up...","Otherwise, how could he have a good show to watch?","Liu Buyan’s words before leaving made Li Zijun feel a little uneasy.","Because, the other party’s reaction was far from what she expected, right?","Hearing that Huang Yueli was going to compete with the cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, this Senior Brother didn’t panic at all, so he went to the tower by himself?","This did not necessarily mean that damn girl really has some strength, right?","“Damn it, this Divine Doctor Liu is too insidious. Nothing he said was true. I must not be influenced by his words!”","Li Zijun shook her head vigorously, shook off the distracting thoughts in her mind, forced herself to calm down and continued to wait for Huang Yueli to appear."]},{"number":3888,"title":"Chapter 3888 He Can Also Say Sweet Words?(4)","paragraphs":["3888 He Can Also Say Sweet Words?(4)","She waited and waited, time passed by.","In the end, Li Zijun was completely numb, and she was in no mood to count how long she had been waiting.","The only thought in her mind was, what happened to that damn girl? Why hasn’t she come out yet!","Up to this point, the reason that Li Zijun was still standing here was that she was holding on to the only belief was to watch Huang Yueli come out, and then defeat her immediately!","!!","During this period, Li Zijun’s followers ran out of time and were teleported out. The followers called new followers, but the new followers didn’t have enough time, so they were sent out soon.","Batch after batch of followers came and went.","Although Li Zijun had strictly ordered not to let this matter get out, but, to some extent, the news still leaked out.","Many young cultivators knew that Li Moying brought Divine Doctor Li to the place of training, but she has not come out after spending dozens of hours in the tower!","This was simply a miracle!","So far, except for Li Moying, no one has been able to stay in the tower for more than 20 hours at a time.","Could it be that this Divine Doctor Li was really a martial arts genius?","Out of curiosity, many cultivators who were obviously not Li Zijun’s people still applied for training places spontaneously, and came to the training place, wanting to see Huang Yueli’s strength on the spot.","It’s a pity that most of these people also rushed for nothing. After waiting for a long time, they didn’t see Huang Yueli appear.","At this point, Li Zijun finally understood that this whole matter was beyond her control, and there was no way for it to end well.","At this moment, Huang Yueli’s combat effectiveness was actually not the most important thing.","The more pressing issue was that her 60 hours of cultivation time was almost exhausted, but Huang Yueli hasn’t come out yet!","For a full sixty hours...","This was the cultivation time that can only be obtained by the clan’s number one genius. It was extremely precious. As a result, she wasted it all waiting for Huang Yueli to come out!","Moreover, her time was running out, yet Huang Yueli hasn’t shown up yet...","If she waits any longer, she won’t even have a chance to compete with Huang Yueli, and she will be sent out!","If this was the case, she would really become a joke of the entire Cloudy Qilin Clan!","“Damn it! That damn girl must have done it on purpose! She knows that once she enters the Illusion Array, she will definitely lose to me, so relying on her strong mental strength, she deliberately delays time in the tower, just to delay the time! This move is really too insidious and shameless!”","Facing the questioning gazes of the cultivators who came in to watch, Li Zijun blushed, and quickly found an excuse for herself to pour dirty water on Huang Yueli.","However, as soon as she finished speaking, a silver light flashed not far in front of her.","Immediately afterwards, Huang Yueli’s figure appeared in the silver light.","She waited for such a long time, thinking that Huang Yueli would not come out, but who knew, in the last half an hour, that little girl actually came out!","She thought it was her hallucination!","The other cultivators were very excited and hurriedly surrounded them.","“Divine Doctor Li, you finally came out! You... Did you know that you actually stayed in the tower for nearly sixty hours?!”"]},{"number":3889,"title":"Chapter 3889 Really Stupid (1)","paragraphs":["3889 Really Stupid (1)","“Divine Doctor Li, how do you feel now?”","“Divine Doctor Li, have you really made a bet with Young Miss Zijun? When are you going to enter the Illusion Array?”","The cultivators present were all extremely curious about Huang Yueli.","It was an unheard of miracle that a Spirit Medicine Master dared to bet with the most outstanding genius of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and persisted in the tower for so long!","!!","Huang Yueli did not expect that there were so many people waiting for her to come out at the door, and she was shocked.","She thought that at most there was only Li Zijun at the door, and maybe Li Zijun couldn’t wait any longer and went to cultivate a long time ago.","She blinked her eyes. Just as she came back to her senses, before she had time to speak, she saw another silver light flash in front of her eyes.","Li Moying also came out.","“Young...Young Master! It’s the Young Master who has come out!”","Seeing Li Moying, the cultivators were obviously more excited. Most of the people’s attention was attracted by Li Moying. For a while, they couldn’t care less about chasing after Huang Yueli.","However, Li Moying has always been aloof and dignified, and no one dared to get too close, and could only look up at him with adoring eyes.","Li Moying’s expression was very calm, even though he saw so many people, he didn’t show the slightest surprise.","His eyes fell on Huang Yueli, the coldness in his eyes suddenly disappeared, and his eyes became extremely gentle, “Little Li’er, you are so punctual, you actually came out before me.”","Huang Yueli raised the corners of her mouth, showing a sweet smile, “I just came out too, we made an appointment to cultivate for five days, I don’t want you to waste time waiting for me.”","She was originally very beautiful, but she seemed a little cold on weekdays.","Now, facing Li Moying, she rarely showed a girlish shyness on her face, which made her look more pure and pleasant.","Many cultivators present stared at her dumbfounded.","It wasn’t until Li Moying glanced over them with hidden displeasure that everyone shivered and hurriedly lowered their heads.","Li Moying withdrew her gaze, and focused on his Little Fox again, “It’s nothing. When you go in for comprehension in the future, you don’t have to think about me. I’m willing to wait for you so take as long as you want.”","When Huang Yueli heard this, she couldn’t help laughing.","However, being able to hear her husband’s sweet talk still made her very happy.","But Li Zijun, who witnessed the interaction between the two, was completely stunned in place as if struck by lightning.","Her eyeballs were about to fall out, she stared at Huang Yueli and Li Moying, she couldn’t believe her eyes!","When Li Moying spoke to Huang Yueli, he was actually so gentle! Moreover, “I am willing to wait for you”, although it was not some nasty love words, but it was shocking enough to say it from a man as arrogant and cold as Li Moying!","What’s more, Li Moying’s expression was so gentle!","Liu Buyan said that Li Moying coaxed his Junior Sister all day long, but now it seems that it was not a lie!","Besides, what shocked Li Zijun even more was the dialogue between the two.","Judging from what Huang Yueli said just now, they had already made an appointment to cultivate in the tower for five days, so it was not accidental that the little girl came out of the tower now, Li Moying came out almost at the same time as her!","The two clearly have made an appointment!"]},{"number":3890,"title":"Chapter 3890 Really Stupid (2)","paragraphs":["3890 Really Stupid (2)","And she didn’t know, she was still waiting for them at the door for five days!","Not only wasted the precious sixty hours of cultivation time this month on waiting for others, but also lost the cultivation time of the next month as well as the following month!","Thinking of this, Li Zijun almost fainted on the spot!","At this moment, she really felt that she was a big fool. She was obviously played by them!","!!","The damn girl clearly made an appointment with the Young Master for five days, but she didn’t tell her. She made it clear that she wanted to cheat her.","After Li Zijun understood, the more she thought about it, the more angry she became. She gritted her teeth and strode towards the crowd.","“Divine Doctor Li, you finally came out! You stayed in the tower for so long, I thought something happened to you, and I was so worried to death! Now that you have come out safely, I am relieved! In fact, if you don’t want to bet with me, just tell me straight up, I won’t force you. Why do you have to be like this... Sigh! Fortunately, you are fine, otherwise I would have committed a heinous crime!”","Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s eyes were constantly intertwined. After five days of not seeing each other, she found that her husband seemed to have become more handsome again.","I can only look at it now.","Moreover, even if you look at it, you will be disturbed.","Hearing Li Zijun’s voice, Huang Yueli frowned and turned around, “Young Miss Zijun, how do you know that I haven’t come out from the tower? You wouldn’t have been waiting here all this while for me, right?”","Hearing this, Li Zijun froze.","She originally wanted to be the one who mentioned this first, but in order to avoid being the laughing stock of everyone, she wanted to preemptively insist that Huang Yue couldn’t leave because she was afraid of betting with her.","But who would have thought that Huang Yueli didn’t pick up on her fault at all. Instead, when she opened her mouth, she hit her deadly spot.","She had been waiting here for Huang Yueli to come out!","She’s been waiting here for sixty hours like a fool!","Some cultivators around couldn’t help laughing, and the laughter reached Li Zijun’s ears, making her face even more livid.","She took a deep breath, suppressed her embarrassment, gritted her teeth, and said, “I... am I worried about you? After all, it’s your first time entering the tower to study enlightenment. I’m really afraid that something might happen to you. The Li clan can’t explain it to others! You are the first foreigner to enter the place of experience in nearly ten thousand years...”","Li Zijun emphasised the pronunciation of the word “foreigner”, and then sneaked a glance at Li Moying.","“However, now it seems that I was worrying too much. I didn’t expect that Divine Doctor Li had already made an appointment with the Young Master, and the Young Master was willing to wait for you... This is something that any member of our Cloudy Qilin Clan has to do.”","Li Zijun specially emphasised this sentence to remind everyone that the relationship between Huang Yueli and Li Moying was extraordinary.","Her words were really effective.","Many cultivators already felt that something was wrong when they saw the intimate interaction between Huang Yueli and Li Moying. However, because Li Moying’s image of being cold and ruthless and unfeminine was too deeply rooted in the hearts of the people, many people did not regard the two People think in ambiguous directions.","But now, after Li Zijun’s “unintentional” reminder, everyone looked at Huang Yueli in a wrong way.","Yes, in retrospect, what the Young Master said just now was really problematic!","What kind of identity was he? How can he be willing to wait for a little doctor to cultivate?"]},{"number":3891,"title":"Chapter 3891 Really Stupid (3)","paragraphs":["3891 Really Stupid (3)","For a while, everyone was puzzled and couldn’t help discussing in hushed tones.","“This is really a bit strange, the Young Master treats Divine Doctor Li...wouldn’t it be a little too nice?”","“What’s so strange about this? I heard that the Young Master and Divine Doctor Li are... ahem, in that kind of relationship!”","“What kind of relationship? Don’t talk nonsense! The Young Master is devoted to cultivation and is not interested in women at all!”","“I think the Young Master is just grateful for the life-saving grace of Divine Doctor Li, so he just spoke a little softer to her. Isn’t that really a big deal?”","!!","Everyone whispered to each other. Although they couldn’t help but want to gossip, most of them still didn’t believe that Li Moying would be with Huang Yueli.","Seeing this, Li Zijun quickly added another sentence, “Alright, now that Divine Doctor Li has completed her comprehension, when can we enter the Illusion Array competition? We have agreed before, you can’t go back on your word! If you want to be together with Young Master, if you don’t show some real skills, none of our Cloudy Qilin Clan will be convinced!”","What Li Zijun said was even more ambiguous.","The cultivators who originally believed that Li Moying and Huang Yueli had nothing to do with each other widened their eyes, thinking that they had heard wrong.","However, Li Zijun had a calm expression on her face, and it didn’t look like she accidentally said something wrong.","Everyone turned their attention to Li Moying again.","Li Moying’s high-cold expression as always, and the fleeting tenderness when facing Huang Yueli just now, have disappeared without a trace.","He glanced at everyone coldly, which made people feel chills and dared not look directly at them.","There was no other way, everyone could only look at Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli had a smile on her face, but she didn’t have any intention of explaining.","She nodded towards Li Zijun, “Young Miss Zijun is really impatient. Well, let’s compete now!”","Hearing this, Li Zijun was stunned for a moment, “What did you say? Compete now?”","“That’s right, didn’t you say you wanted to compare with me?”","Li Zijun looked at Huang Yueli in disbelief.","What’s the situation? Why didn’t the damn girl play her cards according to the routine?","She clearly knew that she was going to lose, so the damn girl should refuse to admit it or try her best to delay it, right? Why did she agree so readily?","Could it be that she really has a winning card in her hand?","That’s right, it’s the first time for this pair of Senior Brother and Junior Sister to enter the training ground, and they don’t know how difficult the Illusion Array is! That damn girl must have thought that she would get a high score after nearly sixty hours of comprehension, so she was so confident!","When she enters the Illusion Array, she will know how powerful she was!","It is estimated that her score is not much different from Liu Buyan’s first time entering the Illusion Array!","A sneer curled up at the corner of Li Zijun’s mouth, but she concealed it without any trace, “Alright, then let’s start now. Divine Doctor Li, this way please!”","She can’t wait to see this damn girl shamed!","She had been waiting for nearly sixty hours, and this moment was what she was waiting for!","However, Li Zijun waited for a long time, but did not see Huang Yueli move.","She frowned and urged: “Divine Doctor Li? Didn’t you mean to enter the illusory figure formation competition? Why don’t you go in?”","Only then did Huang Yueli look at her, “Shouldn’t you be the first? According to the rules of the God Realm, since it’s you who proposed this method of competition, you should go first.”"]},{"number":3892,"title":"Chapter 3892 Really Stupid (4)","paragraphs":["3892 Really Stupid (4)","It was only then that Li Zijun remembered that there seemed to be such an unspoken rule.","The person who sets the rules must start first, giving the other party more time to prepare.","It’s just that within the Cloudy Qilin Clan, it’s customary to use Illusion Array points to bet, so it doesn’t matter who sets the competition rules.","According to the habits of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, the party with a lower status or weaker strength in the clan must end first to show respect for the party with a higher status.","Huang Yueli suddenly threw out such a sentence, Li Zijun couldn’t refute it for a while.","However, she was unwilling to let her enter the Illusion Array first as Huang Yueli said.","Those who knew said that she was the first to end the competition with foreigners, but those who didn’t know thought that she thought her status was lower than Huang Yueli’s!","Li Zijun was extremely jealous of Huang Yueli for attracting Li Moying’s attention, so naturally he didn’t want to appear to be inferior to Huang Yueli.","However, she has no reason to reject Huang Yueli...","Just when she was struggling, her gaze swept over the several followers standing on the right, and her eyes couldn’t help but brighten.","“Alright, I can advance to the Illusion Array here! We also agreed earlier that all cultivators can participate in the bet as long as they want to. Therefore, there are several clansmen here who want to try it out. Wait a minute, they will all enter the Illusion Array. But don’t worry, as long as your points can surpass any one of them, you will win!”","As Li Zijun spoke, she gestured to her followers with her eyes.","The followers understood, and soon, the one with the weakest strength stood up, cupped his hands at Huang Yueli and said, “Divine Doctor Li, then I’ll make a fool of myself first!”","Huang Yueli glanced at Li Zijun with a half-smile.","Those bright and clear big eyes looked extremely beautiful, but for some reason, when Li Zijun made eye contact with her, she felt his heart sink.","Fortunately, Huang Yueli didn’t say much, but nodded her head in agreement.","Follower No. 1 glanced at Li Zijun, turned around and entered the Illusion Array.","The cultivators onlookers began to discuss in low voices, asking about the name and strength of the No. 1 servant.","After learning that he was ranked more than 270 in the clan and it was the first time he entered the training ground, everyone lost interest in him.","This kind of strength was at the bottom of the crowd, and he definitely won’t get too many points.","Li Zijun was obviously not satisfied with the score, so he immediately sent his servant No. 2 in.","Follower No. 2 was a relatively high-ranking young genius in the clan, and he has also been to the place of experience several times to study.","His score rose rapidly, exceeding three digits soon, and didn’t stop until it reached two hundred and fifty.","Seeing the score, Li Zijun nodded slightly.","More than 200 points, among the current young geniuses of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, they can also be ranked in the top 100. At least one must fully master the contents of the lowest-level combat secret method.","The last time this Follower No. 2 entered the training ground, he could only get a little over 100 points. This time, he directly doubled the points, and the entry was still very fast.","Li Zijun couldn’t help but glance at Huang Yueli proudly, “How was it? Do you know what this score means?”","Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes and nodded, “Well, I know a little...”","Li Zijun was overjoyed, before she could be proud, he heard Huang Yueli continue: “Two hundred and five...”"]},{"number":3893,"title":"Chapter 3893 Really Stupid (5)","paragraphs":["3893 Really Stupid (5)","Hearing this, Li Zijun didn’t react at first, and was still smiling triumphantly, thinking that Huang Yueli was finally shocked by this astonishing number!","Li Zijun raised her chin high and glanced at Huang Yueli, but found that the expression on Huang Yueli’s face was somewhat meaningful.","It wasn’t until this moment that she suddenly realised that there was something wrong with the way the cultivators around her looked at her.","Before Li Zijun could figure it out, suddenly, a man’s voice came from behind her.","“What two hundred and five? Junior Sister, who are you talking about that’s two hundred and five[1]?”","Just as Liu Buyan teleported out of the tower, he heard Huang Yueli calling “two hundred and five” over there. He immediately walked over and asked questions in confusion.","Everyone’s attention was on Huang Yueli and Li Zijun. The followers didn’t realise when Liu Buyan came out, and they were surprised when they heard the voice.","Huang Yueli did not show any surprise. She smiled, glanced at the front of the stone tablet, and said slowly, “Whose score was on the stone tablet, don’t you know...”","Liu Buyan followed her gaze and couldn’t help but burst out laughing.","“Hahaha, it’s really two hundred and five! It’s so funny! Who the hell is this, and how talented is he?”","What Li Zijun didn’t understand at this time, she finally realised that she was being tricked by Huang Yueli again!","Her face turned livid, and she glared at Huang Yueli viciously, “Divine Doctor Li, what do you mean? I told you about the bet, but you refused to take it seriously, and it doesn’t matter if you make all kinds of pushbacks, and now you’re still saying this to deliberately slander my clansmen? Do you think that with the protection of the Young Master, you can ignore the clansmen of the Cloudy Qilin Clan?”","Li Zijun pointed to the Follower No. 2 just now, “You have to figure it out! This was also the top 200 genius cultivators of our Cloudy Qilin Clan! Even if you are a first-rate genius in the entire God Realm, even if you have a relationship with the Young Master You can’t insult him like this!”","Follower No. 2’s expression became even uglier.","Just now he got his highest score ever in the Illusion Array, and he was feeling proud when he was hit by Huang Yueli’s “two hundred and five”.","This was not over yet.","Li Zijun’s deliberate emphasis seems to be seeking justice for the second follower and helping him condemn Huang Yueli, but in fact it was adding fuel to the fire.","Hearing these words in the ears of Follower No. 2 made him feel aggrieved to the extreme, and his gaze towards Huang Yueli became extraordinarily fierce.","If Li Moying hadn’t been worried about standing behind Huang Yueli, he might not be able to resist hitting someone.","“Divine Doctor Li, don’t go too far! Who are you saying is 205? You can’t get such a high score yourself, so you insult others? What right do you have to say that?”","Li Zijun’s proposal aroused the approval of the surrounding cultivators.","Many people started talking in low voices, thinking that Huang Yueli had gone too far and wanted her to apologise.","However, at the next moment, everyone suddenly felt that the surrounding air froze in an instant, and the powerful black force swept from all directions, making all the cultivators present feel chills all over.","Everyone was startled suddenly. When they looked up, they saw Li Moying’s eyes were gloomy and cold, and a frightening chill radiated from his whole body.","“You want my woman to apologise?”","[1] It’s also means a stupid person."]},{"number":3894,"title":"Chapter 3894 Really Stupid (6)","paragraphs":["3894 Really Stupid (6)","Forced by Li Moying’s powerful aura, all the cultivators couldn’t even stand still.","However, they were so frightened that they almost fell onto their knees when they heard Li Moying’s words.","Other than shock, it was more of a thunderous shock!","Li Moying actually said... “My woman”!","To Li Zijun’s ears, these words were more like a thunderbolt from the sky, which made her unable to recover for a long time.","!!","The Young Master she adored and admired would actually admit that that damn girl was his woman! This...how was this possible? She must have heard it wrong!","Li Zijun raised her head in disbelief, but was stunned by Li Moying’s dark pupils that contained a murderous air. With her trembling lips, she could not utter a word.","Seeing this, Huang Yueli quickly raised her hand, tugged at Li Moying’s sleeve coyly.","“Alright, don’t be angry...”","Li Moying had a cold face, staring ahead, ignoring her, and the chill he emanated showed no signs of diminishing.","Huang Yueli’s eyes widened, a little surprised.","Li Zijun not only slandered her, but also encouraged other members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan to be hostile to her. It was not surprising that her husband would be enraged by such an act of suicide.","However, usually, as long as she nudges him, he would usually accede. What happened today? He didn’t even listen nor care about her?","“Moying? Are you really angry?” She tilted her head to look at him.","Li Moying snorted coldly, and finally opened his mouth, “So you know I’m angry?”","Uh oh, this meant that he was really angry!","What’s more, it’s not just angry with these idlers, even he was angry with her.","Huang Yueli opened her pink lips slightly, looking very surprised.","She felt aggrieved. No matter how much she thought about it, she couldn’t figure it out. She didn’t talk to other men today, and she didn’t risk getting hurt. What made this man unhappy?","Huang Yueli thought about it, but couldn’t think of a reason.","Li Moying glanced at her coldly, his aura suddenly increased, and the murderous aura in the surrounding air became more obvious!","Even Liu Buyan couldn’t take it anymore, and was clutching his chest, desperately giving Huang Yueli a look, signaling her to quickly deal with this murderous god at home.","However, for the sake of her Senior Brother’s life, she decided to appease her husband first.","She took a small step and leaned closer to Li Moying.","They were already standing very close to each other, so they were almost stuck together.","Huang Yueli stretched out her white and tender little hand, and her little finger caught one of Li Moying’s fingers, shaking it.","She blinked her big eyes and looked at Li Moying pitifully, but did not speak.","Li Moying felt the girl’s delicate fragrance coming from his side, and couldn’t help but feel a little distracted, and the profound force he exuded also weakened a bit.","Huang Yueli continued to work hard, her ten fingers grasping Li Moying’s fingers and intertwining them. At the same time, her middle finger was still on Li Moying’s palm and scratched lightly with her nails a few times.","The itchy feeling came from the palm of his hand and spread all the way to his heart.","Although it seemed to be nothing, it had successfully grasped his attention.","Li Moying’s adam’s apple visibly slid up and down, and with a strong hand, he suddenly pulled Huang Yueli into his arms.","With his movements, the surrounding pressure suddenly disappeared.","The cultivators present all let out a long breath of relief at the same time."]},{"number":3895,"title":"Chapter 3895 Really Stupid (7)","paragraphs":["3895 Really Stupid (7)","In just a dozen or so breaths, they seemed to have walked through the gate of hell.","After regaining their senses, they only felt that the clothes on their back were completely soaked in cold sweat, and felt like they had just escaped a catastrophe.","At this time, when everyone looked at Huang Yueli again, their eyes became more complicated.","Most of them have only heard of Li Moying’s reputation, and have never seen Li Moying make a move with their own eyes.","Before, I only knew that Li Moying was a god-level genius with tyrannical strength, but I never thought that he could be so powerful!","Obviously, they are geniuses who have been carefully selected among the tens of thousands of young members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, but Li Moying alone could completely crush them with the coercion of profound force, and not even let them resist a little bit. They did not dare even think about it.","What kind of strength gap was this!","For a moment, they thought that what they met was not a genius of the same generation, but the several thousand-year-old elders of the Life Profound Realm in the clan!","In addition, the interaction between Huang Yueli and Li Moying also shocked them deeply.","That little girl just acted coquettishly towards Li Moying, and smiled. The Young Master who has never been close to women seems to be a different person!","Until now, he still doesn’t want to let go!","Li Zijun was so angry that her face was distorted, and she could no longer maintain her usual calm and solemn demeanour.","She stared at Li Moying’s powerful hands that were clasped around Huang Yueli’s waist and her eyes were so wide that they looked as if her eyeballs were about to pop out.","Who doesn’t know that Li Moying hates getting too close to women the most. The last time a maid accidentally touched his hand, she was thrown out the distance of a mile by him and she almost died!","Therefore, no matter how much thoughts a woman has about Li Moying, she dare not touch him casually.","But now?","Li Moying held that little girl in his arms on his own initiative, and he refused to let go even when everyone was urging him.","Huang Yueli also had an ugly expression at this time, she never expected that Li Moying could hug her so naturally in front of so many people.","Although it’s true that they were married a long time ago, in public, ahem, we should pay attention, right?","She nudged Li Moying a few more times, but Li Moying remained motionless.","However, Li Moying didn’t let go of it because she hurt him. The strength of his little fox was no different than a tickle to him.","He was just afraid that if Huang Yueli kicked him again, she would hurt herself...","Huang Yueli finally shook off the sticky oil bottle on her back, quickly stood up straight, and coughed a few times forcefully.","“Ahem! Well... everyone, don’t pay attention to some... small accidents that happened just now.”","Everyone looked up at her with confused faces.","Don’t pay attention?","What happened just now was beyond their dreams!","Huang Yueli also knew that her words were embarrassing, so she quickly changed the subject, “Well... that, let’s get back to business! Young Miss Zijun, you just said that I scolded people, but I didn’t mean that at all? I just repeated the points shown on the tablet. Why? It’s clearly shown on the stone tablet, why don’t you let me read it?”","She had on a pure and innocent expression, as if she had been wronged by the heavens!"]},{"number":3896,"title":"Chapter 3896 Really Stupid (8)","paragraphs":["3896 Really Stupid (8)","Seeing this, Liu Buyan also came to his senses, and hurriedly said: “Yes, I am also puzzled! Young Miss Zijun, what did my Junior Sister say wrong? When did she scold anyone? Tell me clearly!”","When Li Zijun heard this, she couldn’t help recalling the scene at that time, and her face gradually turned pale.","Cultivators have excellent memories. Every word said at that time could be remembered by all the cultivators present.","Thinking about it carefully, Huang Yueli didn’t seem to have said anything excessive. It was Li Zijun who first asked her if she knew what the score of Follower No. 2 meant, and she answered “two hundred and five”.","And this score was clearly written, what, did she want her to answer 206 instead of 205?","The cultivators looked at each other, and felt that they seemed to be a little overboard on placing the blame on Huang Yueli, so they lowered their heads and dared not speak.","Li Moying snorted coldly, “Didn’t I say to apologise just now? Now everyone is dumb?”","The cultivators were all terrified, and immediately reacted, apologising to Huang Yueli.","“Divine Doctor Li, I’m really sorry about what happened!”","“I’m sorry, it’s because we can’t speak our minds, we should be the ones apologising to you!”","“That’s right, you are a magnanimous person, please don’t mind the likes of us! We only listened to Young Miss Zijun’s words, so we were misled.”","Li Zijun listened to what the cultivators around her said, and almost fainted!","This gang of spineless fools, when they saw the Young Master standing by that woman’s side, immediately rushed to flatter her! They don’t have the backbone as a member of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","Although the damn girl just now did not directly scold people, but her tone of voice, and the look in her eyes looking down on all sentient beings, as long as anyone with a little brain can’t get it wrong, she was just satirising them!","Li Zijun was furious, but what Huang Yueli said was flawless, and there were no nothing to be picked.","From the analysis of what she said, one can only draw the conclusion that Li Zijun was suspicious of others.","Li Zijun was depressed when she heard Li Moying’s voice again, “Li Zijun, what do you have to say?”","Li Zijun almost bit her lips so hard that it was about to bleed.","If Li Moying was willing to call her by her name and say a word to her specifically, even if he was scolding her, she would be happy with it.","However, this time, Li Moying condescended to speak to her in order to force her to apologise to his beloved woman!","But the calmer she was, the more Li Zijun’s heart seemed to be burned by fire.","Because, in Li Zijun’s view, Huang Yueli was able to be so calm because of her Young Master’s backing!","This woman has no ability, just by hugging the Young Master’s thigh, she can despise her like this!","At this moment, Li Zijun had completely forgotten that she was humiliated like this, all because of herself. If she didn’t want to squeeze Huang Yueli, she wouldn’t be in such an embarrassing situation. After all, Huang Yueli didn’t take her seriously at all, so it was impossible for her to take the initiative to trouble her.","However, no matter how unwilling Li Zijun was, she could only lower her head under Li Moying’s cold gaze.","“Li... Divine Doctor Li, I didn’t... didn’t hear clearly just now, I misunderstood what you meant, and wrongly blamed you. I’m... I’m sorry!”"]},{"number":3897,"title":"Chapter 3897 Is There Such A Rule? (1)","paragraphs":["3897 Is There Such A Rule? (1)","Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows slightly, with a faint smile on the corner of her mouth, she said in an unhurried manner, “Young Miss Zijun, you are too polite. It’s just a small matter, and it’s my fault that I didn’t speak clearly, which caused you to misunderstand.”","With such an elegant posture, she deliberately took the responsibility on herself, which was in stark contrast to Li Zijun’s sharp and excited look just now.","The cultivators present had already seen the performance of the two of them.","As the saying goes, if you compare people, you will die, and if you compare goods, you will throw them away.","Li Zijun usually looks elegant and calm, with the demeanor of a master, but now standing in front of Huang Yueli, after comparing, there was a difference between the superior and the inferior.","Although the cultivators didn’t say anything, they looked at them differently.","Li Zijun noticed this and was so angry that he almost vomited blood!","This damn girl was really good at putting on a show!","It was clearly Huang Yueli who scolded others first, but now she has been completely exonerated, and instead made her Li Zijun a bad person!","It’s just too embarrassing!","Li Zijun was so angry that her body trembled a little. She also knew that under the current situation, it was impossible for her to change everyone’s views. She could only accept this loss!","However, she was not reconciled to asking her to swallow this breath directly.","Confused, she stood in front of Huang Yueli, staring at her firmly, unwilling to back away.","Seeing that the scene seemed to be at a stalemate, Liu Buyan who was behind Huang Yueli raised his eyebrows and stood up.","“That’s all right, all right, isn’t it just a misunderstanding? There’s no need to waste so much time on this matter! Didn’t you just say that Young Miss Zijun and my Junior Sister want to gamble? Why don’t we continue to compete now?”","When Li Zijun heard this, he suddenly woke up like a dream.","By the way, she’s been waiting here for so long today in order to give that damned girl a run for her money! It was to let her see the gap between herself and the geniuses of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","She almost forgot about such an important matter just now.","That damn girl must have done it on purpose. Do you think that this will make her give up gambling?","Li Zijun immediately stood up straight, and hurriedly said: “Why was there no competition? Of course there will be a competition! I was wrong to blame Divine Doctor Li earlier, but this does not affect our competition.”","Because of the embarrassment just now, Li Zijun was afraid that others would say gossip, so this time she spoke extra cautiously and politely. Looking at the appropriate smile on her face, it seemed that she really treated Huang Yueli as a distinguished guest from the bottom of her heart. up.","Huang Yueli glanced at her and smiled.","This Li Zijun... was really of a high rank, so he can hold his breath!","It’s a pity, no matter how calm and composed she is, it’s impossible to please her today.","Huang Yueli smiled and said: “I don’t need to make any preparations, but...Young Miss Zijun, you don’t seem to have entered the Illusion Array yet, right? This was different from what we agreed on? When we made a bet earlier, I heard What do you mean, should you want to participate in this competition in person? Why are only a few of your friends participating now?”","When Li Zijun heard this, he almost couldn’t help cursing!","Of course she did it on purpose for not entering the Illusion Array herself!"]},{"number":3898,"title":"Chapter 3898 Is There Such A Rule? (2)","paragraphs":["3898 Is There Such A Rule? (2)","Li Zijun felt that she had a high status in the clan, so she had no intention of entering the Illusion Array before Huang Yueli.","If she really did this, wouldn’t she be demeaning herself? In the eyes of outsiders, it seems that her status was not as good as that damn girl!","She deliberately brought these few followers here to raise her status.","From Li Zijun’s point of view, she has already sent two followers into the Illusion Array, which has already shown her sincerity, which was completely justified.","Huang Yueli, but anyone who knows a little bit about etiquette should know that one should bend and stretch at times. If she sent someone else, that damn girl should just accept this order.","!!","But who knows, Huang Yueli has no intention of giving in at all, insisting that Li Zijun enter the Illusion Array before her.","Li Zijun couldn’t hold back, and glared at Huang Yueli. The amiable facade that she had put on could no longer continue and her expression was beginning to crack.","“Divine Doctor Li, you just said that the rules of the competition were set by me, so my side should first enter. This is true, hence I have no objection. However, two clansmen on my side have already entered. Our sincerity is enough, no matter what, someone should start on your side, right? My people have been competing in the Illusion Array all this while and you’re just watching from the sidelines, isn’t that the same thing?”","With a helpless look on her face, Li Zijun questioned Huang Yueli.","She thought she said this very well, and no one could refute it.","Although the side that sets the rules of the game should leave the field first, generally speaking, it was true that one side sends one person to enter at intervals.","This was the unspoken rule of the formal competition.","Only this time, Huang Yueli was the only one on her side.","According to what Li Zijun said, Huang Yueli herself had to enter first.","The cultivators present all stared at the two of them, looked back and forth, and watched the flames and undercurrents surge between the two of them, they were all secretly frightened!","The Young Master’s charm was really too great!","And women are strong enough to compete, but it’s just the minutiae of getting off the court first and then getting off the court, and they can still compete to this extent.","However, most people felt that Huang Yueli had to give in this time.","After all, Li Zijun came prepared and brought so many followers.","Huang Yueli stared at Li Zijun for a while, thought about it, but didn’t intend to persist any longer.","However, the moment she was about to speak, Li Moying’s cold voice suddenly sounded above her head.","“According to what Young Miss Zijun said, Divine Doctor Li only needs to send one person into the Illusion Array. In fact, she doesn’t have to appear in person, does she?”","No one expected that Li Moying, who had been silent all this time, would suddenly speak.","Everyone was startled.","Thinking about the meaning of his words, she broke out in a cold sweat.","What the Young Master meant...couldn’t be...that he wanted to stand by Huang Yueli’s side and support her as her teammate, right? ?","Li Zijun thought of this immediately, his face turned pale, and he looked at Li Moying in disbelief.","“Young...Young Master? Do you want...to compete for Divine Doctor Li? This...this...”","Li Moying’s eyes were cold, “Why not? I’m her man!”"]},{"number":3899,"title":"Chapter 3899 Is There Such A Rule? (3)","paragraphs":["3899 Is There Such A Rule? (3)","“Competing for her in her team, no one can object.”","Li Moying’s voice was cold, with almost no ups and downs. It was a completely natural tone.","However, these words of his sounded like a thunderbolt, which exploded in the ears of everyone present.","Their wise and mighty Young Master actually claimed that he was the man of Divine Doctor Li in front of so many clansmen!","This was even more shocking than him admitting that Divine Doctor Li was the woman he likes!","Because, this means that Li Moying has put himself on an equal footing with Huang Yueli!","Li Zijun’s eyes darkened and she almost fainted.","She never thought that not only was it useless to press Huang Yueli every step of the way, but instead, Huang Yueli was protected by the Young Master again and again!","At first, all the clansmen present regarded Huang Yueli as a vixen who seduced the Young Master, but now, who doesn’t know how much the Young Master values her?","Li Zijun bit the tip of her tongue hard, and the pain came, which made her barely awake.","She said with a trembling voice: “Young...Young Master, you are not... not in compliance with the rules! When we made the bet, we had clearly agreed that... the points of Divine Doctor Li in the Illusion Array shall prevail! No, You said that you can be replaced by others... You didn’t mention it before, but now you regret it, this...”","When Li Zijun said this, her calves kept shaking.","It was Li Moying’s condescending eyes looking down at her, it was too cold, that kind of strong and ruthless oppression made her almost out of breath.","Even she herself admired herself for being able to finish this passage completely.","Li Moying didn’t take her protest seriously at all, and sneered coldly, “You alone are worthy of telling me the rules? You brought so many clansmen to bully Divine Doctor Li, what kind of situation is this? Heh, does our Cloudy Qilin Clan have such rules?”","“I...”","When Li Zijun was facing Huang Yueli, she was able to flip her words around, but under Li Moying’s cold and stern gaze, she was completely unable to utter a word of refute.","It’s not like she can’t think of a reason if she really wants to mess around.","However, she just didn’t dare to say it in front of Li Moying. After all, no one wants to look like a shrew in front of their male god.","Li Moying said again: “I was able to bring Divine Doctor Liu and Divine Doctor Li in because they are my saviours! I have a sworn brotherhood with Divine Doctor Liu, even if I bring them to the place of experience, it was through the Patriarch’s agreeing personally. Whoever dares to spread the word everywhere and turn the truth upside down, don’t blame me for being rude!”","When he said this, he suddenly felt the clothes around his waist tighten.","Looking down, Huang Yueli was tugging at his clothes again.","Li Moying didn’t expect his little fox to object again, he couldn’t help frown slightly as he lowered his gaze and looked at her.","Huang Yueli gave him a placating smile, “Young Master Li, thank you for standing up for me, but today’s competition has nothing to do with you, and I personally agreed to the bet. Speaking of which, you joining is indeed against the rules. You are the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan! How can you contend against Young Miss Zijun? If this spreads out, others will think that Young Miss Zijun is too ignorant.”","When Li Zijun heard this, she clenched his fists tightly."]},{"number":3900,"title":"Chapter 3900 Is There Such A Rule? (4)","paragraphs":["3900 Is There Such A Rule? (4)","Her nails were deeply embedded in her palms.","This damn girl dug a hole for her again!","After being said by that damn girl, it seemed that Li Zijun didn’t understand the rules at all, and actually forced the Young Master to compete in front of her!","If this gets to the ears of the Patriarch and elders, they will definitely think it was her fault.","Moreover, Huang Yueli spoke as if she was thinking about her.","After putting her in such a situation, she could only grit her teeth and even thank her!","Li Zijun gritted her teeth and said, “Divine Doctor Li is right. I didn’t think carefully just now. Of course, I can’t let the Young Master join in. How about this, I’ll send someone...”","Halfway through her words, Huang Yueli suddenly shook her head.","“Young Miss Zijun, what you said just now was correct. It’s indeed my turn to play. Otherwise, others will think that I am bullying you with the support of the Young Master!”","Li Zijun almost vomited blood!","Could it be that this damn girl was bullying her with the backing of the Young Master?","However, after thinking about it, she became a little happier.","From what that damn girl meant, was she planning to enter the Illusion Array herself?","Finally, she took the initiative to admit that she bowed her head, which means she was a little self-aware!","But who knows, Huang Yueli followed closely but looked at Liu Buyan who was behind her, and changed the topic, “Then I will trouble you, Senior Brother.”","Liu Buyan nodded with a smile, and walked forward a few steps, “It’s not troublesome, it should be. Young Miss Zijun thinks that foreigners enter the training ground and break the rules of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, so I am also a foreigner, hence this bet was originally related to me.”","Liu Buyan gave a cursory glance at Li Moying and said: “Then I will go in. Coincidentally, after studying for so long, I also want to see how much my strength has improved.”","Li Moying raised his eyebrows and glanced at him, “It’s very dangerous in the Illusion Array, if you can’t do it, come out early, so as not to be embarrassed later and put your Junior Sister to shame.”","After hearing this, Huang Yueli couldn’t help but roll her eyes, and stared at the sky speechlessly.","The meaning in her husband’s words was clearly that she was worried that Liu Buyan would not adapt well and get injured in the Illusion Array when she just arrived.","However, you must say it in that tone.","Maybe, others will think that the two of them have a grudge against each other!","Then he entered the Illusion Array.","When Li Zijun saw Liu Buyan’s figure disappear into the illusion, and heard what Li Moying said, her eyes lit up.","She has seen Liu Buyan’s strength with her own eyes before.","Judging from Li Moying’s tone, he also despises a weak Spirit Medicine Divine Doctor like him.","Since that damn girl refuses to end, it’s not bad to let Liu Buyan lose first.","She still remembered that just now Liu Buyan also laughed at her and the Follower No. 2 who had scored 205.","Just wait for a minute, Liu Buyan will definitely not even be able to reach 205. At that time, she can take the opportunity to laugh at him and let him know that he was not even as good as 205!","Thinking of this, Li Zijun cheered up a little, and walked towards the stone tablet quickly.","She moved so fast that she almost bumped into the person in front of her.","Li Zijun looked up, only to realise that Huang Yueli had also walked to the side of the stone tablet at some point, and also stared at the score on it with wide eyes, very focused.","“You...” Li Zijun looked at Huang Yueli’s anxious expression, and a trace of sarcasm appeared on the corner of her mouth.","“You know how to be nervous? It’s a pity that your strength should be what it is. Even if you stare at the stone tablet until you bore a hole in it, your Senior Brother’s points will not increase at all!”"]}]);
